- DNS fastmeals.com.br\n\nDiagrams:\n- docs/diagrams/images/ — 7 PNG exports\n- docs/diagrams/xml/ — 7 editable .drawio files","tree":{"sha":"7828b56288255862dd4e0b05dac6809ccc0f1847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/7828b56288255862dd4e0b05dac6809ccc0f1847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDE4N2VlOTU5OGVjYmE4OGMzMThiZWViM2M5ZDI1NzIxNTIzM2ZiODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/acb947f163032ee9c3166b27c56ee19c2220b5c5","sha":"acb947f163032ee9c3166b27c56ee19c2220b5c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/acb947f163032ee9c3166b27c56ee19c2220b5c5"}],"sha":"187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/acb947f163032ee9c3166b27c56ee19c2220b5c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T15:05:39Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T15:05:39Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(ci): add GitHub Actions pipelines for CI/CD\n\nPipelines:\n- ci-backend: test 6 services in parallel (matrix strategy)\n- ci-frontend: type check, tests, build\n- deploy-lambdas: build + zip + update 20 Lambda functions\n- deploy-frontend: docker build amd64 + ECR push + ECS deploy\n- terraform: plan on PR, apply on merge to main\n\nTriggers:\n- CI on push to development/main (path filtered)\n- Deploy on push to main or manual dispatch\n- Terraform plan on PR, apply on merge","tree":{"sha":"75e9110d54bc051258