nd status\n- Domain URL: https://fastmeals.com.br","tree":{"sha":"847960ba545e70d7291a18cb12689add18eabaf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/847960ba545e70d7291a18cb12689add18eabaf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/68e3b6d97ca91efa575885ae3700d743de611b8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/68e3b6d97ca91efa575885ae3700d743de611b8c","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDY4ZTNiNmQ5N2NhOTFlZmE1NzU4ODVhZTM3MDBkNzQzZGU2MTFiOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff","sha":"7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff"}],"sha":"68e3b6d97ca91efa575885ae3700d743de611b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/68e3b6d97ca91efa575885ae3700d743de611b8c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T13:40:33Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T13:40:33Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(terraform): replace Amplify with ECS Fargate for frontend deployment\n\nECS Fargate Module:\n- ECR repository with lifecycle policy (keep last 5 images)\n- ECS Cluster with Container Insights enabled\n- Fargate task definition: 0.25 vCPU, 512MB RAM, Node 20\n- ECS Service with desired count 1, auto scaling up to 3\n- Application Load Balancer in public subnets (HTTP port 80)\n- ALB target group with health check on /api/health\n- Security groups: ALB (80/443 from anywhere), ECS tasks (3000 from ALB only)\n- CloudWatch logs /ecs/fastmeals-frontend with 14-day retention\n- Auto scaling policy: scale out when CPU > 70%\n- Deploy script for ECR push + ECS force deployment\n\nAPI Gateway Module (separated from Lambda):\n- HTTP API with 23 routes mapped to 20 Lambda functions\n- CORS configuration for frontend domain + localhost\n- Access logs in JSON with rate limiting (100 burst, 50/s)\n- Lambda invoke permissions for all functions\n\nRemoved Amplify:\n- Replaced Amplify app and branch with ECS Fargate\n- Removed github_repository, github_access_token, amplify_branch variables\n- Frontend now deployed via docker push to ECR + ECS update-service\n\nFrontend accessible at:\n- ALB: http://fastmeals-alb-1528425881.us-east-1.elb.amazonaws.com\n- Build requires --platform linux/amd64 flag for Fargate compatibility","tree":{"sha":"6ba1f73286c3b19b2eb04d2a795fbab0db1222eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/6ba1f73286c3b19b2eb04d2a795fbab0db1222eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDdiZDQ3NjM0Zjc3ZGRmZDI5ZjhkOGM4N2IxZTkzYTVlZTA1ODdiZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f","sha":"cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f"}],"sha":"7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/7bd47634f77ddfd29f8d8c87b1e93a5ee0587bff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T11:36:07Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T11:36:07Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(terraform): add Lambda functions, API Gateway and Amplify frontend modules\n\nLambda Module:\n- 20 Lambda functions with placeholder code (deploy via CI/CD)\n- IAM Role with CloudWatch, VPC Access, Secrets Manager, Bedrock policies\n- Per-function environment variables (DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL, RABBITMQ_URL)\n- CloudWatch Log Groups with 14-day retention\n- All functions in VPC private subnets\n\nAPI Gateway Module (separated):\n- HTTP API with 23 routes mapped to Lambda functions\n- CORS configuration for frontend domain + localhost\n- Access logs in JSON (requestId, IP, method, path, status, latency)\n- Rate limiting: 100 burst, 50/s\n- Lambda invoke permissions for all functions\n\nFrontend Module (Amplify):\n- Next.js 15 SSR via WEB_COMPUTE platform\n- Auto-deploy on push to development branch\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL pointing to API Gateway\n- Monorepo build spec (frontend/ subdirectory)\n\nInfrastructure outputs:\n- API Gateway: https://j7193c8hbe.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com\n- Amplify: https://development.d23v8aou3w1xe5.amplifyapp.com\n- 20 Lambda function names\n- All secret names for reference and add fix: add .nvmrc for Amplify Node version","tree":{"sha":"9043b7645264e2d0a31c7ca86034e5ada426b971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/9043b7645264e2d0a31c7ca86034e5ada426b971"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKGNlZjk1ODhkNzY2ZjU2Yzg0MTFkZTJmY2JjMGRhMzFlNTE4NjFiNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/dbe17ea7fd17f20b4b8145f74f72df8b324989ba","sha":"dbe17ea7fd17f20b4b8145f74f72df8b324989ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/dbe17ea7fd17f20b4b8145f74f72df8b324989ba"}],"sha":"cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/cef9588d766f56c8411de2fcbc0da31e51861b4f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/dbe17ea7fd17f20b4b8145f74f72df8b324989ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T09:51:50Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T09:51:50Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(terraform): add secrets manager, database, cache and messaging modules\n\nSecrets Manager:\n- 9 secrets: RDS master, 5 service DBs, JWT, RabbitMQ, Bedrock\n- All ARNs exported for Lambda IAM policies\n- recovery_window_in_days=0 for dev flexibility\n- Sensitive values via secrets.tfvars (gitignored)\n\nDatabase (RDS PostgreSQL 16):\n- db.t3.micro with gp3 storage (20-50GB autoscaling)\n- Private subnets with RDS security group\n- 5 databases created: auth_db, products_db, orders_db, delivery_db, reports_db\n- Encrypted storage, 7-day backup retention\n- Users/grants delegated to Lambda Prisma migrations\n\nCache (ElastiCache Redis 7.1):\n- cache.t3.micro single node in private subnets\n- Redis URL output ready for auth-service\n\nMessaging (Amazon MQ RabbitMQ 3.13):\n- mq.t3.micro single instance in private subnet\n- AMQPS endpoint for secure connections\n- General logs enabled\n- Console URL for management access\n\nInfrastructure outputs:\n- RDS endpoint: fastmeals-postgres.*.rds.amazonaws.com\n- Redis endpoint: fastmeals-redis.*.cache.amazonaws.com\n- MQ endpoint: amqps://b-*.mq.us-east-1.on.aws:5671\n- All secret names for reference","tree":{"sha":"916de9657dd9ce1d702fdefa4617c18b30c098da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/916de9657dd9ce1d702fdefa4617c18b30c098da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fas