uction apply with confirmation\n- destroy.sh: production destroy preserving bootstrap","tree":{"sha":"5a1d651ce1a345d4478acdea0ea10f3a7444a186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/5a1d651ce1a345d4478acdea0ea10f3a7444a186"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/957bfeeac4b6c39983b12a39e26421239ca2bc47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/957bfeeac4b6c39983b12a39e26421239ca2bc47","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDk1N2JmZWVhYzRiNmMzOTk4M2IxMmEzOWUyNjQyMTIzOWNhMmJjNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2","sha":"11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2"}],"sha":"957bfeeac4b6c39983b12a39e26421239ca2bc47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/957bfeeac4b6c39983b12a39e26421239ca2bc47"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T08:25:11Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T08:25:11Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"docs: add screenshots of frontend screens, Swagger docs and Docker services\n\nFrontend Screenshots:\n- Dashboard overview with animated stats and charts\n- Orders page with table/kanban views\n- Products page with grid and detail modal\n- Delivery page with driver kanban and optimization\n- Reports page with graphs and AI insights\n- Login page and dark/light mode\n\nBackend Screenshots:\n- Auth service Swagger (/docs)\n- Products service Swagger (/docs)\n- Orders service Swagger (/docs)\n- Delivery service Swagger (/docs)\n- Optimization service Swagger (/docs)\n- Reports service Swagger (/docs)\n\nGeneral:\n- Docker Compose with all 14 containers running","tree":{"sha":"628541cb7ad436c934aa1d8079586635568d55e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/628541cb7ad436c934aa1d8079586635568d55e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDExMjM2ZmU4NmM0YTMyYzdlYTgxNTRmYTFhODJmZDg2MGYxY2ExYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c","sha":"5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c"}],"sha":"11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/11236fe86c4a32c7ea8154fa1a82fd860f1ca1a2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T08:03:58Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T08:03:58Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"fix(docker): update Dockerfiles lock files and entrypoint permissions\n\n- Run npm install in all services to sync package-lock.json with new deps\n- Move COPY entrypoint.sh and chmod before USER directive\n- Remove redundant USER root/USER switch pattern\n- Single USER directive per Dockerfile for cleaner security model","tree":{"sha":"ba6ee43963ef3d5b9e99176232b5842b9984af10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/ba6ee43963ef3d5b9e99176232b5842b9984af10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDUxMzNiOGYzMzJjOGJiMDM3OWU1N2FlMzg4NzY5NzEzNjg4MTdlM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e","sha":"3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e"}],"sha":"5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/5133b8f332c8bb0379e57ae38876971368817e3c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T07:31:22Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T07:31:22Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(backend): add Pino structured logger, Swagger docs and auto-seed entrypoint\n\nPino Logger (all 6 services):\n- Replace morgan with pino-http for structured JSON logging\n- Add src/infrastructure/config/logger.ts with service name, timestamp, level\n- Replace all console.log/warn/error with logger.info/warn/error\n- Auto-logging ignores /health endpoint\n- SERVICE_NAME env var added to docker-compose\n\nSwagger OpenAPI (all 6 services):\n- Add /docs endpoint with swagger-ui-express\n- Auth: login, refresh-token\n- Products: CRUD with pagination, search, category filters\n- Orders: CRUD, status transitions, assign delivery person\n- Delivery: CRUD with availability filter\n- Optimization: optimize-assignment with response schema\n- Reports: revenue, orders-by-status, top-products, delivery-time, ai-insights\n- Health check includes docs URL\n\nAuto-seed Entrypoint (5 services with DB):\n- Add entrypoint.sh: prisma migrate deploy + prisma db seed before server start\n- Update Dockerfiles to use entrypoint.sh as CMD\n- docker compose up --build now auto-seeds without prepare script\n- Optimization service keeps direct CMD (stateless, no DB)","tree":{"sha":"701709095274561e6b206aae9654e56a04997291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/701709095274561e6b206aae9654e56a04997291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDNhZWMwYWNlZTRiNGZlZjA0ZjM1NmEyNmI1ZThjZWU3NGQ0ZmUxMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4","sha":"c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4"}],"sha":"3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/3aec0acee4b4fef04f356a26b5e8cee74d4fe10e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T06:17:21Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T06:17:21Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat: add orders-service Lambda handlers and root README\n\nOrders Service Lambda Handlers (5):\n- orders-list: GET /api/orders with pagination, status filter, sorting\n- orders-get: GET /api/orders/:id with validation\n- orders-create: POST /api/orders with ProductServiceClient for price snapshot\n- orders-update-status: PATCH /api/orders/:id/status with state machine\n- orders-assign-delivery: PATCH /api/orders/:id/assign with DeliveryServiceClient\n- All handlers use correct client imports (ProductServiceClient, DeliveryServiceClient)\n- RabbitMQ EventPublisher excluded from Lambda (not available in AWS Lambda)\n- CORS headers with process.env.CORS_ORIGIN fallback\n\nRoot README.md:\n- Shields with all 14 technologies\n- Video demo placeholder (YouTube/GIF)\n- Architecture diagram (ASCII + patterns description)\n- How to run: Docker (3 commands) + local development\n- Full stack table (backend + frontend)\n- 6 microservices with ports, databases and test counts\n- Inter-service communication diagram\n- Order state machine with transition rules\n- Frontend 6 screens with UX highlights\n- Hungarian Algorithm + Haversine explanation with performance benchmarks\n- 180+ tests distributed across services\n- Project structure tree\n- Documentation links\n- Environment variables reference\n- Docker 14 containers table","tree":{"sha":"c81fb96eb6f2f29f6e5750e8ee095f2ec8db0f13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/c81fb96eb6f2f29f6e5750e8ee095f2ec8db0f13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKGMwNTY1YjhjNTVjODk1ZjFhZjc3NzhkNGM2NzYwYTZkYjQ3NjhhYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/6f321ad631d2c4d611532a477737ce365a70d6ff","sha":"6f321ad631d2c4d611532a477737ce365a70d6ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/6f321ad631d2c4d611532a477737ce365a70d6ff"}],"sha":"c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/c0565b8c55c895f1af7778d4c6760a6db4768ab4"},{"author