ata\n- Date picker filter updates all 4 report endpoints\n- Daily revenue chart with dual bars (revenue + orders count)\n- Show time in seconds when < 1 minute\n- Filter out unknown vehicle types from charts\n- Add emoji labels to vehicle chart (🏍️ Moto, 🚲 Bicicleta, 🚗 Carro)\n\nDelivery Page:\n- Add driver-kanban component: 3 columns (Available/Busy/Inactive)\n- Busy drivers show current order details (customer, address, ID)\n- View toggle between cards and kanban\n- Fix delivery filter: detect busy drivers from orders with delivering status\n\nOrders:\n- Add order-create-modal with product cart, phone mask, customer info\n- Show driver names in order table (batch fetch from delivery API)\n- Manual driver assignment with select showing busy disabled\n- Hide cancel button for delivering status\n- Restrict all action buttons for viewer role in order-table\n\nBackend:\n- Add 5 Lambda handlers for orders-service (list, get, create, update-status, assign-delivery)","tree":{"sha":"421ab850694a10c51f7ac26c56a74861bdb810fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/421ab850694a10c51f7ac26c56a74861bdb810fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/f0e9ba44da0f9b41d6b71e9499c48836a1f7a557","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/f0e9ba44da0f9b41d6b71e9499c48836a1f7a557","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKGYwZTliYTQ0ZGEwZjliNDFkNmI3MWU5NDk5YzQ4ODM2YTFmN2E1NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f","sha":"a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f"}],"sha":"f0e9ba44da0f9b41d6b71e9499c48836a1f7a557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/f0e9ba44da0f9b41d6b71e9499c48836a1f7a557"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T16:38:02Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T16:38:02Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"fix(frontend): restrict viewer permissions on order actions and optimization\n\n- Add canWrite check to order-table dropdown (hide status actions for viewer)\n- Import useRole hook in order-table component\n- Viewer only sees \"Ver detalhes\" in order dropdown menu\n- Update optimization empty state message for viewer users\n- Viewer sees \"Somente administradores podem executar a otimização\" message","tree":{"sha":"88e0422dd39f988a7442e35e140bbdacc33a5c9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/88e0422dd39f988a7442e35e140bbdacc33a5c9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKGE2NTgxZDFjZTA5OWJlYTRkYzBhYjVmNTM5NTdmZDIwZjQ5ZDk1N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67","sha":"a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67"}],"sha":"a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a6581d1ce099bea4dc0ab5f53957fd20f49d957f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T09:36:26Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T09:36:26Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(frontend): add delivery CRUD modals, driver kanban, order creation, manual assignment and fixes\n\nDelivery Management:\n- Add delivery-form-modal: create/edit with phone mask, vehicle select, active toggle\n- Add delivery-detail-modal: profile view with stats, GPS, current order\n- Add driver-kanban: 3 columns (Available/Busy/Inactive) with order details\n- Add delete confirmation dialog for delivery persons\n- Fix driver filter: detect busy drivers from orders with status delivering\n- View toggle: cards/kanban for drivers tab\n\nOrder Management:\n- Add order-create-modal: customer info, product search grid, cart with +/- quantity\n- Phone mask formatting (XX) XXXXX-XXXX for order creation\n- Manual driver assignment in order detail modal with select dropdown\n- Show busy drivers as disabled \"(em entrega)\" in assignment select\n- Show driver name and vehicle in order detail modal (fetched from API)\n- Show driver names in orders table (batch fetch from delivery API)\n- Hide cancel button for delivering status orders\n- Show warning when order needs driver before delivering\n\nProducts:\n- Fix product-card: isAvailable instead of active, remove stock, translate categories\n- Fix product-table: remove stock column, add prep time, translate categories\n- Fix product-form-modal: remove stock field, fix categories to backend values\n- Fix product-form-modal: imageUrl sends null when empty, isAvailable mapping\n- Fix product image: update invalid Unsplash page URL to direct image URL\n\nGeneral:\n- Fix CORS: rebuild Nginx to clear cached duplicate headers\n- Add Columns3 and LayoutGrid imports for view toggles","tree":{"sha":"de2a81ff8e1d9238e130de31f4d6f8c8e6c9f4d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/de2a81ff8e1d9238e130de31f4d6f8c8e6c9f4d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKGE1YWRjZDRmYmQ4YTI4YmFkOGVlYjRmZGY1MGE2OGJhM2ZkZDZmNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f","sha":"6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f"}],"sha":"a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a5adcd4fbd8a28bad8eeb4fdf50a68ba3fdd6f67"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T16:27:21Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T16:27:21Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"fix: resolve CORS duplicate headers, add responsive mobile menu and cleanup\n\nCORS Fix:\n- Rebuild Nginx container to clear cached CORS headers\n- Remove commented CORS lines from nginx.conf\n- Confirm Express handles CORS exclusively (no Nginx headers)\n\nMobile Responsiveness:\n- Move Header component to dashboard layout (renders on all pages)\n- Remove duplicate Header from orders and overview pages\n- Hamburger menu triggers mobileMenuOpen in all pages\n- Responsive padding in layout (p-4 sm:p-6)\n\nBug Fixes:\n- Fix order-detail-modal: camelCase/snake_case fallbacks for all fields\n- Fix order-detail-modal: status transitions (pending→preparing→ready→delivering→delivered)\n- Fix order-kanban: add delivering to Record<OrderStatus>\n- Fix status-badge: add delivering status with label and colors\n- Fix orders-store: handle array response from ordersApi.getAll\n- Fix use-reports: remove non-existent getSummary call\n- Fix delivery-store: use deliveryApi.update instead of non-existent updateStatus\n- Fix auth-stove non-existent authApi.logout call, clear persist on logout\n- Fix Dockerfile: add NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL as build ARG\n- Fix docker-compose: add build args for frontend API URL","tree":{"sha":"82b8d81ca82a6abca58dc8b0710b7d2d0c2f5584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/82b8d81ca82a6abca58dc8b0710b7d2d0c2f5584"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDY4NDlkNGI0M2I3MDBiNTI0NzA2MjkyNTNmMzRkMWM5YzM4ZTc3NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/80c004f7f931a2cf5ff9d767ad851c4d39ca46d8","sha":"80c004f7f931a2cf5ff9d767ad851c4d39ca46d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/80c004f7f931a2cf5ff9d767ad851c4d39ca46d8"}],"sha":"6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/6849d4b43b700b52470629253f34d1c9c38e776f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/80c004f7f931a2cf5ff9d767ad851c4d39ca46d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T06:16:32Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T06:16:32Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(frontend): add tests, dark/light theme, responsive sidebar and product detail modal\n\nTesting (27 tests passing):\n- Vitest + React Testing Library + jsdom setup\n- EmptyState: 5 tests (render, types, custom props, action button)\n- StatCard: 6 tests (render, loading skeleton, change indicators, click, variants)\n- StatusBadge: 5 tests (all statuses, sizes, labels)\n- Product Filter: 3 tests (user input, clear, value reflection)\n- Login Flow: 5 tests (render, submit credentials, error display, loading state)\n- useAnimatedCounter: 3 tests (initial value, zero target, custom duration)\n\nTheme System:\n- Dark/Light mode toggle with next-themes ThemeProvider\n- Sun/Moon animated icon in header\n- Default theme: dark\n- Toaster colors use CSS variables for theme adaptation\n- globals.css already has light (:root) and dark (.dark) variables\n\nResponsive Design:\n- Mobile sidebar with overlay and slide animation\n- Hamburger menu button in header (lg:hidden)\n- Auto-close sidebar on route change and resize to desktop\n- mobileMenuOpen state added to ui-store\n- Responsive padding, gaps and text sizes throughout\n\nProduct Detail Modal:\n- Full-width image with availability badge overlay\n- Category labels and colors (meal/drink/dessert/side)\n- Price, preparation time, description\n- Edit/Delete actions for admin users\n- Blurred backdrop (backdrop-blur-md), max-w-2xl\n- DialogTitle with sr-only for accessibility\n\nSidebar Improvements:\n- Collapse/expand button always visible (rounded gold circle)\n- ChevronLeft rotates 180° when collapsed\n- Desktop collapse and mobile close as separate buttons\n- Favicon updated to UtensilsCrossed SVG icon","tree":{"sha":"24eb59517daf7628db253fb943131a4376670e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/24eb59517daf7628db253fb943131a4376670e32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/80c004f7f931a2cf5ff9d767ad851c4d39ca46d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/80c004f7f931a2cf5ff9d767ad851c4d39ca46d8","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDgwYzAwNGY3ZjkzMWEyY2Y1ZmY5ZDc2N2FkODUxYzRkMzljYTQ2ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/17a559bbb1a9d238f9ce2e41e6b55