ok)","tree":{"sha":"476bc0dc21217c96c296f4dd7e35b656c2b19f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/476bc0dc21217c96c296f4dd7e35b656c2b19f57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/17a559bbb1a9d238f9ce2e41e6b5561c7f8d127a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/17a559bbb1a9d238f9ce2e41e6b5561c7f8d127a","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDE3YTU1OWJiYjFhOWQyMzhmOWNlMmU0MWU2YjU1NjFjN2Y4ZDEyN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe","sha":"7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe"}],"sha":"17a559bbb1a9d238f9ce2e41e6b5561c7f8d127a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/17a559bbb1a9d238f9ce2e41e6b5561c7f8d127a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T23:08:12Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T23:08:12Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"feat(frontend): integrate real API endpoints, fix order/delivery/products pages\n\nFrontend API Integration:\n- Fix api.ts: align all endpoints with backend (optimize-assignment, assign, average-delivery-time)\n- Remove authApi.logout() and authApi.me() (not in backend)\n- Fix ordersApi: PATCH for assign with deliveryPersonId, cancel via status update\n- Fix productsApi: toggleAvailability via PUT, handle paginated responses\n- Fix deliveryApi: remove non-existent /api/deliveries endpoint\n- Add getDashboardMetrics consolidating 4 report endpoints\n\nOrders Page:\n- Replace mock data with real API calls (ordersApi.getAll)\n- Fix order-table.tsx: handle camelCase/snake_case fields with helper functions\n- Fix order-card.tsx: safe date parsing, fallback fields\n- Fix status transitions: use backend statuses (pending/preparing/ready/delivering/delivered)\n- Remove payment_status and payment_method columns (not in backend)\n\nProducts Page:\n- Fix local search and category filtering\n- Update categories to backend values (meal/drink/dessert/side)\n- Fix isAvailable fallback to is_available\n\nDelivery Page:\n- Rewrite optimization tab with real API integration\n- Add \"Available Drivers Preview\" showing GPS status before optimization\n- Add \"Before vs After\" comparison card showing distance savings\n- Accept/Reject buttons calling real assign + status endpoints\n- Show unassigned orders with reasons\n- Remove non-existent DeliveryKanban and OptimizationFlow dependencies\n\nTypes:\n- Update types/index.ts aligned with backend responses\n- Fix OrderStatus: remove confirmed/out_for_delivery, add delivering\n- Fix LoginResponse: accessToken/refreshToken (camelCase)\n- Fix OrderCreateRequest: camelCase fields\n- Fix OptimizationResponse: match backend structure","tree":{"sha":"f0967ba83497142c10ceff9bcf8f5d309f12bd48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/f0967ba83497142c10ceff9bcf8f5d309f12bd48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKDdjMTlkMDNhZjc1ZDdiZWYzZWVhNjJjNDUwNjNkMmNiYzJlM2RiYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/a7590ee2496a527b5b8a4dcc19bfa5103ce8c746","sha":"a7590ee2496a527b5b8a4dcc19bfa5103ce8c746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a7590ee2496a527b5b8a4dcc19bfa5103ce8c746"}],"sha":"7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/7c19d03af75d7bef3eea62c45063d2cbc2e3dbbe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/a7590ee2496a527b5b8a4dcc19bfa5103ce8c746/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T21:08:33Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T21:08:33Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"fix(frontend): resolve auth flow, API integration and remove websocket\n\n- Fix auth-store: use response.accessToken (camelCase) matching backend\n- Fix checkAuth: restore token from Zustand persist without API call\n- Fix login: save fastmeals_token to localStorage for axios interceptor\n- Fix products API: handle paginated response { data: [], pagination: {} }\n- Fix product types: isAvailable fallback to is_available\n- Fix order-table: use Radix checked=\"indeterminate\" instead of indeterminate prop\n- Fix next.config: add remote image patterns for product images\n- Fix sidebar routing: match Next.js (dashboard) group transparent routes\n- Fix Nginx: remove OPTIONS preflight block, let Express handle CORS\n- Remove websocket: disable real-time updates (not implemented in backend)\n- All CORS_ORIGIN set to \"*\" for development","tree":{"sha":"9938e289f062d6999ccceb0791f7eca7c3682ac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/9938e289f062d6999ccceb0791f7eca7c3682ac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/a7590ee2496a527b5b8a4dcc19bfa5103ce8c746","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/a7590ee2496a527b5b8a4dcc19bfa5103ce8c746","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKGE3NTkwZWUyNDk2YTUyN2I1YjhhNGRjYzE5YmZhNTEwM2NlOGM3NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/e4ca718f