:{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T07:22:57Z","email":"vynnyprudencio@gmail.com","name":"vynnydev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T07:22:57Z","email":"vynnyprudencio@gmail.com","name":"vynnydev"},"message":"feat(orders-service): implement orders microservice with status machine and RabbitMQ messaging\n\n- Domain layer: Order and OrderItem entities, OrderStatusVO value object with state machine\n- Application layer: 5 use cases (Create, List, Get, UpdateStatus, AssignDeliveryPerson)\n- Inter-service communication: ProductServiceClient (HTTP) and DeliveryServiceClient (HTTP)\n- RabbitMQ messaging: EventPublisher (order.created, order.status.changed), EventConsumer (delivery.assigned)\n- Infrastructure: Prisma repository with pagination, Zod validators with Brazilian phone regex\n- HTTP layer: Express controllers, routes with auth middleware and role guard\n- Business rules: status transitions validation, delivery person requirement, price snapshot\n- Docker: Dockerfile multi-stage, docker-compose with PostgreSQL + RabbitMQ\n- Tests: 43 tests covering status machine, CRUD, auth, validation, inter-service mocks\n- Clean Architecture: IEventPublisher and IEventConsumer interfaces in Application layer","tree":{"sha":"1d58ef32162116f4318946c39132ee9061a1043e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/1d58ef32162116f4318946c39132ee9061a1043e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/6c5c4b06df805c6f47eea22199e3a40aaf457ba2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87592165?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vynnydev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vynnydev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vynnydev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vynnydev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_ur