rrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/82ccb7e0b1203a114b80e1fc93f51cec3c04d8f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T23:21:05Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T23:21:05Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"feat: 3.0 M6.2 — --set, CloudFront Functions log limit, bounded history\n\n- cli/api: --set path=value changes cloudfrontize.json settings for one\n  run (serve, validate, check, build); validated like the file, never\n  saved; listed in the workbench and recorded in build.json\n- cff: a run''s logs are truncated at 10 KB, as in CloudFront\n- history: bounded by memory (~256 MB) as well as count; without a WebUI\n  nothing is kept and no body snapshots are taken\n- tutorial: 4.2 The Stage Manager (staging and production from one\n  project); the tutorial runner runs checks.<variant>.json with \"set\"\n- docs: README commands, workbench guide, migration guide, ARCHITECTURE\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: CloudFront Functions logs are truncated at 10 KB per run.","tree":{"sha":"d9766362a03c9d89eac91eca54524d57f0058b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/d9766362a03c9d89eac91eca54524d57f0058b71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/82ccb7e0b1203a114b80e1fc93f51cec3c04d8f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarril