d":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/69afcfb1fddb69c9a191d98512b47bc1c2646982/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:49:24Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:49:24Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"docs: 3.0 M5.4 — CloudFront Functions tutorials as projects\n\n- tutorial/v3/05-cff: 5.1 Traffic Director, 5.2 Header Injector,\n  5.3 Simple Blocker, 5.5 Geo Router, 5.6 Bot Detector, 5.7 A/B Router,\n  5.8 Header Policy, 5.9 Rate Gate, 5.10 Cookie Gate, 5.11 Variable\n  Baker, each with checks; 1.4/1.12 renamed 5.4/5.12\n- corrected 2.x solutions: security headers on viewer-response (5.8,\n  5.11), sticky A/B groups (5.7), honest rate-limit framing with AWS WAF\n  pointers (5.9, 5.10); 2.x articles link to their v3 versions and note\n  the corrections\n- teaching notes from emulator findings: disallowed X-Edge-* headers\n  (5.2), baking replaces text as is (5.11)\n- tests: await server.ready after every startServer, so supertest never\n  listens on its own (wildcard) port; helpers made async\n- docs: v3 index lists every tutorial; ARCHITECTURE notes the ready rule","tree":{"sha":"1ec098a4ddeab92d23b946cfd85a960df4910a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/1ec098a4ddeab92d23b946c