.1 Baker (with checks and\n  AWS corrections: 40 KB viewer generated responses, cookie in the cache\n  key, include body, CFF for cache key normalization); v3 articles\n  describe the new workbench; converted 2.x articles link to their v3\n  versions; indexes lead with v3\n- build --bake <file>: a bake file per environment\n- --host option; servers on an ephemeral port listen on 127.0.0.1, so\n  another program bound to 127.0.0.1 on the same port can''t take their\n  traffic (SO_REUSEADDR); cloudfrontize check uses loopback\n- library exports createProject, listTemplates, buildProject,\n  importLegacySetup, runChecks\n- tests: 20 s timeout under parallel load; CLI tests print output on\n  failure and use loopback","tree":{"sha":"c803e506b18127417f41b83e96120062fada128b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/c803e506b18127417f41b83e96120062fada128b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/d613e97e48b7223d7356b8fd6e5f1c37892e760c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":190033794,"login":"felipecarrilloromero","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloro