pecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/a8472973c1d8d3d49fcfeb5667cbaf3b4b71fd07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:19:59Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:19:59Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"feat: 3.0 M5.2 — build and import commands\n\n- cloudfrontize build [project] --out --level: CloudFront Functions to\n  cloudfront/<id>.js, Lambda@Edge to lambda-edge/<id>/index.js, KVS to\n  kvs/<id>.json, plus build.json (runtime, size, store, associations);\n  baked, hookType stripped, optionally minified/uglified; built code\n  checked as AWS sees it (CFF runtime rules and 10 KB limit are errors;\n  unset __VAR__ and Lambda@Edge modules to bundle are warnings)\n- cloudfrontize import [dir] (2.x flags) --out: local folders copied into\n  origins/, S3 origins without literal keys, * behavior as default,\n  functions copied by convention (kebab-case ids, helper subfolders\n  kept) and attached to every behavior within AWS rules, with notes for\n  anything not attached\n- 2.x command lines print the equivalent import command\n- CLI: subcommand options are the subcommand''s (enablePositionalOptions)\n- new projects ignore dist/\n- tests: build (layout, baking, size limit, dependencies), import (served\n  folder, origins file, rules, rollback), CLI import/build\n- docs: ARCHITECTURE section 8","tree":{"sha":"e3f827e9a5e52eb7d56978ba0394d4e19e6c797a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/e3f827e9a5e52eb7d56978ba0394d4e19e6c797a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/a8472973c1d8d3d49fcfeb5667cbaf3b4b71fd07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u