subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/fc7687b6cc2d58c02fc9bba4fa194c8a010ac7f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:43:04Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:43:04Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"feat(ui): 3.0 M4.3 — Monaco code editor with saves, conflicts and typings\n\n- Monaco bundled locally (core + JavaScript + JSON only), lazy-loaded\n  with the editor; workers for the editor, TS and JSON services\n- editor tabs beside the schematic for function code, key value stores\n  and cloudfrontize.json; per-tab buffers with unsaved-change tracking,\n  close and page-leave guards\n- Ctrl/Cmd+S saves with the edited revision; build errors/warnings,\n  manifest diagnostics (placed via JSON pointers) and KVS problems as\n  markers and a problems list; invalid JSON caught before sending\n- 409: side-by-side diff with \"Keep my version\" / \"Use the disk\n  version\"; disk changes followed while clean, announced while dirty\n- CloudFront typings for the JS language service (Lambda@Edge via\n  exports.handler, CloudFront Functions via JSDoc, ''cloudfront'' module);\n  manifest validated against schema/cloudfrontize.schema.json, KVS\n  against the AWS import format\n- live 10 KB meter for CloudFront Functions; key value stores list with\n  New store; \"Edit code\" from menus, slot double-click, inspectors and\n  after creating a function; tabs follow renames, deletes, project swaps\n- starter code for CloudFront Functions carries the JSDoc event type\n- WebUI serves fonts, JSON and source maps with their content types\n- tests: editor pane (save, build problems, conflicts, disk changes,\n  manifest and KVS validation), tabs, problem mapping","tree":{