d choices disabled with the\n  reason; create a function in a slot or attach an existing one\n- function actions as right-click and button menus: inspect, open in VS\n  Code, production build, disable, isolate, rename, remove from slot,\n  delete (optionally the file)\n- inspectors: Viewer (simulation file, location/device presets with real\n  CloudFront header names), Distribution (settings, behaviors: add, edit,\n  reorder, delete), Origin (behavior''s origin, settings, test connection,\n  add/delete), Function (build, runtime, KVS, 10 KB meter, where it runs)\n- useManifestEdit: edits the manifest as written with its revision;\n  409 reloads instead of overwriting, 422 shows the broken AWS rules\n- API: POST /origins (creates a local origin''s folder), POST\n  /origins/:id/check (local folder / S3 HeadBucket), POST\n  /functions/:id/open-in-editor, GET /functions/:id/production\n- contract: CLOUDFRONT_ADDED_HEADERS shared by server and UI\n- fixes: behavior origin select lost the change; closed Open dialog\n  fetched folders\n- tests: rules, schematic, inspectors, viewer headers model","tree":{"sha":"d9d9807d085671250589eabf5ca9fdcad9e5f9e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/d9d9807d085671250589eabf5ca9fdcad9e5f9e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/119653e3708eb49ebfbe6d3b04422c0c75ffa5fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":