ET/DELETE /api/v2/projects/recent; recorded by the CLI, opt-in for the\n  library (createServer({ recentProjects: true }))\n- POST /api/v2/projects: src/project/create.ts makes a minimal valid\n  project (manifest, origins/www starter page, .gitignore) in an empty or\n  new folder and opens it; 409 for folders with content, nothing left\n  behind on errors\n- POST /api/v2/invoke: real request through the main port; response\n  (text or base64, 1 MB cap) plus its journey; X-Cloudfrontize-Invoke id\n  adopted for loopback clients and removed before any function sees it\n- tests: api_v2_workspace; Jest globalSetup isolates CLOUDFRONTIZE_HOME\n  so tests (and spawned CLIs) never touch ~/.cloudfrontize\n- docs: ARCHITECTURE workspace routes","tree":{"sha":"78417287f97229d408175a6f2c4ea7dd740ef5b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/78417287f97229d408175a6f2c4ea7dd740ef5b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/8e576cbd32fb80be8bc152c9e4189118b5de7f55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":190033794,"login":"felipecarrilloromero","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com