i.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/2e46aa134678d1be7dc3551b7e9037bf38a05237/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:49:37Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:49:37Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"feat: 3.0 M3.3 — functions, behaviors, KVS and viewer-headers API\n\n- GET /api/v2/functions, /functions/:id (with source + revision): type,\n  runtime, file, attachments, disabled, size, build state\n- PUT /functions/:id/source { content, revision }: conflict-checked save\n  that answers with the build result (runtime rebuild for functions the\n  emulator runs; static check for unused ones: syntax, CFF runtime\n  rules, 10 KB limit)\n- POST /functions: file by convention with starter code, manifest entry,\n  optional attachment; rolled back if the manifest is refused\n- PATCH /functions/:id (rename everywhere + conventional file, runtime,\n  keyValueStore); DELETE /functions/:id (?deleteFile=true)\n- PUT/DELETE /behaviors/:behavior/functions/:event (attach/detach)\n- GET/PUT/POST /kvs (422 invalid-kvs); GET/PUT /viewer/headers (creates\n  config/headers.json when missing)\n- every manifest change goes through saveManifest: revision check, AWS\n  rule validation, reload; file writes are revision-checked (409 with\n  current content)\n- src/project/functions.ts: conventions, starter code, static check\n- runners: L@E file without exports.handler is a build error; CFF syntax\n  errors report the real message; CFF builds include warnings and size\n- KeyValueStore.checkContent; api/context.ts shared helpers\n- tests: api_v2_files; docs: ARCHITECTURE 6.1","tree":{"sha":"305016dd75c2883f7cc39de3f4b676d525101d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/305016dd75c2883f7cc39de3f4b676d525101d22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfr