https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":190033794,"login":"felipecarrilloromero","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/0830d821d1cc0a55ecf168353595a5129a3a90c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:41:12Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:41:12Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"feat: 3.0 M3.2 — project and manifest API with conflict detection\n\n- revisions: a file''s revision is a short SHA-256 of its bytes\n  (src/project/revision.ts); writes are atomic (temp file + rename)\n- GET /api/v2/project: manifest as written (no defaults), revision (also\n  ETag) and diagnostics\n- PUT /api/v2/project/manifest { manifest, revision } or If-Match:\n  428 revision-required, 409 conflict (current revision + manifest),\n  422 invalid-manifest (diagnostics, nothing written); otherwise saved\n  and reloaded in place\n- POST /api/v2/project/validate, /project/reload, /projects/open { path }\n- server.saveManifest(); open/reload/save/external reloads are serialized\n- ProjectWatcher: manifest edits on disk reload the project\n  (project.changed, source \"disk\"), own writes aren''t reloaded twice,\n  invalid edits keep the previous version running (project.invalid);\n  viewer headers file edits apply without a restart (viewer.changed)\n- events: project.opened/changed/invalid, viewer.changed\n- tests: api_v2_project; shared helpers/apiClient\n- docs: ARCHITECTURE 6.1/6.2; Diplomat tutorial no longer needs a restart","tree":{"sha":"24818878ecd20c51ccf40cbaf63558acaf566657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/24818878ecd20c51ccf40cbaf63558acaf566657"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/0830d821d1cc0a55ecf168353595a5129a3a90c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":190033794,"login":"felipecarrilloromero","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commit/0830d821d1cc0a55ecf168353595a5129a3a90c3","node_id":"C_kwDORmkZvNoAKDA4MzBkODIxZDFjYzBhNTVlY2YxNjgzNTM1OTVhNTEyOWEzYTkwYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commit/57b758d54ba5910a1a885cae47fa13eb85337829","sha":"57b758d54ba5910a1a885cae47fa13eb85337829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/57b758d54ba5910a1a885cae47fa13eb85337829"}],"sha":"0830d821d1cc0a55ecf168353595a5129a3a90c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/0830d821d1cc0a55ecf168353595a5129a3a90c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":190033794,"login":"felipecarrilloromero","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/57b758d54ba5910a1a885cae47fa13eb85337829/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:58:32Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:58:32Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"feat: 3.0 M3.1 — WebUI API v2 foundation and typed event stream\n\n- src/api/router.ts: JSON router with typed errors\n  ({ error: { code, message, details } }), 404/405/413/415 handling,\n  Cache-Control: no-store\n- CSRF hardening: API POSTs (and any request with a body) must be\n  Content-Type: application/json, which cross-site pages can''t send\n  without a preflight the WebUI never answers\n- src/api/events.ts: versioned event envelope { v: 2, seq, time, type,\n  requestId?, data } with stream.*, request.*, build.*, project.opened\n  and distribution.changed types\n- Orchestrator stage broadcasts carry a structured stage (function /\n  short-circuit with event, runtime, functionIds; origin-fetch;\n  origin-response; final-response)\n- src/api/EventHub.ts: sequenced SSE at /api/v2/events with a 2,000-event\n  replay buffer, Last-Event-ID / ?since resume, stream.reset when too far\n  behind, and a heartbeat\n- /api/v2 index, /api/v2/requests (summaries), /api/v2/requests/:id\n  (journey), DELETE /api/v2/requests\n- WebUI also listens on ::1 (same port) so localhost can''t reach another\n  program on IPv6; accepts Host [::1]:port; closes streams and sockets on\n  shutdown; server.webuiPort\n- 2.x /api/* and /events endpoints unchanged\n- tests: api_v2_core (router, security, events, resume, history)\n- docs: ARCHITECTURE \"WebUI API v2\"","tree":{"sha":"c48e2e251e73ac3fd704f5d2d290dd0d5af5b405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/c48e2e251e73ac3fd704f5d2d290dd0d5af5b405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/57b758d54ba5910a1a885cae47fa13eb85337829","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatar