:"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/6af814795816899833562012009516e76b826c85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":190033794,"login":"felipecarrilloromero","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/commits/4230e638577579e01d0019715dd205b770673371/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:10:14Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:10:14Z","email":"felipe.carrillo.romero@hexagon.com","name":"felipe.carrillo.romero"},"message":"feat!: 3.0 M1 — projects, manifest validation, project runtime, tutorial runner\n\nProjects\n- cloudfrontize.json manifest (zod schema → types, validation and\n  generated JSON Schemas in schema/); AWS association rules checked at\n  load with JSON-pointer diagnostics; S3 credentials only as profile or\n  environment references\n- `cloudfrontize <project>` (or a project in the current folder) and\n  `cloudfrontize validate [project]`; 2.x commands unchanged\n\nRuntime\n- ProjectRuntime owns runners, watchers, providers and pipeline, with\n  dispose(); the server swaps projects via openProject()/reload()\n  without restarting\n- manifest-driven runners (explicit files and stages, no detection)\n- createServer(), loadProject() and error types exported; startServer()\n  kept as a 2.x wrapper\n- busy ports and invalid header files reject `ready` instead of exiting\n- file watchers are ready before startup completes (changes made right\n  after start were sometimes missed)\n- structured Logger with console and file sinks\n\nTutorials\n- `npm run tutorials` runs every tutorial suite\n- tutorial/v3/: project-based tutorials with declarative checks.json,\n  starting with 1.1 The Security Guard; intro tutorial now tested\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Node.js 22 or later is required.","tree":{"sha":"15f1b8e75dae5a117d8bb1547c9b8d34510b17e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/trees/15f1b8e75dae5a117d8bb1547c9b8d34510b17e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/felipecarrillo100/cloudfrontize/git/commits/4230e638577579e01d0019715dd205b770673371","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190033794?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/felipecarrilloromero","id":190033794,"login":"felipecarrilloromero","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Ovgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrilloromero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felipecarrillor