/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lmilo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lmilo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EncorelyHQ/encorely-front/commits/ff115419cf21e6b97674117f3c93b45da2f2328c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T14:59:40Z","email":"camiloarinconc@gmail.com","name":"Camilo Rincón"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T14:59:40Z","email":"camiloarinconc@gmail.com","name":"Camilo Rincón"},"message":"test: tests unitarios para apiRequest, useSwipeEngine y SpotifyAuthContext\n\n- apiRequest: success, 204 No Content, ApiError (status/message), Authorization header, JSON body, query string, formatApiError\n- useSwipeEngine: estado inicial, restore desde AsyncStorage, like()/dislike()/resetSwipes(), umbrales de onboarding\n- SpotifyAuthContext: isLoading, sesión vacía, restore desde SecureStore, logout, getValidToken (válido/expirado), error fuera de Provider\n- Configura jest-expo como preset con moduleNameMapper para alias @/\n- Resuelve compatibilidad React 19 + RNTL 14: renderHook es async, usar await renderHook() + waitFor()\n- Stack: jest-expo 54 + @testing-library/react-native 14 + react-test-renderer 19\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1df116f3953f0f066d9b1c14fb244e05b9753ffb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EncorelyHQ/encorely-front/git/trees/1df116f3953f0f066d9b1c14fb244e05b9753ffb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EncorelyHQ/encorely-front/git/commits/ff115419cf21e6b97674117f3c93b45da2f2328c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136653930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lmilo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lmilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lmilo/following