om","name":"James Galang"},"message":"feat: completely redesign clusters page — individual cards with graphs + AI summaries\n\nMajor redesign replacing the single-SVG horizontal layout (which caused\noverlapping/clipping) with a responsive grid of self-contained cluster cards:\n\n- Each cluster gets its own centered hub-and-spoke SVG with glowing filters\n- 2-sentence AI summary snippet auto-extracted from LLM narrative\n- Shared attribute tags (HCPCS, growth sync, geo overlap)\n- Expand/collapse for full member list and complete AI analysis\n- Risk-colored borders and score badges per cluster\n- Member node initials + risk scores visible without hover\n- Section header with quick risk scores for all clusters","tree":{"sha":"5450e51c375b3bc9e6eedbcfa7f43df709e85cfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/trees/5450e51c375b3bc9e6eedbcfa7f43df709e85cfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/commits/ad2b946138f783cc4d1ad65354ab0bb30f8bbc35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18168062?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Japesg","id":18168062,"login":"Japesg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTY4MDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com