ade cluster network graph to premium glowing aesthetic\n\n- Added SVG <defs> with feGaussianBlur for neon glow effects on hubs and high-risk nodes (url(#glow-critical), url(#glow-hub))\n- Added pulsing SVG <animate> auras behind each cluster hub for a radar/scanning effect\n- Added a transnational connection path linking all hubs to visually represent the coordinated nature of the fraud rings\n- Upgraded member nodes to a high-tech style (glowing ring + solid core)\n- Added CSS transform hover effects on member nodes to scale up when interacted with\n- Added radial gradient background to the entire SVG container for depth","tree":{"sha":"f3f8e3c60f838f3eabb103481675100784457179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/trees/f3f8e3c60f838f3eabb103481675100784457179"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/commits/a101c1b6e9bb7f30c3bb81c6e457f7f59ad453f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18168062?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Japesg","id":18168062,"login":"Japesg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTY4MDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commit/a101c1b6e9bb7f30c3bb81c6e457f7f59ad453f1","node_id":"C_kwDORmsOKtoAKGExMDFjMWI2ZTliYjdmMzBjM2JiODFjNmU0NTdmN2Y1OWFkNDUzZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commit/2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa","sha":"2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commits/2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa"}],"sha":"a101c1b6e9bb7f30c3bb81c6e457f7f59ad453f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commits/a101c1b6e9bb7f30c3bb81c6e457f7f59ad453f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18168062?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Japesg","id":18168062,"login":"Japesg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTY4MDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commits/2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T03:30:22Z","email":"japesg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"James Galang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T03:30:22Z","email":"japesg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"James Galang"},"message":"fix: increase Docker healthcheck start-period to 300s for seeding\n\nThe database seeding process makes ~47 OpenAI API calls during\ninitial boot, which can take 2-5 minutes. The previous start-period\nof 60s was too short — Coolify''s healthcheck would fail 5 times\nand roll back the deployment before seeding finished.\n\n- start-period: 60s → 300s (5 minutes)\n- retries: 5 → 10 (additional safety margin)","tree":{"sha":"859e4e6c2191840ec40558599a5168b88ef001ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/trees/859e4e6c2191840ec40558599a5168b88ef001ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/commits/2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18168062?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Japesg","id":18168062,"login":"Japesg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTY4MDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commit/2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa","node_id":"C_kwDORmsOKtoAKDJkMzdhMGVkOThjYTgxNTY3NzJmYWQ5OWZjNzU3MzY0M2ZmOGRiZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commit/d88344347668fa7cdadd04c7b4fdd54c023515cb","sha":"d88344347668fa7cdadd04c7b4fdd54c023515cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commits/d88344347668fa7cdadd04c7b4fdd54c023515cb"}],"sha":"2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commits/2d37a0ed98ca8156772fad99fc7573643ff8dbfa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18168062?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Japesg","id":18168062,"login":"Japesg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTY4MDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/commits/d88344347668fa7cdadd04c7b4fdd54c023515cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T03:16:19Z","email":"japesg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"James Galang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T03:16:19Z","email":"japesg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"James Galang"},"message":"fix: use max_completion_tokens directly for ChatGPT 5.4 Mini\n\nPer OpenAI docs, newer models (GPT-4o+, o1 series, ChatGPT 5.4 Mini)\nexplicitly reject the legacy max_tokens parameter with a 400 error.\nReplaced the 3-attempt retry loop with a single clean call using\nmax_completion_tokens, which is the correct parameter. This eliminates\nwasted API calls during seeding and fixes the deployment error.","tree":{"sha