"fix: resolve all 13 audit findings + add algorithm explanations to UI\n\nBackend fixes:\n- DBSCAN computes real shared_attributes from actual member HCPCS/growth/geo\n- Dashboard cluster count uses count(distinct) instead of max(id)\n- Pattern builder now filters all 6 criteria (growth, billing, hcpcs, etc)\n- Pipeline step 6: cluster risk scores computed after composite scores\n- Baseline clusters (>50 members) filtered from fraud cluster results\n- Growth score multiplier 2.0→2.5, DBSCAN eps 0.8→1.0 for realistic results\n- Detailed algorithm docstrings on all detection functions\n\nFrontend fixes:\n- Cluster network SVG dynamically sizes for any number of clusters\n- ''Shell Company Ring (Gold Rush)'' investigation preset added\n- Dashboard: AI Detection Methodology section (composite formula, algo cards)\n- SupplierDetail: algorithm descriptions under each risk factor bar\n- Clusters: ''How DBSCAN Cluster Detection Works'' methodology section","tree":{"sha":"b2acd3e581150f3314ee55107849bd2b80d2d9b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/trees/b2acd3e581150f3314ee55107849bd2b80d2d9b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/commits/e793d0828d4fd9e53d5600ea7c0d5cd55d61790f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18168062?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Japesg","id":18168062,"login":"Japesg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTY4MDYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Japesg/received_events","repos_url":"https://a