detection platform\n\n- Multi-method ML pipeline: Isolation Forest + Z-Score + DBSCAN\n- LLM contextual analysis with multi-model routing (batch/interactive tiers)\n- Human-in-the-Loop investigation controls with 7-dimension threshold tuning\n- Real CMS Medicare DME Supplier API integration (300+ suppliers)\n- 7-page React SPA: Dashboard, Alerts, Supplier Detail, Clusters, Investigation, AI Query, Settings\n- Comprehensive README with screenshots, demo recordings, API docs\n- Swappable LLM providers: Anthropic, OpenAI, Local (Ollama), Mock fallback\n\nTeam 1 - Sky Solutions | ACT-IAC AI Hackathon 2026","tree":{"sha":"e2003fbe598ea1c287204711c2782fd6d5b1c41f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/trees/e2003fbe598ea1c287204711c2782fd6d5b1c41f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skysolutionsllc/sky-sentinel/git/commits/28440647177cdae161d4b7aa3bf770066ae968db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226222822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jamesgalang","id":226222822,"login":"jamesgalang","node_id":"U_kgDODXvi5g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamesgalang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"ht