sketballProjections/commits/76961507ea3cf8d84c4cd7bceceaa77deed7dce1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/e5a1cdbe05334d5d2a369d10bc0b31e60f44435f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T09:30:11Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T09:30:11Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"UI polish: theme-safe colors, select chevrons, modal UX, loading state\n\nReplace all hardcoded hex colors with CSS variables so dark mode works\ncorrectly. Add custom SVG dropdown chevron for select elements (with\ndark-mode variant). Extend Escape-key and overlay-click-to-close to all\nfive modals. Add pulse animation on loading headlines. Improve toggle\nbutton contrast, widen mobile player name truncation, swap theme-toggle\ntext characters for cross-platform SVGs, scope ss01 font feature to\nnumeric elements only, extract inline button styles to classes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47da51946d09d73f504bd3d442be1b319a7a0152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/47da51946d09d73f504bd3d442be1b319a7a0152"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/e5a1cdbe05334d5d2a369d10bc0b31e60f44435f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/e5a1cdbe05334d5d2a369d10bc0b31e60f44435f","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKGU1YTFjZGJlMDUzMzRkNWQyYTM2OWQxMGJjMGIzMWU2MGY0NDQzNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed","sha":"54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed"}],"sha":"e5a1cdbe05334d5d2a369d10bc0b31e60f44435f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/e5a1cdbe05334d5d2a369d10bc0b31e60f44435f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T04:15:42Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T04:15:42Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Document broadcast theme + frontend extension conventions\n\nThe README and memory both predated the broadcast aesthetic + dark mode\n+ SVG bracket + column-width class system + ''how to add a sub-tab''\npatterns. Closing the doc-drift gap so future features fit in naturally.\n\nREADME.md additions:\n- New ''Theme & typography'' subsection covering the cream/navy/orange\n  palette, light↔dark flip, the orange accent staying constant in both\n  themes, the four font families (Bebas Neue / Archivo Narrow /\n  Manrope / JetBrains Mono), and region brand colors.\n- New ''Bracket'' subsection documenting the CSS Grid layout (4 cols × 9\n  rows) with explicit grid-row inline styles per game, and the\n  SVG-overlay connector approach with its tab-switch redraw hook.\n- Updated ''Polish features'' to mention dark mode toggle, theme-color\n  meta tags, mobile picks-table stacked-cell layout, and the column\n  hide-mobile pattern.\n- New ''Frontend conventions'' subsection — the most important addition.\n  Explains step-by-step how to:\n  • add a new history sub-tab (HTML markup + render fn + page title +\n    keyboard shortcut + URL hash all wire automatically)\n  • add a new analysis CSV (archive_schema constants → analyze_year →\n    build_archive_json → render fn)\n  • use the col-rank/col-narrow/col-pts/col-resid width class system,\n    with the rule that every table has exactly ONE unsized label\n    column that grabs the remainder\n  • add a new theme variable (override in body[data-theme=dark])\n  • add a new year tab (already automatic)\n  • add a live-draft feature (use legacy var names, not broadcast names)\n\nmemory/project_yearly_archive.md:\n- Documents broadcast theme palette + typography + dark mode behavior\n- Documents the bracket CSS Grid + SVG overlay implementation\n- Documents the column-width class system rule\n- Documents the picks-style stacked-cell layout pattern","tree":{"sha":"3bbe751a5e71437bba86056ceb7d92711944050d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/3bbe751a5e71437bba86056ceb7d92711944050d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDU0YzRmYWI1ZTliOTNmNjkwZGRjYzM2MTVlZDQzZTQxMjFlMTU4ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7","sha":"3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7"}],"sha":"54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/54c4fab5e9b93f690ddcc3615ed43e4121e158ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:41:16Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:41:16Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Calibration table: give ''Top N'' column an explicit width\n\nAudit found that Calibration''s Top N column had no col- class. With\ntable-layout:fixed (mobile), columns without explicit widths get the\nentire remainder after the sized columns are laid out. Top N — which\nonly holds values like 10, 25, 50, 100, 150, 210 — was eating ~50%\nof the table width and forcing the data columns to truncate.\n\nFixed by adding col-narrow (60px desktop / 42px mobile) to the Top N\nheader and cell. Header ''TOP N'' fits cleanly at 10px Archivo Narrow.\n\nAudited the other tables for similar ''one unsized column hoarding\nthe remainder'' issues:\n- Standings: Entry is unsized → CORRECT (entry name needs the room)\n- Draft Replay: Player is unsized → CORRECT (cell-sub needs room)\n- Top Performers: Player is unsized → CORRECT\n- Steals & Busts: Player is unsized → CORRECT\n- Pick Value: Player is unsized → CORRECT\n- Bias by Seed: all columns sized → CORRECT\n- Draft Efficiency: Entry is unsized → CORRECT\n- Entry Post-Mortem: Entry is unsized → CORRECT\n- Calibration: Top N was unsized → FIXED\n\nThe pattern is: tables should have exactly ONE column without a width\nclass (the \"label/text\" column that takes the remainder), and everything\nelse should be explicitly sized. Calibration was the only violation.","tree":{"sha":"ca2ad1ee2d31e01daa64a1ff18e0c738db6f6ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/ca2ad1ee2d31e01daa64a1ff18e0c738db6f6ed4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDM1Mjc3NzVkYWM3NzE4N2M4ZDZiYjNhYTg1ZTA3ZTIxNTUwYWU4Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40","sha":"793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40"}],"sha":"3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/3527775dac77187c8d6bb3aa85e07e21550ae8c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:38:12Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:38:12Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Round expected_games and ppg in archive players JSON + draft banner\n\nTwo places leaked unrounded floats like 4.493977963625555:\n\n1. build_archive_json.py wrote raw floats to <year>_players.json.\n   Now rounds ppg to 1 decimal and expected_games to 2 decimals,\n   matching what main.py does for the live players.json.\n\n2. docs/index.html Best Available banner used best.ppg and\n   best.expected_games as-is, which would render the full float\n   in any year-X redraft mode where the source JSON happened to\n   carry unrounded values. Now coerces to .toFixed(1) / .toFixed(2)\n   at display time as a defensive measure.\n\nRebuilt 2026_players.json with the rounded values.","tree":{"sha":"b224394f9dd6852d9bcf2de5a7a0084a9e479fb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/b224394f9dd6852d9bcf2de5a7a0084a9e479fb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDc5M2U1ZDg3NGVkMzgzMzEzZWYyZDEwNThjMzA0YzIyYTQ5OTNmNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb","sha":"8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb"}],"sha":"793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/793e5d874ed383313ef2d1058c304c22a4993f40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:33:40Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:33:40Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Fix bracket grid positioning with explicit grid-row inline styles\n\nThe :nth-of-type CSS selectors were off-by-one because the round-label\n<div> sibling counts as nth-of-type(1), shifting all .bkt-game indices\nby 1. So .bkt-game:nth-of-type(1) matched nothing (the round-label is\nthe actual nth-of-type(1) div, but it isn''t a .bkt-game).\n\nReplaced the nth-of-type CSS rules with explicit grid-row inline styles\nemitted from the renderer. ROUND_ROWS map computes the correct\n\"<startRow> / span <N>\" string for each round/game-index combo:\n  R64: rows 2-9 (one row each)\n  R32: 2/4/6/8 spanning 2 rows each\n  S16: 2/6 spanning 4 rows each\n  E8:  row 2 spanning all 8 game rows\n\nAlso: drawBracketConnectors silently no-ops when the .bracket-rounds\ncontainer has 0 dimensions (i.e. when the Bracket tab isn''t active).\nNow selectHistorySection re-runs drawBracketConnectors on switch to\nthe bracket section so connectors appear when switching tabs after\ninitial load.\n\nAlso bumped col-narrow / col-pts widths to 60px (was 50/56) and\ncol-resid to 72px (was 68) so 4-char values like \"+180\" and \"210\"\nhave breathing room with bold tabular numerals.","tree":{"sha":"8d54300f7298982b2ec1375e8050a73317891d27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/8d54300f7298982b2ec1375e8050a73317891d27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDg2NzgxMjQyMDVmZjQxMTc2OWYxZjQxNGI4MTQ5MWViYmQ0NjgxZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c","sha":"ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c"}],"sha":"8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/8678124205ff411769f1f414b81491ebbd4681fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:11:37Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T02:11:37Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Apply col-pts/col-resid widths to all data columns site-wide\n\nAudited every history table for columns that could hold 4+ character\nvalues and added explicit width classes:\n\nAlgorithm tab:\n- Calibration: Avg Proj/Avg Actual → col-pts; Delta/Error % → col-resid\n  (handles \"+12.3%\" type values)\n- Bias by Seed: Seed → col-rank; N → col-narrow; Avg Proj/Actual →\n  col-pts; Residual → col-resid (handles \"-14.6\")\n- Draft Efficiency: Actual/Algo/Rank Base → col-pts; vs Algo →\n  col-resid (handles \"+209\" / \"-196\")\n- Entry Post-Mortem: N → col-narrow; MAE → col-pts; Mean Resid →\n  col-resid; Hit % → col-resid\n\nStandings:\n- Total → col-pts (handles 4-digit totals)\n- All round columns (R64-Championship) → col-pts (R64 max in 2026 is\n  247, a 3-digit value)\n\nNow every numeric column in the History view has an explicit width\nclass that matches the magnitude of values it holds. No truncation\nacross any tab.","tree":{"sha":"d1ef059c9aab2c56d763359d6ed2bd7e8b3c25c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/d1ef059c9aab2c56d763359d6ed2bd7e8b3c25c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKGFkMGJjMmY1OWIwNGMzZjFmNDdkNGIwMzYxNGE3Mzg0ZWI4OWQxMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d","sha":"3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d"}],"sha":"ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/ad0bc2f59b04c3f1f47d4b03614a7384eb89d10c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T01:15:17Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T01:15:17Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Bracket: widen +/- and ± columns to fit 4-char values like +180","tree":{"sha":"13019c4765dabf350af449ad401fa662dd4b65ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/13019c4765dabf350af449ad401fa662dd4b65ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDMzNDc3MTAxMDgxMTVkNGE4M2RjNmQ0NjUyYjlmNGRmYTM5ZmU0OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5","sha":"985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5"}],"sha":"3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/3347710108115d4a83dc6d4652b9f4dfa39fe49d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T23:00:14Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T23:00:14Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Bracket: replace broken pseudo-element connectors with SVG overlay\n\nThe pseudo-element approach (::before / ::after with right:-8px and\nbottom:-50%) was fundamentally fragile — it depended on game height\nmatching the gap to the next game and on space-around distribution\nproducing pixel-perfect alignment, neither of which was reliable.\n\nReplaced with:\n1. CSS Grid layout for the bracket rounds: 4 columns × 8 rows. Games\n   in R64 span 1 row, R32 span 2 (centered on a pair), S16 span 4,\n   E8 spans 8. This naturally aligns each round''s game vertical center\n   with the midpoint of its source pair.\n2. SVG overlay drawn after layout via drawBracketConnectors():\n   - measures each .bkt-game''s bounding rect\n   - for each pair (round N) → next round game, draws a 4-segment\n     L-shape: stub from a → midX, stub from b → midX, vertical\n     midX[a.y..b.y], stub from midX → next-round-game.left\n   - 2px stroke in --ink color\n   - reruns on window resize (debounced 120ms)\n3. Uses display:contents on .bracket-round-col so the games place\n   directly into the parent grid''s rows.\n\nResult: every connector reaches its endpoints exactly. No more broken\nor floating lines on any region, any column, any zoom level.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0855438b37935d0eea74dbc43dae67036ce71061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/0855438b37935d0eea74dbc43dae67036ce71061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDk4NWQyMzVlMzgxYzEwODc1ZTI1MTQ0YmMzNjVjNDhmYTY5NDk3ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed","sha":"956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed"}],"sha":"985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/985d235e381c10875e25144bc365c48fa69497d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:51:10Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:51:10Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Add dark mode toggle (broadcast theme variants)\n\nTwo coherent theme variants of the broadcast graphics aesthetic:\n- Light (default): cream paper #F4EEDF + deep navy ink #0A1E3F\n- Dark: deep midnight #0E1620 + cream text #F4EEDF (paper ↔ ink flip)\n\nBoth share the same orange (#FF6B1A) and red (#C8102E) accents — only\nthe paper/ink tones flip. Region colors and typography are unchanged.\n\nUI:\n- Small square ☾/☀ toggle button in the header next to the year tabs.\n  Inherits the broadcast button vocabulary (rectangular, no radius,\n  hairline border).\n- Hover state inverts (button fills with current ink color).\n\nPersistence:\n- Saved to localStorage as \"theme\" = \"light\" | \"dark\"\n- Defaults to system preference (prefers-color-scheme) on first visit\n- Mobile address bar color follows via theme-color meta tags\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"215b53231f0991a7bd76362a82b203742f89d420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/215b53231f0991a7bd76362a82b203742f89d420"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDk1NmI0MGFlNzJhN2Y3MTk1M2ZmOWZkNjg5Nzc3ZGJkNGU1MjE2ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/6a39769faa15051b200f590ab4bd667fdc5b4f22","sha":"6a39769faa15051b200f590ab4bd667fdc5b4f22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/6a39769faa15051b200f590ab4bd667fdc5b4f22"}],"sha":"956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/956b40ae72a7f71953ff9fd689777dbd4e5216ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/6a39769faa15051b200f590ab4bd667fdc5b4f22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:47:47Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:47:47Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Broadcast Graphics theme: cream paper, navy ink, NCAA orange, Bebas Neue display\n\nFirst pass at the editorial-broadcast aesthetic direction. Replaces the\ngeneric dark-mode dashboard with a warm parchment + deep navy + NCAA\norange palette and a real typography pairing.\n\nTypography\n- Bebas Neue: huge display headlines (history h2, region titles,\n  championship card, trophy moments). Bold geometric, evokes broadcast\n  lower-thirds.\n- Archivo Narrow: medium display + nav (sub-tab labels, year tabs,\n  card h3s, button text). Tight tracking, condensed.\n- Manrope: body copy (table cells, headlines, sub-lines).\n- JetBrains Mono: all stat numbers, kickers, footer copy. Tabular\n  figures throughout.\n- System fonts removed.\n\nColor palette (light theme — cream paper)\n- --paper #F4EEDF, --paper-deep #EAE2CC, --cream-hi #FBF6E8\n- --ink #0A1E3F (deep navy, replaces #e4e6ed)\n- --orange #FF6B1A (THE accent — winners, headlines, active state)\n- --red #C8102E (negatives, busts, court line)\n- --gold #C9A227 (trophy / champion)\n- Region brand colors as left-border accents on bracket sub-trees:\n  East navy, West red, Midwest orange, South green.\n- Legacy variable mappings keep the live draft board working without\n  per-element rewrites.\n\nLayout moves\n- Year tabs: rectangular block (no border-radius), navy bg with orange\n  active state, broadcast lower-third feel.\n- History header: rule-bracketed with a mono \"TOURNAMENT RECAP\" eyebrow,\n  72px Bebas display headline, magazine-spread vibe.\n- History sub-tabs: rule-bracketed top/bottom, no card chrome, all caps.\n- History cards: borderless, separated by 1px dotted rules. Section\n  titles in 13px Archivo Narrow with a 2px ink underline.\n- Tables: dotted row separators, 2px ink top/bottom rules on headers,\n  Manrope body + JetBrains Mono numbers, hover in soft orange wash.\n- Standings ranks: 22px Bebas display numerals.\n- Bracket regions: cream wells with thick colored left borders by\n  region. Final Four card double-bordered with 6px hard shadow.\n- Awards league-wide card: double-bordered with offset orange shadow.\n  Per-entry cards with Bebas h4 names and 2px underline.\n- Countdown clock: navy box with offset shadow, Bebas 56px digits,\n  Archivo labels.\n- Countdown CTA buttons: rectangular brutalist with offset shadow that\n  shifts on hover.\n- Footer: triple-rule top border, mono caps copy, navy kbd hints.\n\nSubtle radial gradient atmosphere on the body background (orange + navy\ntints, 4% opacity). No drop shadows on cards. Border radius eliminated\nor reduced to 0 for the broadcast feel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a2bbebc4dcf5d546e94ce9007b4ff69b15116e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/8a2bbebc4dcf5d546e94ce9007b4ff69b15116e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/6a39769faa15051b200f590ab4bd667fdc5b4f22","verification":{"pay