html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/a604841baf9add82afd79cc192efa6eb94e724d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:23:30Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:23:30Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Polish: dynamic year strings, --help on analysis scripts, kill dead loop\n\nKnock out the remaining items from the follow-up review:\n\n- main.py:54 hardcoded \"MARCH MADNESS 2026\" → uses datetime.now().year\n- project_points.py:235 same fix → uses datetime.now().year\n- main.py:223-224 dead loop (\"for _, row in ... pass  # just need the\n  column\") removed; the .map() on the next line was always sufficient\n- analyze_year.py, detect_injuries.py, compare_years.py now use argparse\n  with descriptive --help text. analyze_year.py and detect_injuries.py\n  keep year as positional arg with default 2026 for backwards compat.\n  compare_years.py takes no args.\n\nVerified all scripts still work end-to-end:\n- --help produces proper usage text on all three\n- python src/analyze_year.py 2026 still produces same output\n- python src/main.py header still works (year now reads dynamically)","tree":{"sha":"eb7cee1f8ef400ec6bdf0797cd3ff6a6560ccf2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/eb7cee1f8ef400ec6bdf0797cd3ff6a6560ccf2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/a604841baf9add82afd79cc192efa6eb94e724d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/a604841baf9add82afd79cc192efa6eb94e724d3","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKGE2MDQ4NDFiYWY5YWRkODJhZmQ3OWNjMTkyZWZhNmViOTRlNzI0ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/074e51f5a5ac89e44908123e38dd246be773e543","sha":"074e51f5a5ac89e44908123e38dd246be773e543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/074e51f5a5ac89e44908123e38dd246be773e543"}],"sha":"a604841baf9add82afd79cc192efa6eb94e724d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/a604841baf9add82afd79cc192efa6eb94e724d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/074e51f5a5ac89e44908123e38dd246be773e543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:21:02Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T22:21:02Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Wire analyze_year + detect_injuries to import field names from archive_schema\n\nCloses the schema-drift gap from the follow-up review: build_archive_json\nalready validated CSV headers via archive_schema, but the analysis scripts\nstill hardcoded column names as string literals — meaning a column rename\nwould silently produce wrong analysis output BEFORE validation caught it.\n\nanalyze_year.py:\n- Imports COL_PLAYER, COL_TEAM, COL_ENTRY, COL_PICK, COL_GAMES_PLAYED,\n  COL_TOTAL_POINTS, COL_IN_TOURNAMENT_INJURY plus the bracket_outcome\n  BO_* keys from archive_schema\n- Replaces all hardcoded string accesses on input rows (a[\"total_points\"]\n  → a[COL_TOTAL_POINTS], etc). Output dict construction left as plain\n  strings since those are internally consistent within the script.\n- Bracket round_keys now uses BO_ROUND_OF_32 / BO_SWEET_SIXTEEN / etc.\n\ndetect_injuries.py:\n- Same imports, plus ROUND_COLS to replace the inline rounds list\n- Replaces all hardcoded string accesses\n- Bonus: extracted heuristic thresholds to named constants at module top\n  with calibration notes (DNP_CONFIDENCE, CLIFF_*, UNDERPERF_*) so future\n  tuning is one place instead of scattered magic numbers\n\nVerified all three scripts produce byte-identical output:\n- analyze_year.py 2026: same 2 injuries, same Michigan champion\n- detect_injuries.py 2026: same 2 candidates flagged\n- build_archive_json.py 2026: same JSON sizes (141 KB / 125 KB)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"197f505baa50018767edd87bee55fdc7c3662434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/197f505baa50018767edd87bee55fdc7c3662434"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/074e51f5a5ac89e44908123e38dd246be773e543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/074e51f5a5ac89e44908123e38dd246be773e543","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDA3NGU1MWY1YTVhYzg5ZTQ0OTA4MTIzZTM4ZGQyNDZiZTc3M2U1NDM","parents":[{