7@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Update all injuries with latest March 18 news\n\n- Karter Knox (Arkansas): upgraded to OUT 6 games (missed 11 of 12, meniscus)\n- Jaylin Stewart (UConn): miss 0 but 0.85 fitness (out since Feb 21, minutes limit)\n- Acuff: fitness 0.85→0.9 (AP All-American, scored 37, sat Missouri just to rest)\n- Nolan Winter: fitness 0.9→0.95 (full go in practice per Gard)\n- Braden Huff: fitness 0.8→0.75 (dislocated kneecap, more rust than expected)\n- Lendeborg confirmed good to go (false alarm, no X-rays)\n- Added detailed notes from coach quotes for all injuries\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"871729416e85b36e1031fea4967fa6cf1321ffdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/871729416e85b36e1031fea4967fa6cf1321ffdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/5f0372f22ddd77be5378a65162c97882346ead28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/5f0372f22ddd77be5378a65162c97882346ead28","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDVmMDM3MmYyMmRkZDc3YmU1Mzc4YTY1MTYyYzk3ODgyMzQ2ZWFkMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/0401678fb028b1cae236a74de0648b956b32f357","sha":"0401678fb028b1cae236a74de0648b956b32f357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/0401678fb028b1cae236a74de0648b956b32f357"}],"sha":"5f0372f22ddd77be5378a65162c97882346ead28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/5f0372f22ddd77be5378a65162c97882346ead28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/0401678fb028b1cae236a74de0648b956b32f357/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T22:39:02Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T22:39:02Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Replace flat injury multipliers with games_missed + per-player fitness\n\nNew injury CSV columns:\n- games_missed: number of tournament rounds player will miss (0-6)\n  Skips first N rounds from projection (hits highest-probability games)\n- fitness: 0.0-1.0 multiplier for games they DO play (rust, minutes\n  limit, nagging pain). Per-player, not status-based.\n\nExamples:\n- Ngongba: miss 2 games, 0.85 fitness when back → 22 pts (was 34)\n- Huff: miss 2, 0.80 fitness → 13.6 pts (could return S16 with rust)\n- Acuff: miss 0, 0.85 fitness → 55.8 pts (playing through ankle)\n- Philon: miss 0, 0.95 fitness → 49.8 pts (slight nagging issue)\n- Foster: miss 4, 0 fitness → 0 pts (only if Duke reaches F4)\n\nMuch more accurate than flat OUT/DTD/PROBABLE multipliers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71d0e38145a987ae807429e8c749da7bbb48b643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/71d0e38145a987ae807429e8c749da7bbb48b643"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/0401678fb028b1cae236a74de0648b956b32f357","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type