mplex margin-dependent divisor lookup with single divisor\nof 20. Historical seed averages are too broad — a 4-seed Kansas with\n10 losses is nothing like a 4-seed Alabama. Let KenPom team quality\ndrive the results directly rather than forcing conformity to seed-\nlevel historical rates.\n\nDuke: 4.51 EG, Arizona: 4.44, Michigan: 4.42 — properly reflects\nthese teams'' elite KenPom ratings this year.\n\nAlso removed unproven tournament surge and concentration factors\n(sensitivity test showed they changed 0 draft picks in top 30).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6f2b5d0281bc0de538e931b6aca4fdcb9c46971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/f6f2b5d0281bc0de538e931b6aca4fdcb9c46971"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/bbfbf67ec5c2ce1fd368a68a58cf3a10bffee48f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/bbfbf67ec5c2ce1fd368a68a58cf3a10bffee48f","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKGJiZmJmNjdlYzVjMmNlMWZkMzY4YTY4YTU4Y2YzYTEwYmZmZWU0OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/5e8e263e8e5bc57f2d34c7d25a97a309b17bd730","sha":"5e8e263e8e5bc57f2d34c7d25a97a309b17bd730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/5e8e263e8e5bc57f2d34c7d25a97a309b17bd730"}],"sha":"bbfbf67ec5c2ce1fd368a68a58cf3a10bffee48f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/bbfbf67ec5c2ce1fd368a68a58cf3a10bffee48f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/commits/5e8e263e8e5bc57f2d34c7d25a97a309b17bd730/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:23:08Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:23:08Z","email":"junk797@gmail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Calibrate win model to historical rates; remove unproven modifiers\n\nWin probability:\n- Fitted divisor per margin range to match 40 years of seed-vs-seed\n  upset rates. R1 rates now within 2.3% for all matchups.\n- Seeds 4-8 expected games match history within 0.13 games.\n- Seeds 1-2 still ~0.2 games low (structural limit of margin-based model).\n- 5v12 upsets (margin ~14) correctly get highest-variance divisor (57).\n\nRemoved unproven modifiers:\n- Tournament surge: no historical evidence beyond survivorship bias.\n  Sensitivity test showed it changed 0 draft picks in top 30.\n- Scoring concentration: historical data showed NO effect (high-share\n  players surged 1.18x vs low-share 1.22x — slight reverse).\n\nKept:\n- Recent form (60/40 blend): only modifier that changes rankings.\n- Pace normalization: physics-based, small effect.\n- Opponent defense: physics-based, meaningful per-round effect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc6525ee48ec76bfb75dfdc96c6b88a3c47a40cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/fc6525ee48ec76bfb75dfdc96c6b88a3c47a40cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/5e8e263e8e5bc57f2d34c7d25a97a309b17bd730","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/s