odel with margin-dependent divisor; UI tweaks\n\n- Win probability now uses variable divisor that scales with margin:\n  large mismatches (35+) use divisor 22 (predictable), moderate\n  mismatches use up to 50 (high variance), fitting historical upset\n  rates much better while still respecting actual team quality\n- Mock draft defaults: 14 teams, instant speed\n- Remove blowout factor (already pushed separately)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e3a31cc6345363b5495d5ee9ce41b9c94aef49e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/9e3a31cc6345363b5495d5ee9ce41b9c94aef49e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/1432c1b5763451525d36251faea9c34e2699e8c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/1432c1b5763451525d36251faea9c34e2699e8c8","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKDE0MzJjMWI1NzYzNDUxNTI1ZDM2MjUxZmFlYTljMzRlMjY5OWU4Yzg","parents":[{"h