ail.com","name":"Krool"},"message":"Add tournament surge, soften blowout factor, document methodology\n\n- Add star scorer tournament surge: +8% for 20+ PPG, +4% for 15-20 PPG\n  based on historical analysis (top scorers avg +36% above season PPG)\n- Soften blowout factor: raise floor from 0.70 to 0.80, widen dead zone\n  to margin ≤7 (stars still produce in blowouts, e.g. Edey 30pts/23min)\n- Rewrite README with full methodology documentation covering all 7\n  scoring factors, historical calibration data, and draft workflow\n- Add PROBABLE injury status to README documentation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5104f3a6dd80e9ae8513333a63fecfe6cd6806e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/5104f3a6dd80e9ae8513333a63fecfe6cd6806e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/873d4afbca475c01f40d4678a6d5ede31b182caf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool