d points\n\nWhen you have players on your team, undrafted players that would\nconflict show their penalty (-X) and effective value (Y eff.) inline\nin the Pts column. Uses the same round-based factors as post-draft\nanalysis (R1: 35%, R2: 25%, S16: 18%, E8: 12%, F4: 5%).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c368fcb8317fca885174513825152b059e663d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/9c368fcb8317fca885174513825152b059e663d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/cf34b05f63c6361688c487b7c962f69a67d4e62d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/cf34b05f63c6361688c487b7c962f69a67d4e62d","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKGNmMzRiMDVmNjNjNjM2MTY4OGM0ODdiN2M5NjJmNjlhNjdkNGU2MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/e006b4a556f0fcff4cb5396b927ff53daa1ba378","sha":"e006b4a556f0fcff4cb5396b927ff53d