ol"},"message":"Disable Us button during mock draft until it''s your pick\n\nUs button grayed out and disabled while other teams are picking.\nLights up when it''s your turn. Ours button on already-picked\nplayers also locked during active mock to prevent desync.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdcad97ea5c7e5a4190a1a016b183c04650161b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/trees/bdcad97ea5c7e5a4190a1a016b183c04650161b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Krool/BasketballProjections/git/commits/ddc84f40d147e85a61f3686aea4f79d7e4eca88f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5281735?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Krool","id":5281735,"login":"Krool","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODE3MzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Krool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/ddc84f40d147e85a61f3686aea4f79d7e4eca88f","node_id":"C_kwDORoPiGdoAKGRkYzg0ZjQwZDE0N2U4NWE2MWYzNjg2YWVhNGY3OWQ3ZTRlY2E4OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Krool/BasketballProjections/commit/aa769ba62716d3894050af724540aa98518ded72","sha":"aa769ba62716d3894050af724540aa98518ded72