rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/commits/da6c366ec031c045f4cf92f46b62117c2682db24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226633359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dolodorsey","id":226633359,"login":"dolodorsey","node_id":"U_kgDODYImjw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/commits/60be25b74430fc7266ee250a62d6d48124b514f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:17:54Z","email":"dolodorsey@gmail.com","name":"dolodorsey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:17:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GOOD TIMES: route fallback-snapshot refresh through a PR (main is protected) + refresh now (#159)\n\nThe first real run of refresh-atlanta-fallback-snapshot.yml (manual dispatch,\n2026-09-27 04:11Z) passed fetch, validation, diff guard and the full\ntest+build gate, then failed at ''git push origin HEAD:main'' with GH006:\nmain requires a PR and the verify + geometry checks. On the schedule this\nwould have failed silently and the fallback would have expired again.\n\n- Workflow now refreshes on claude/atlanta-snapshot-refresh, opens/updates a\n  PR, dispatches ui-regression (geometry) + repair-customer-shell /\n  repair-live-runtime (verify) on the exact head SHA, waits, and squash-merges\n  that SHA. Never pushes to main.\n- Any failure opens/comments a GitHub issue instead of failing silently.\n- Snapshot refreshed now (cache 2026-09-27 04:13Z: 81 events / 215 venues).\n- Needs repo setting ''Allow GitHub Actions to create and approve pull requests''.","tree":{"sha":"e06d5ee7fa3f770db6e104823edab74b3c93e47a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/trees/e06d5ee7fa3f770db6e104823edab74b3c93e47a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/commits/60be25b74430fc7266ee250a62d6d48124b514f4","verification":{"payload":"tree e06d5ee7fa3f770db6e104823edab74b3c93e47a\nparent 6e0bd745a6e1b15c8580c18713404f62ad0ecd85\nauthor dolodorsey <dolodorsey@gmail.com> 1790482674 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790482674 -0400\n\nGOOD TIMES: route fallback-snapshot refresh through a PR (main is protected) + refresh now (#159)\n\nThe first real run of refresh-atlanta-fallback-snapshot.yml (manual dispatch,\n2026-09-27 04:11Z) passed fetch, validation, diff guard and the full\ntest+build gate, then failed at ''git push origin HEAD:main'' with GH006:\nmain requires a PR and the verify + geometry checks. On the schedule this\nwould have failed silently and the fallback would have expired again.\n\n- Workflow now refreshes on claude/atlanta-snapshot-refresh, opens/updates a\n  PR, dispatches ui-regression (geometry) + repair-customer-shell /\n  repair-live-runtime (verify) on the exact head SHA, waits, and squash-merges\n  that SHA. Never pushes to main.\n- Any failure opens/comments a GitHub issue instead of failing silently.\n- Snapshot refreshed now (cache 2026-09-27 04:13Z: 81 events / 215 venues).\n- Needs repo setting ''Allow GitHub Actions to create and approve pull requests''.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquJjyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1oMQAHPZAo