e.js, the same source api/health.js uses for this RPC family.\nVerified the cache-only RPC accepts it; gitleaks clean on the file.","tree":{"sha":"013838fcdf924cb7e7631383be143329dc512389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/trees/013838fcdf924cb7e7631383be143329dc512389"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/commits/6e0bd745a6e1b15c8580c18713404f62ad0ecd85","verification":{"payload":"tree 013838fcdf924cb7e7631383be143329dc512389\nparent 4fe82238628d12ce3afd2591e1c043e9853d6f3f\nauthor dolodorsey <dolodorsey@gmail.com> 1790464962 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790464962 -0400\n\nGOOD TIMES: snapshot refresher reads content key from canonical config (#158)\n\nSecret Leak Gate (gitleaks generic-api-key) flagged the hardcoded content\npublishable key added in #157. The key is client-public, but duplicating it\nis unnecessary: import KHG_SUPABASE_URL/KHG_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY from\nsrc/lib/supabase.js, the same source api/health.js uses for this RPC family.\nVerified the cache-only RPC accepts it; gitleaks clean on the file.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquFPCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn/sQAFEZ5cURJcOv/e+cqcRrR0rC\nEGJ0aHdUB7n+x5F1uDmpNo1e5CSmnXmY/L5brdVgtH1a/+/b2Xhg3nuWbpsitpC6\nST/2+nWEQ1ADcxFijsiMk5sZmidkRY39kBGRnSSQyUzS9qhkQy1tfi/mgRdIE81T\napIY7mW9bSEUVFxEm0fWF6aUR9avOof2K5AfOfSoe22+lLbhfkqaJT+uW1eCpYD5\ngjaBSrTtI8If2E++/8lrLx9j6IeQgnREt3Qe8KjzyPff9zNBcIUj0F93bk2YTJ2f\n/Gq7R+PB6lWj/UV03Ws+ORdu9N+uarLLr8Z8WDrixZNQ2AGOokEww/OKxVE7qSoO\nMD7cR12/5tDrWPUjsLQntn1b4FsQysYhMiStPKryEHclpmupy2LlhY7v8l/MdXxl\n405hZzU0LdN3mloGK5fFpd4rHlvGpDFaVTXbVLLHfDRx/wv0Rzxtk7YGw1o9EMsp\nKbfSbHzr7ITvKJOD+wwEQkIMdjxnJCnECz8yQvNsTveAdbBxc7m82LIRETvQju0z\nvWZPQW2Un7tDJj15EO7QLrmVWuKaCBO3p1RtNXSc647syXxEj/jHZf9lKYFCx+xh\nuJqHd7hQy9AVdbtxXXL/sAmwC9RY2/Sp2pYAOlOxKhFeDeftE3XaEh+5ayX6VLeg\noPx/9YsAr328ob0eEAb8\n=0xHW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T2