hub.com/dolodorsey","id":226633359,"login":"dolodorsey","node_id":"U_kgDODYImjw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dolodorsey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/commits/4fe82238628d12ce3afd2591e1c043e9853d6f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:32:26Z","email":"dolodorsey@gmail.com","name":"dolodorsey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:32:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GOOD TIMES: re-arm verified Atlanta fallback snapshot, 12h refresher, armed-state health (#157)\n\n* GOOD TIMES: re-arm verified Atlanta fallback snapshot and keep it refreshed\n\nThe embedded Atlanta snapshot (last-resort fallback when PostgREST fails,\nPGRST002/57014 incident class) was committed once on 2026-09-24 22:33Z with\nno refresher despite its ''Auto-refreshed'' header. It expired 2026-09-26\n10:33Z (36h max age): /api/health reported verified_snapshot_ready:false, a\nPostgREST stall + cold instance would return 503, and\nfinish-atlanta-occurrences.test.mjs failed, blocking every release build.\n\n- Refresh snapshot from gt_public_live_inventory_cache_only_v1 (same RPC the\n  gateway reads first): 100 events / 215 venues, Atlanta-only.\n- scripts/refresh-atlanta-fallback-snapshot.mjs refuses stale, date-mismatched,\n  wrong-city, schema-incomplete or count-collapsed payloads.\n- 12-hourly workflow (Node 24 per engines): data-only diff guard and full\n  test + production build gate before committing.\n- 7 new tests. No UI, taxonomy, navigation, schema or city-scope change.\n\n* GOOD TIMES: expose whether the fallback snapshot is armed in /api/health\n\nverified_snapshot_ready is only true while the snapshot is in use (content\nplane down), so an expired fallback was invisible while production looked\nhealthy. Adds fallback_snapshot_armed + fallback_snapshot_age_hours without\nchanging existing fields, ok/degraded semantics, or status codes.","tree":{"sha":"d8b23f31f4834cbb94a7beaeebdbcb580c4f9c55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/trees/d8b23f31f4834cbb94a7beaeebdbcb580c4f9c55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/commits/4fe82238628d12ce3afd2591e1c043e9853d6f3f","verification":{"payload":"tree d8b23f31f4834cbb94a7beaeebdbcb580c4f9c55\nparent 11c4fc73c9bd4105f64f66632dbf71e13bd2f9a1\nauthor dolodorsey <dolodorsey@gmail.com> 1790461946 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790461946 -0400\n\nGOOD TIMES: re-arm verified Atlanta fallback snapshot, 12h refresher, armed-state health (#157)\n\n* GOOD TIMES: re-arm verified Atlanta fallback snapshot and keep it refreshed\n\nThe embedded Atlanta snapshot (last-resort fallback when PostgREST fails,\nPGRST002/57014 incident class) was committed once on 2026-09-24 22:33Z with\nno refresher despite its ''Auto-refreshed'' header. It expired 2026-09-26\n10:33Z (36h max age): /api/health reported verified_snapshot_ready:false, a\nPostgREST stall + cold instance would return 503, and\nfinish-atlanta-occurrences.test.mjs failed, blocking every release build.\n\n- Refresh snapshot from gt_public_live_inventory_cache_only_v1 (same RPC the\n  gateway reads first): 100 events / 215 venues, Atlanta-only.\n- scripts/refresh-atlanta-fallback-snapshot.mjs refuses stale, date-mismatched,\n  wrong-city, schema-incomplete or count-collapsed payloads.\n- 12-hourly workflow (Node 24 per engines): data-only diff guard and full\n  test + production build gate before committing.\n- 7 new tests. No UI, taxonomy, navigation, schema or city-scope change.\n\n* GOOD TIMES: expose whether the fallback snapshot is armed in /api/health\n\nverified_snapshot_ready is only true while the snapshot is in use (content\nplane down), so an expired fallback was invisible while production looked\nhealthy. Adds fallback_snapshot_armed + fallback_snapshot_age_hours without\nchanging existing fields, ok/degraded semantics, or status codes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquEf6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADw0QABMuqX4oL7HQVPao8qt8H0tF\nGoojImd6ReiJu9Icfx4UhkGX+3jerFWK3fRbL1mJpkHfeJFhsCLub4Nr696tutgW\nOTyGbgfEeIRn1Q+Whxhh0TuvIPhzoPO2Deq52dLuy2tRSUFEq7i8LrHfg3puSFdI\n/Gtwa1z/qCA84s8viai/nsnayGiMLr5C8WdjPVXcl0CRwIRe+IOabmac6F5aBHQi\nKLQb5ueu9rahA+w4wSrbNOyACho5PmHDQIodgDp3eBEtp9G/1nKL28cmyiVJU+FO\nPZj2OEwDo3HdFIZA3ALLid6az06zDitgxbj4IuPkQqyUr4mtyUnAWr9f9KEbnjHL\nLOvm7WyQiobdOgOG728Uw90fva4FeLdTqvSJFDwu5WlOQL6MjSvjuX3xutA5NyjN\n4Z7IB75fUNL8IOVqwE3jy9aBuDRLnkT0M4el0FeCKBOH4gHbnN44YLGlUE/LKVnI\ndZ3sSElLMKf/o/FJTrxpV0eIovFjWJRmQ40k1pqMQ5MzFIbPDziFtFIJ2K1BjTc3\nY6EfC8x72Rd7iwL45JHnBB3L/we+cGAw4KPB2c3RfYfcRr1VVf+LCStUyuapmAdd\nYPzb6HMzQi+zWTC4S/Cz+sr0SVPAo6q/j9Q3sMYm3WF9WmzfNFk2EvXS7v33SXE6\nKue8+4JGb0yGuoQLEKTS\n=OwQF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T22:32:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starre