ate":"2026-09-24T10:14:27Z","email":"dolodorsey@gmail.com","name":"dolodorsey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:14:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GOOD TIMES: Instagram cold-traffic install funnel + attribution (#140)\n\n* GOOD TIMES: open install funnel to cold Instagram traffic + first/last-touch attribution\n\n- Render GoodTimesInstallPrompt for signed-out web visitors (still suppressed on native, standalone, recovery and direct-request routes). Reverses the session-only gate from #121 per IG acquisition plan.\n- Fix: @capacitor/core defines window.Capacitor on web, so the prompt treated every web visitor as installed and never rendered. Use isNativePlatform().\n- growth.js: capture utm_medium/utm_content/utm_term, persist first touch (write-once) and last touch (30-day TTL) in gt_attribution_v1, attach to gt_growth_events metadata and enterprise capture (medium, content_key, variant=first touch).\n- New events signup_complete (email signup) and first_action (first ticket/reservation/concierge/share). KHG gt_growth_events constraint + insert policy already extended.\n- Install prompt city strip is Atlanta-only.\n\n* Install pill for signed-out visitors only; members keep the dismissible install sheet\n\nCI caught the floating GET GOOD TIMES pill intercepting clicks on the member bottom nav (Saved/Plan). It was never visible before because the window.Capacitor bug suppressed the prompt entirely.","tree":{"sha":"9c0b1eb2d4b16ec9f36d08d0b9be656ac553885a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/trees/9c0b1eb2d4b16ec9f36d08d0b9be656ac553885a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dolodorsey/good-times-app/git/commits/0cd5eee7dd551ce4dcbc44bd13e2d6ae7b64b959","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c0b1eb2d4b16ec9f36d08d0b9be656ac553885a\nparent 10892c2004701d099249aa55749315cdd4bc440e\nauthor dolodorsey <dolodorsey@gmail.com> 1790244867 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790244867 -0400\n\nGOOD TIMES: Instagram cold-traffic install funnel + attribution (#140)\n\n* GOOD TIMES: open install funnel to cold Instagram traffic + first/last-touch attribution\n\n- Render GoodTimesInstallPrompt for signed-out web visitors (still suppressed on native, standalone, recovery and direct-request routes). Reverses the session-only gate from #121 per IG acquisition plan.\n- Fix: @capacitor/core defines window.Capacitor on web, so the prompt treated every web visitor as installed and never rendered. Use isNativePlatform().\n- growth.js: capture utm_medium/utm_content/utm_term, persist first touch (write-once) and last touch (30-day TTL) in gt_attribution_v1, attach to gt_growth_events metadata and enterprise capture (medium, content_key, variant=first touch).\n- New events signup_complete (email signup) and first_action (first ticket/reservation/concierge/share). KHG gt_growth_events constraint + insert policy already extended.\n- Install prompt city strip is Atlanta-only.\n\n* Install pill for signed-out visitors only; members keep the dismissible install sheet\n\nCI caught the floating GET GOOD TIMES pill intercepting clicks on the member bottom nav (Saved/Plan). It was never visible before because the window.Capacitor bug suppressed the prompt entirely.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtPgDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6o0QAK5mMUDlcZcZcEl6Qt2boFNu\nS5AIQjhYJNZXELHhH0qgcsYOqGummGHVUl/eVhxoG1xl8vQOPPN2er8Y0pDk9V63\nMSxp+zwRT6xZ0HLYlo135ct3Z4RDRAgpPEVpX63PB0Ws5O4R+LCmeKMRqfGMHJKU\nWNt5oWfYYEJ1L3Kpn4qGgcmJcnstF7k/NM7tS4zRTZhjB9c9YWMizV7yFkMV61OS\ne9XC32RgmLXE/HlrdA3k+Az2hsQrC59oxHMBcTAp/8c/HqwSX4Oi3TL/VPZOJOoD\n8U71RRO6rPTgIXaKadr87waM2DPocVhXHZqqpkOx4qpb4i5418lDpQahLwYa1KoM\nNWOpy4q8JtJidnNIPulBxk7Ij76kyxJc1i8/AwNkhW+bIhxkKUi39SbUYUTrKUKv\nlb0W1V8iO+knJ1YoKO5xPmpa2spyE/8qpaHK7D84kI63RMtQvOX2qlzi7enQ6ynw\npdIV/rjmcPDWPWPOvMynktj5OJqqgZslTdK4UllLVdQfSpomIA99m6g3UHGgJm39\nb8bdAZK33O294Dwers4y4BnwLL7QQu9DLPHrBKopt2SErDRx2Ef13LgVe2C3o7OV\nM