dy state is reused without starting new threads\n  - _do_preload() no longer overwrites loading state (caller already set it)\n- tools/local_asr_server/requirements.txt: add faster-whisper as required dep\n- tests/unit/test_local_asr_server_tool.py: 7 regression tests covering\n  - loading set before thread start\n  - duplicate preload does not spawn second thread\n  - ready reuse skips thread start\n  - failed allows re-preload\n  - _do_preload final state transitions (ready, failed, exception)\n- No real model download, no real transcription, no external API calls\n- All tests pass: 7 new + 86 existing + 136 baseline","tree":{"sha":"23c915bd943f2b0feac500c675e1eb0b47fb0648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CharmCheen/minddock/git/trees/23c915bd943f2b0feac500c675e1eb0b47fb0648"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CharmCheen/minddock/git/commits/089ea6a024c478c5c35eb6b943a339815031c9b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152878977?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CharmCheen","id":152878977,"login":"CharmCheen","node_id":"U_kgDOCRy_gQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CharmCheen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github