orative brand colors).\n  - BlogCard.astro SVG stroke + ContactForm.astro snackbar text (literal\n    contrast values over a fixed-color surface).\n\nVerified: npm test (33/33), npm run check (0 errors), npm run build\n(98 pages), npm run lint (clean, including no-raw-hex).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TCtkJ7J22Sg1twyd5vrm1b\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8fzWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhLgQABLH5lMkRoXYiNHu1S1kFDef\nVkz+tLZrliY9xPkOArQlkafYriig8S/1d21LBDLvQXGgpC6RZAWgj/s2PrqVy/yt\n1WcrOlDweCh3iKMHc2bphxTNt8XtUUgLecj1Z9HOq+03Tp+v+mX8R3FGcfMtwQU5\nf0IFWF8SgH+qmhbf3KGCmMZSlQGoHRLuHYaM712KvcKeTt6YdiANylaIXrUC2gVa\nnuBpGHxH2p4Iv3Igz/kFLp12o0HzuOHz30z9YedKZszMaLi0D2F9ZSIKtuEiFrFK\nXDrGRUskt/GWOwgtiydkYnxF2kND6GoDceDfcr/fQn5F5eWk4PLg7/ZMFux1N5Sb\nE7v6vmMRnoFyOoS3PVCNn8AMcfMpXZMUh6dmjgKDjunnpfzWYUfeilAQaNoB43ep\nJHLw3T2MiR9Sw84s2R3XUGovAqVhnwtY7eEjC20fZgUineXbs8dD4R1mDC6ZN8yo\nMqc6up2k0TL2u4wMHs5pGzVD9YI4yhsYk6toRm++H9tso4iFPYuoCJvvknJi/SV+\npcPXIg9MQng4YSpgjJl+hxkwk6U+Q4kM4IVLDz9B91H88J4dxQUjmL9CU57a98Yx\nFmjuHwermL65F/7lHkGx8G+80JAL1YucuXx8Trqm+mzaB+9V7q0OAOdr2saNPWIg\naLz3ET15MvyMPxMTwGG3\n=P9UM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-29T12:43:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_adm