o-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d92f8b535385db0f0f9e6d33e3aebf9955c4697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/trees/0d92f8b535385db0f0f9e6d33e3aebf9955c4697"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/commits/5189a0a88a50ea8e0acd1ad3551538e3effc7579","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d92f8b535385db0f0f9e6d33e3aebf9955c4697\nparent 1056926e3b04959e85ad03a4286c8c784ed468b5\nauthor Nicolás Gabriel Hruszczak <100943553+Nicolasgh91@users.noreply.github.com> 1777464792 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777464792 -0300\n\nrefactor: codebase audit phase 1 + 2 cleanup (#33)\n\nRemoves dead code, replaces hardcoded colors with tokens, consolidates\nthe duplicated FAQ component, extracts inline scripts and empty-state\nmarkup, and centralizes Footer collection loading.\n\nPhase 1 (safe deletions + token discipline):\n- Delete unused ProjectDemo.astro, LogoMarquee.astro, hero_templates.webp v1.\n- Document /schemas/ intent (backend-only, preserved for future consumer).\n- Replace literal hex (#fbbf24, #f59e0b, #475569, #94a3b8, #f1f5f9, #ffffff,\n  #34d399, #1d9e75, #eab308) with token vars across BlogCard, ProjectCard,\n  ContactForm, HeroSection.\n- Add --ease-out-expo and --ease-out-overshoot tokens; refactor CapabilityCard\n  and BlogCard to consume them.\n- Hoist a single posts query in blog/[slug].astro getStaticPaths and pass\n  related posts via props (drops one redundant getCollection call per page).\n\nPhase 2 (component consolidation):\n- Merge FAQAccordion into FaqSection via variant: \"default\" | \"darkBand\";\n  delete FAQAccordion.astro and update servicios.astro consumer.\n- Extract Footer collection loading into src/lib/footer-data.ts so the\n  component stays presentational and ordering rules live in one place.\n- Move chat widget bootstrap from inline <script> in Layout.astro to\n  /public/scripts/chat-widget.js (smaller HTML on every page; CSP-friendly).\n- Extract Nav.astro 140-line client controller into\n  src/components/scripts/nav-controller.ts (Nav.astro becomes markup-focused).\n- Add reusable EmptyState.astro and adopt in blog/index.astro and\n  plantillas.astro.\n\nVerified: npm test (33/33 pass), npm run check (0 errors), npm run build\n(98 pages built), npm run lint (clean).\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TCtkJ7J22Sg1twyd5vrm1b\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8fXYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASOoQAACB1xtiOQxA5JXOggWsNvPL\n+xManwO1BpB+nBRTJYCeWLO7vOpEgYU8Eeq3yG3XhOcYjr3s5Y6nhc3tnNGCPFoK\nHc5z3wp7aiI1zfBwuTpabICyJiXPu7mzrqv5+dw4PL/13S6KUBj92s0vKDRtcKCt\n6FoMrPIalE/9C40j5Js+bOwLGdfeDQmLReCmTfXum6INFccPWCBlJoTjS58bN2eS\no0+fpE4VBq3FFBk+3mjl9BkpC1RYI1TbdiQHdZeXf/hwS+xjOUXSTyuBWtby1rPr\n2XKwxaMuczKb3IBirjBCJIvI5S89THMuz/ATM5kHl3+llPs+oU9q8Id10uWxlnDR\nksAvfLC0sOHVN25gw+YVUsIDJEgEQ6Gaji46Frkb80FoPupGDJu9YrCP4Gpw8Iaw\nToK2lO84X/q6NHzV7uWfDxpWAS2fUhze3Wnw26c8UJkOKRN2bAWXDFzdq3pM6mXH\nQvvhD1VQtscx/5OeYSlb1uMZFV6fwkZtMsTOOO6visBQqP5qbYKpd+evy8diLB3R\nj1YSmYDW3Bew11Ce8h3DcJfGqyclnz0LN7tIHEkFJTJRMBGev3jMlKQQ0YgqeatB\nsY3mDT9pguY6jbN3tm5UNnqYeHFc+X/5CPyynbCjzitSWStiNb6kicbWDdn3ajnU\n6vDMFPjHdzBEdEQ2QzLg\n=N6VR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-29T12:13:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.co