RS and tighten postMessage targetOrigin\n\nSEC-002: isVercelPreview() previously matched any *.vercel.app hostname,\nallowing arbitrary Vercel-hosted sites to call /api/chat with a reflected\nAccess-Control-Allow-Origin. Scoped to VERCEL_PROJECT_NAME prefix so only\nthis project''s own preview deployments are permitted.\n\nAlso replaced the wildcard ''*'' targetOrigin in the chat iframe postMessage\nsend with window.location.origin, ensuring the close message is only\ndelivered to a same-origin iframe as intended.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01NvoqbRqTGKnhmBQ9zu2cPy","tree":{"sha":"994e2479d3056932fe39fb6fde511d56a9a74c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/trees/994e2479d3056932fe39fb6fde511d56a9a74c96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/commits/39ad6c9f9d1bdf686f73dbbdc1a07e63fe135813","verification":{"payload":"tree 994e2479d3056932fe39fb6fde511d56a9a74c96\nparent edd147dc043dea1f838175a4c348351fbcfec392\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1776135824 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1776135824 +0000\n\nfix(security): scope Vercel preview CORS and tighten postMessage targetOrigin\n\nSEC-002: isVercelPreview() previously matched any *.vercel.app hostname,\nallowing arbitrary Vercel-hosted sites to call /api/chat with a reflected\nAccess-Control-Allow-Origin. Scoped to VERCEL_PROJECT_NAME prefix so only\nthis project''s own preview deployments are permitted.\n\nAlso replaced the wildcard ''*'' targetOrigin in the chat iframe postMessage\nsend with window.location.origin, ensuring the close message is only\ndelivered to a same-origin iframe as intended.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01NvoqbRqTGKnhmBQ9zu2cPy\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAvoI+UP\n7tp3/InPAAfNTlW7/Tt9Vzvxp0xGvDVsOPkUyGMqLw72Cs7ZmE8h4Gd6+yM9Is3