lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/commits/7a1903a2388d87a52bcf62cbd7fcfccbc04688e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T15:56:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T15:56:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: remediate 14 code-review findings across security, perf, and hygiene\n\nSecurity:\n- H-01: replace innerHTML with textContent in i18n toggle\n- H-03: derive prompt origin from req.url with HTTPS allowlist guard\n- M-04: bound rate-limit map with probabilistic pruning + eviction\n- M-05: drop ''unsafe-inline'' from script-src; extract inline scripts to\n  public/scripts/ and move CSP from meta tag to vercel.json headers.\n  Also replace 19 onclick= handlers in Nav.astro with data-action attrs\n  + event delegation in controllers.js.\n\nPerformance:\n- M-07: lazy-load slide globs (filter first, await only matches)\n\nRefactor:\n- M-06: include schemas/*.ts and .astro/types.d.ts in tsconfig; run\n  astro sync before tsc so generated types are available.\n- M-08: decompose ServiceCard into 5 subcomponents (Media, Body,\n  ContactFooter, Price, Arrow) — public props API intact.\n- M-09: extract serviceAnchorId helper (src/lib/service-anchor-id.ts)\n- M-10: extract FAQ taxonomy constants (src/lib/faq-taxonomy.ts)\n- L-13: extract filterTocHeadings helper (src/lib/toc.ts)\n- L-14: AbortController pattern for SlideViewer keydown listener;\n  gate chat:close postMessage to only fire when widget is open.\n- L-15: convert Footer.astro and ContactForm.astro inline style=\"\"\n  attributes to Tailwind utilities with [length:var(--token)] for\n  typography. Add --color-danger token. Migrate 560px breakpoint\n  to Tailwind''s sm:. Extract FooterColumnHeader and FooterPill.\n\nHygiene:\n- L-11: remove unused SpeedInsights, GEMINI_API_KEY, getBreakerState\n- L-12: delete orphan lib/image-upload.js\n\nTech debt retained (documented):\n- style-src ''unsafe-inline'' stays in vercel.json until remaining\n  inline style=\"\" attributes outside Footer/ContactForm are migrated\n  (out of L-15 scope).\n- rate limiter is a local bandaid; Edge instances don''t share the map.\n  A TODO marks the KV/Upstash migration.\n\nVerification: npm run typecheck, npm run build, npm test all green\n(26/26 tests pass). Grep audits clean for innerHTML, hardcoded prod\nhost in loadJSON, text-[var(--text-size)] without length hint, and\nwindow.__slideEscBound flag.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7zygd3Fu3aurqSoidFuZF","tree":{"sha":"7de71468fcb86bcde7b242adc8fcb4d4f5280dd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/trees/7de71468fcb86bcde7b242adc8fcb4d4f5280dd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/commits/7a1903a2388d87a52bcf62cbd7fcfccbc04688e6","verification":{"payload":"tree 7de71468fcb86bcde7b242adc8fcb4d4f5280dd1\nparent 52de189274fbf9db928094fb6504e1115a48c1a9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1776009395 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1776009395 +0000\n\nfix: remediate 14 code-review findings across security, perf, and hygiene\n\nSecurity:\n- H-01: replace innerHTML with textContent in i18n toggle\n- H-03: derive prompt origin from req.url with HTTPS allowlist guard\n- M-04: bound rate-limit map with probabilistic pruning + eviction\n- M-05: drop ''unsafe-inline'' from script-src; extract inline scripts to\n  public/scripts/ and move CSP from meta tag to vercel.json headers.\n  Also replace 19 onclick= handlers in Nav.astro with data-action attrs\n  + event delegation in controllers.js.\n\nPerformance:\n- M-07: lazy-load slide globs (filter first, await only matches)\n\nRefactor:\n- M-06: include schemas/*.ts and .astro/types.d.ts in tsconfig; run\n  astro sync before tsc so generated types are available.\n- M-08: decompose ServiceCard into 5 subcomponents (Media, Body,\n  ContactFooter, Price, Arrow) — public props API intact.\n- M-09: extract serviceAnchorId helper (src/lib/service-anchor-id.ts)\n- M-10: extract FAQ taxonomy constants (src/lib/faq-taxonomy.ts)\n- L-13: extract filterTocHeadings helper (src/lib/toc.ts)\n- L-14: AbortController pattern for SlideViewer keydown listener;\n  gate chat:close postMessage to only fire when widget is open.\n- L-15: convert Footer.astro and ContactForm.astro inline style=\"\"\n  attributes to Tailwind utilities with [length:var(--token)] for\n  typography. Add --color-danger token. Migrate 560px breakpoint\n  to Tailwind''s sm:. Extract FooterColumnHeader and FooterPill.\n\nHygiene:\n- L-11: remove unused SpeedInsights, GEMINI_API_KEY, getBreakerState\n- L-12: delete orphan lib/image-upload.js\n\nTech debt retained (documented):\n- style-src ''unsafe-inline'' stays in vercel.json until remaining\n  inline style=\"\" attributes outside Footer/ContactForm are migrated\n  (out of L-15 scope).\n- rate limiter is a local bandaid; Edge instances don''t share the map.\n  A TODO marks the KV/Upstash migration.\n\nVerification: npm run typecheck, npm run build, npm test all green\n(26/26 tests pass). Grep audits clean for innerHTML, hardcoded prod\nhost in loadJSON, text-[var(--text-size)] without length hint, and\nwindow.__slideEscBound flag.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7zygd3Fu3