55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T23:40:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: allow Vercel preview deploy origins in chat API CORS\n\nThe Edge Function CORS check only allowed production domains and\nlocalhost. Vercel preview deploy URLs (*.vercel.app) were rejected\nwith 403, preventing the chatbot from working on branch previews.\n\nAdd isVercelPreview() helper and include it in all three origin\nchecks: corsHeaders, OPTIONS preflight, and POST gate.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01RgAn5qTmuk2ZcMRnCRF9zu","tree":{"sha":"0dfe6711ce4737665639fffa28145f51abf06fa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/trees/0dfe6711ce4737665639fffa28145f51abf06fa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/commits/de2493e3b6555bcd8f3eab71d4b98837ec1e58fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 0dfe6711ce4737665639fffa28145f51abf06fa6\nparent 67c216a0c4ea9311683d4e83ba5cc4805fe94ac2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1775950855 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1775950855 +0000\n\nfix: allow Vercel preview deploy origins in chat API CORS\n\nThe Edge Function CORS check only allowed production domains and\nlocalhost. Vercel preview deploy URLs (*.vercel.app) were rejected\nwith 403, preventing the chatbot from working on branch previews.\n\nAdd isVercelPreview() helper and include it in all three origin\nchecks: corsHeaders, OPTIONS preflight, and POST gate.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01RgAn5qTmuk2ZcMRnCRF9zu\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEHgRBG2\nnNLSau3CqQGE49ijvdCWxG2fnc9knd6R1/jNc8R5KJWCC5NR+lMV5NvGWhtJSd7e/ghpkS8MSFA6\nMwc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-11T23:41:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"htt