tagram. Colores --nav-text-idle →\nhover --accent. Links con target=_blank rel=noopener noreferrer.\n\nNAV-005: Punto indicador activo via ::after en .nav-tab.active (4px,\ncircular, --accent). Aparece/desaparece por opacity transition. Respeta\nprefers-reduced-motion y la clase .no-motion del sistema de a11y.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01AYDcFX9PrtkAMn2pXQ6hpq","tree":{"sha":"6702e30d9ba8e64892bd6cf7576802c0de3b3777","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/trees/6702e30d9ba8e64892bd6cf7576802c0de3b3777"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/commits/98aa5de02e298a3eb0f15bbdfc99e1b640ca552c","verification":{"payload":"tree 6702e30d9ba8e64892bd6cf7576802c0de3b3777\nparent da7f2f01b4493037dd7e410e5ccba75053a7c9fe\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774037706 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774037706 +0000\n\nfeat(nav): rediseño navbar v2 — accesibilidad, tokens, dropdown, animación\n\nNAV-001: Reemplaza colores hardcodeados (#111, #e08e00, rgba) por tokens\nsemánticos (--color-on-accent, --color-accent-500, --accent-glow).\nAñade los dos tokens faltantes a tokens.css.\n\nNAV-006: Elimina role=\"dialog\" incorrecto del drawer mobile; cambia\naria-label a \"Menú móvil\" para evitar duplicar el del <nav> principal.\n\nNAV-002: Convierte \"Servicios B2B\" en un <button aria-haspopup> con panel\nrole=\"menu\" y cuatro <a role=\"menuitem\"> con rutas reales (#agentes-ia,\n#ecommerce, #automatizacion, #landing). Navegación completa por teclado\n(Tab, Enter, Escape, flechas). El drawer mobile expande los sub-links\ndirectamente como .drawer-link--sub.\n\nNAV-003: Añade @keyframes cta-pulse envuelto en @media\n(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference). Agrega :root.no-motion .nav-cta\n{ animation: none }. Extiende nhA11y.setReducedMotion() en Layout.astro\npara también togglear la clase .no-motion en <html>.\n\nNAV-004: Añade .drawer-social al footer del drawer con iconos SVG inline\nde GitHub, LinkedIn, X/Twitter e Instagram. Colores --nav-text-idle →\nhover --accent. Links con target=_blank rel=noopener noreferrer.\n\nNAV-005: Punto indicador activo via ::after en .nav-tab.active (4px,\ncircular, --accent). Aparece/desaparece por opacity transition. Respeta\nprefers-reduced-motion y la clase .no-motion del sistema de a11y.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01AYDcFX9PrtkAMn2pXQ6hpq\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ9CeKal\neHsdyOR70kPnQzDjj6vhWcbQuE90RGSymhoXQ0yMpXdxRC/pvhtVCNRMwk/XNUEJxxFDkVefXdQF\nmAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-20T20:15:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/commit/98aa5de02e298a3eb0f15bbdfc99e1b640ca552c","node_id":"C_kwDORom1idoAKDk4YWE1ZGUwMmUyOThhM2ViMGYxNWJiZGZjOTllMWI2NDBjYTU1MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/commit/da7f2f01b4493037dd7e410e5ccba75053a7c9fe","sha":"da7f2f01b4