ve/overflow-hidden → inline style\nReplaced: motion-safe:transition-colors hover:text-[...] → .footer-link\n  and .footer-social-link with @media prefers-reduced-motion transitions\nReplaced: bottom bar inline style → .footer-bottom (scoped)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01ALPMTJp8Y97pYLaXxAwogk","tree":{"sha":"a20a1a838e6845f9bedd4567d37121c718cd28e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/trees/a20a1a838e6845f9bedd4567d37121c718cd28e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/commits/f1101fcc2d962eea9cac8b7a16c9a5b58c100491","verification":{"payload":"tree a20a1a838e6845f9bedd4567d37121c718cd28e3\nparent a5a33d91c5df1e2516df10f9751a73354f6fe271\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774037605 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774037605 +0000\n\nfix(footer): replace Tailwind utilities with scoped CSS + inline styles\n\nThe project uses custom CSS classes from tokens.css and scoped <style>\nblocks for layout — Tailwind utilities were not being generated, so the\n4-column grid, hover transitions, and positioning had no effect.\n\nReplaced: grid/grid-cols/col-span → .footer-grid/.footer-brand (scoped)\nReplaced: absolute/top/right/rounded-full → .footer-glow (scoped)\nReplaced: relative/overflow-hidden → inline style\nReplaced: motion-safe:transition-colors hover:text-[...] → .footer-link\n  and .footer-social-link with @media prefers-reduced-motion transitions\nReplaced: bottom bar inline style → .footer-bottom (scoped)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01ALPMTJp8Y97pYLaXxAwogk\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQE/Hohge\nS+OzRLgbNAiKcP9wQ1DfkFim3vItHuIootyH+UFAsWTLYZ/60FWSe0wdkYDyKGL4l9j+RoDh1V3X\nVwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-20T20:13:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi