{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/commits/2f21e3ac8634bc686c9672b2e79fbad9a383fef6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T12:38:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T12:38:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(security): implement 14 security tasks (SEC-001 to SEC-014)\n\nSprint 0 — Production patches:\n- SEC-001: Move system prompt construction to server-side (api/chat.js)\n- SEC-002: Improve rate limiting (10 req/min, Retry-After header)\n- SEC-003: Input length limits (2000 chars) and history truncation (20 msgs)\n- SEC-004: Restrictive CORS (replace wildcard with allowed origins)\n- SEC-005: Add CSP meta tag in Layout.astro\n- SEC-006: Validate Content-Type (reject non-JSON with 415)\n- SEC-007: Sanitize error messages (no internal details exposed)\n- SEC-008: Disable textarea during loading\n\nSprint 1 — Pre-tier 2 hardening:\n- SEC-009: Validate iframe parent origin before reading CSS tokens\n- SEC-010: Reusable circuit breaker module (lib/circuit-breaker.js)\n- SEC-011: Fetch timeout wrapper with AbortController (lib/fetch-with-timeout.js)\n- SEC-012: Zod schemas for all tier 2+ entities (schemas/)\n- SEC-013: Supabase RLS policies migration (supabase/migrations/)\n- SEC-014: Image upload validation with magic bytes (lib/image-upload.js)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01EM2VJAupXnKyt5T4fCmdZL","tree":{"sha":"2fc9a0720847622181376950832465d9fb2ae3a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/trees/2fc9a0720847622181376950832465d9fb2ae3a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nicolasgh91/portfolio/git/commits/2f21e3ac8634bc686c9672b2e79fbad9a383fef6","verification":{"payload":"tree 2fc9a0720847622181376950832465d9fb2ae3a3\nparent