:"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/2d5e534731b67624b47305f567e8efabb28eaa51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:21:56Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(config): config.xmi wird wieder gelesen - xsi-Namensraum deklariert\n\nDie Datei nutzt xsi:type, deklarierte xmlns:xsi aber nicht. Seit EMFTs next.4\nlehnt der Parser das ab (\"Unbound namespace prefix\"), gene fiel still auf die\neingebaute Startliste zurueck. Dort stehen eorm-wizard,\nsensinact-mapping-wizard und icons-cwm, in config.xmi fehlten sie - mit\nlesbarer Datei waeren sie nicht mehr gestartet. Deshalb hier nachgetragen;\ngeladen wird damit dasselbe wie bisher.","tree":{"sha":"a26403f893a7cb8d7cbc251545f22db744d41369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/a26403f893a7cb8d7cbc251545f22db744d41369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/2d5e534731b67624b47305f567e8efabb28eaa51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/2d5e534731b67624b47305f567e8efabb28eaa51","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDJkNWU1MzQ3MzFiNjc2MjRiNDczMDVmNTY3ZThlZmFiYjI4ZWFhNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e","sha":"2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e"}],"sha":"2d5e534731b67624b47305f567e8efabb28eaa51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/2d5e534731b67624b47305f567e8efabb28eaa51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:21:56Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(release): geteilte Bibliotheken TSM-konform - ganz, mit echter Version, im Manifest angefordert\n\nIm Release-Build startete gene nicht: \"serviceId is not a function\". Der Host\nregistrierte unter @eclipse-daanse/tsm nur injectable/singleton/inject, die\nPlugins nutzen seit TSM 0.1 das Komponentenmodell (component, bind,\nserviceId, ...). Im Dev-Server importiert jedes Plugin TSM selbst, dort fiel\nes nie auf. Bei PrimeVue dieselbe Fehlerklasse: DatePicker (DMN-Editor) fehlte\nin der handgepflegten Liste.\n\n- Host (src/main.ts): jede geteilte Bibliothek ganz, unter ihrer installierten\n  Version. Die Versionen liest vite.config.ts beim Build aus node_modules\n  (__SHARED_LIBRARY_VERSIONS__) - vorher standen dort erfundene Nummern\n  (@emfts/core als 1.0.0, TSM als 1.0.0).\n- Plugins: jedes Manifest deklariert unter sharedDependencies, was es zur\n  Laufzeit importiert, mit Versionsbereich. TSM prueft das vor dem Start und\n  meldet Fehlendes mit Namen statt spaeter \"x is not a function\".\n- Bereiche mit Vorabversion (^0.3.0-next.4 usw.): TSM prueft ohne\n  includePrerelease, \">=0.1.0\" laesst 0.3.0-next.4 nicht durch. eorm- und\n  SensiNact-Assistent hatten solche Bereiche; sie passten nur, weil der Host\n  falsche Versionen meldete.\n\nGeprueft mit lokalem Release-Build (35 Plugins) im Headless-Browser: die\nOberflaeche startet, keine fehlenden oder unpassenden Bibliotheken.","tree":{"sha":"941cd708bca44a1e45fde5c3fbcafa43e5fd4305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/941cd708bca44a1e45fde5c3fbcafa43e5fd4305"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDJlNDQyMTRlYzI3OGMzYzY1MDQ5ODVmMjFlNjRmYjk5NjY3OTQyN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/9107ad0815654497e829a98929743b5e9bbd8c58","sha":"9107ad0815654497e829a98929743b5e9bbd8c58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/9107ad0815654497e829a98929743b5e9bbd8c58"}],"sha":"2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/2e44214ec278c3c6504985f21e64fb996679427e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/9107ad0815654497e829a98929743b5e9bbd8c58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:43:00Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:21:56Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(xml-editor): Aenderungen gehen ins Tab-Dokument, nicht in die Prop\n\nESLint (vue/no-mutating-props) brach den CI-Lauf von #170 ab: der Editor\nschrieb Text und dirty-Flag direkt in die document-Prop. Jetzt holt er das\nDokument des Tabs aus dem Speicher und schreibt dorthin - dasselbe Objekt,\nohne die Prop zu veraendern. setTabDocument nimmt dirty optional (TS2783).","tree":{"sha":"02687f3a0260bcd4ebf0916b09a79898f59f273e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/02687f3a