ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b553f39a237d934108f979f3183aedd0416a3453/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:21:50Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(mapping-wizard): die Gruppe ist die mid des Services\n\nSchritt 4 fuehrte nur Anzeigenamen. Die mid entstand erst beim Schreiben als\nSlug daraus, und beim Oeffnen wurde umgekehrt der Name bevorzugt. Ein\nbestehendes Mapping mit `<services mid=\"quality\"><name name=\"Water Quality\"/>`\nkam damit als Gruppe „Water Quality\" herein und ging als `mid=\"water-quality\"`\nwieder hinaus — die technische Id wechselte still, und wer den Anzeigenamen\naenderte, benannte den Service um.\n\nDie Spalte „Gruppe (mid)\" fuehrt jetzt die mid: beim Oeffnen wird sie\nuebernommen, beim Schreiben unveraendert gesetzt. Damit sie das ueberlebt,\nprueft der Schritt die Eingabe — Kleinbuchstaben, Ziffern und Bindestriche,\nkeine Leerzeichen. Ungueltige Gruppen sind in der Zeile markiert und sperren\n„Weiter\" mit Begruendung.","tree":{"sha":"bbd8790aff388d6eaee2d4444d4ed33d9179bebc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/bbd8790aff388d6eaee2d4444d4ed33d9179bebc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/b553f39a237d934108f979f3183aedd0416a3453","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/b553f39a237d934108f979f3183aedd0416a3453","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGI1NTNmMzlhMjM3ZDkzNDEwOGY5NzlmMzE4M2FlZGQwNDE2YTM0NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d","sha":"b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d"}],"sha":"b553f39a237d934108f979f3183aedd0416a3453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b553f39a237d934108f979f3183aedd0416a3453"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:06:05Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(modelle): Metamodelle tragen ihre nsURI, der Ort steht in der URI-Abbildung\n\nSeit @emfts/core 0.3 haben EClassifier eine Resource, und XMLSave.getHref()\nschreibt einen Verweis darauf gegen das Dokument aufgeloest\n(`waterpark_domain.ecore#//WaterQuality`). Fuer eine Datei neben der Instanz\nist das richtig; ein Metamodell aus dem Model Atlas hat dafuer keinen\nBezugspunkt, und der Verweis ist beim naechsten Laden nicht mehr aufloesbar —\ngenau die \"Unresolved reference\"-Meldungen im Problems-Panel.\n\nStatt den Serializer zu ueberschreiben, heisst die Resource jetzt so, wie ein\nVerweis sie nennt: nach ihrer nsURI. Der Pfad geht in die URI-Abbildung des\nResource-Sets. Damit schreibt derselbe Serializer wieder `nsURI#//Klasse`, und\nDateien mit altem Pfad-href laden weiter — `getResource()` vergleicht seit\nemf.ts#110 durch den URIConverter.\n\nDazu gehoert ein gemeinsames Resource-Set: Ein Verweis aus einer Instanz wird\ngegen die Resourcen *dieses* Sets aufgeloest, und delegatedGetResource() fragt\ndie Registry mit der rohen URI (wie Java EMF). ui-instance-tree bietet sein Set\nals Dienst `gene.resourceset` an, der Model Browser uebernimmt es beim\nAktivieren — ueber den Dienst, ohne neue Abhaengigkeit zwischen den Plugins.\n\nGeparst wird weiter unter dem Pfad: hrefs *innerhalb* einer .ecore sind relativ\nund loesen nur so auf. Der Umzug auf die nsURI passiert danach.\n\nDazu:\n- @emfts/core auf 0.3.0-next.3 (bringt #110)\n- vite.config: Alias auf einen lokalen emfts-Checkout ueber EMFTS_LOCAL\n- der Dedupe-Test ruht bei lokalem Checkout: die App bekommt dann den\n  tsc-Build, der uimodel-composer behaelt die minifizierte Kopie\n\n450 Tests gruen, type-check 967 wie auf main.","tree":{"sha":"42c105c8a81e70af08b372ea148a539d8aa5a6f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/42c105c8a81e70af08b372ea148a539d8aa5a6f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGIxMTVmNzdmYjI4ZTk2YWIyNGFkMDBkNDQ1MDcwMjRjNTM2YzE2OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c","sha":"720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c"}],"sha":"b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b115f77fb28e96ab24ad00d44507024c536c169d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:45:09Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(atlas-browser): die Transitions zeigen die Stage der Auswahl\n\nWer im Baum ein Mapping in `release` ansieht und auf Transitions wechselt, sah\ndort `draft` vorgewaehlt — das Panel nahm immer die erste Stage der Registry.\n\nEs nimmt jetzt die Stage der Auswahl: ein Objekt- oder Schema-Knoten traegt sie\nin seinen Metadaten, ein Stage-Knoten im Namen. Nur wenn die Auswahl keine\nhergibt, bleibt es bei der ersten.","tree":{"sha":"5781dacc1f8dfd306fd5856fd7a852257c6e0c6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/5781dacc1f8dfd306fd5856fd7a852257c6e0c6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDcyMDY1NmEzOTdlYWVmY2EwYWY2MTUxOTNjNDdkNDE1ZjNkOGMwMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/dffc99932e439d67fab8c3c5844e2cbbd6eafdd3","sha":"dffc99932e439d67fab8c3c5844e2cbbd6eafdd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/dffc99932e439d67fab8c3c5844e2cbbd6eafdd3"}],"sha":"720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/720656a397eaefca0af615193c47d415f3d8c00c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/dffc99932e439d67fab8c3c5844e2cbbd6eafdd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:39:16Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(atlas-browser): Baumzustand ueberdauert den View-Wechsel, Transitions laden selbst\n\nWelche Zeilen offen sind und welche gewaehlt ist, lag in der Baum-Komponente.\nEin Wechsel der Ansicht haengt sie ab, und beim naechsten Oeffnen stand der\nBaum wieder zugeklappt da. Beides liegt jetzt im geteilten Zustand des\nAtlas-Browsers, neben den Knoten selbst.\n\nDas Transitions-Panel zeigte, was der Baum geladen hatte: Bis jemand die Stage\naufklappte, stand dort \"No objects loaded in stage … Expand the stage in the\ntree first\" — ein Panel, dessen Inhalt davon abhing, wohin vorher geklickt\nworden war. Zusammen mit dem zuklappenden Baum war es nach jedem Wechsel leer.\n\nEs fragt jetzt selbst nach der Stage, die es zeigt (`ensureStageLoaded`); die\nObjekte landen an derselben Stelle wie zuvor, es bleibt bei einer Quelle. Die\nMeldung bei wirklich leerer Stage sagt das jetzt auch, statt eine Anweisung zu\ngeben.","tree":{"sha":"29fc4c0b2c43393e4d86d7e7fb06e65c8fcce54d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/29fc4c0b2c43393e4d86d7e7fb06e65c8fcce54d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/dffc99932e439d67fab8c3c5844e2cbbd6eafdd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daans