"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/de8e27a89d751a90909577735770f38e162a5fcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:20:56Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(atlas): Download statt \"Add Instances to Workspace\"; Dialog fragt Name und Verzeichnis\n\nIm Atlas-Baum und im Detailpanel heisst die Aktion jetzt \"Download...\".\nEin Dialog fragt Dateiname und Zielverzeichnis (Ordner der lokalen\nExplorer-Quellen, vorbelegt mit dem Ordner der Auswahl) und warnt, wenn die\nDatei schon existiert. Danach steht sie im Explorer und oeffnet mit ihrem\nStandard-Editor im eigenen Tab. Fuer Schemas bleibt \"Add Model to Workspace\".\n\nDie Frage, ob eine XMI allein oder mit anderen in einem Editor oeffnet, ist\nmit einem Tab je Datei hinfaellig: loadInstances ohne Modus oeffnet\nSTANDALONE.","tree":{"sha":"aa4e4486e29b7f29960cb37083307a35086baa88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/aa4e4486e29b7f29960cb37083307a35086baa88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/de8e27a89d751a90909577735770f38e162a5fcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/de8e27a89d751a90909577735770f38e162a5fcf","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGRlOGUyN2E4OWQ3NTFhOTA5MDk1Nzc3MzU3NzBmMzhlMTYyYTVmY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84","sha":"95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84"}],"sha":"de8e27a89d751a90909577735770f38e162a5fcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/de8e27a89d751a90909577735770f38e162a5fcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T07:29:03Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(explorer): Datei-Menue nur mit installiertem Editor; Atlas-Upload nur mit Atlas-Browser\n\nJede Editor-Art haelt eine Pflichtreferenz auf das Plugin, das sie ausfuehrt.\nOhne Plugin ist die Art nicht registriert - \"Oeffnen mit\" und der Klick auf\ndie Datei erreichen keinen Editor, den es nicht gibt; kommt das Plugin, ist\ndie Art wieder da. Der Datengenerator oeffnet ueber seinen Lader.\n\nIm Explorer fallen die fest verdrahteten Eintraege je Endung weg (Edit\nMetamodel, Load Transformation, Open in Data Generator, Open in DMN Editor):\ndas sind die Arten aus \"Oeffnen mit\". \"Publish to Atlas...\" erscheint fuer\n.ecore (Schema) und .xmi (Objekt) nur, wenn der Atlas-Browser geladen ist -\nbisher hing es an einem Vue-inject, den niemand bereitstellt, und war immer\nausgegraut. \"Send to Server\" fuer Constraints nur mit Atlas-Browser.","tree":{"sha":"bf176b309d0395f2085dedc4da83fdd7a72055b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/bf176b309d0395f2085dedc4da83fdd7a72055b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDk1ZDQ3ZDQwOTZhMzg5NDExNjcyYWNhMjRlNzEwZjE0MDQwYmRmODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a","sha":"b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a"}],"sha":"95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/95d47d4096a389411672aca24e710f14040bdf84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:59:10Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"refactor(sensinact): ein Assistent je Tab - Kontext statt Modul-Zustand\n\nDer Assistent war ein Singleton: wizard/context.ts hielt Dokument, Setup,\nSensormodell, Status und Dialog-Flags als Modul-Variablen, und der Tab war\ndas eine Mitte-Panel seiner Perspektive. Ein zweites Mapping ueberschrieb das\nerste im selben Tab.\n\ncreateWizardContext() liefert diesen Zustand jetzt je Tab; wizardContextFor\nhaelt ihn an der Tab-Id (sensinact:<datei>, sensinact:atlas/<registry>/<id>,\nsensinact:neu-<n>). WizardTab stellt den Kontext per provide, Shell,\nSchritte, Widgets und Dialoge nehmen ihn mit useWizardContext(); openMapping\nund artifacts bekommen ihn als Parameter. Geteilt bleibt die Atlas-Verbindung.\n\nAlle Oeffner - der Dienst ui.sensinact-wizard.open(file, content), die\nExplorer-Aktion, die Atlas-Aktion, die Editor-Art - laufen ueber\nopenWizardTab; dieselbe Datei trifft denselben Tab. Das Menue wirkt auf den\nvorderen Tab; Perspektive, Panel und Aktivitaet des Assistenten entfallen.\n\nTests auf Kontext-Instanzen umgestellt; neu: zwei Tabs mischen sich nicht.\nIm Browser: zwei Mappings nebeneinander, Wechsel behaelt jedes seinen Stand,\n''Neues Mapping'' oeffnet einen dritten Tab.","tree":{"sha":"8fd3b393cf08d334766c8c93913c5f8b82f75d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/8fd3b393cf08d334766c8c93913c5f8b82f75d90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGI5Mzc4NDBmOWYwNjk3YzU2ZTdiMmE3ZjdkNzlhNmRjMDc0ZDM0N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/3b180c900910da846a863f7f94fbd2b2536f887e","sha":"3b180c900910da846a863f7f94fbd2b2536f887e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3b180c900910da846a863f7f94fbd2b2536f887e"}],"sha":"b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b937840f9f0697c56e7b2a7f7d79a6dc074d347a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3b180c900910da846a863f7f94fbd2b2536f887e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:45:54Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(xml-editor): der Text-Tab heisst ''<Datei> (XML)''\n\nNeben dem Instanz- oder Metamodell-Tab derselben Datei stand ein zweiter Tab\nmit demselben Namen - nicht zu unterscheiden, bis man ihn anklickt.","tree":{"sha":"f580bb4550cccec5d40b53ab35f51aaf6259f1d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/f580bb4550cccec5d40b53ab35f51aaf6259f1d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/3b180c900910da846a863f7f94fbd2b2536f887e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"