rs/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/5a6ce673f1ac7e1d200e387781c7c9e1495c9198/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T06:41:54Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(sensinact): die Ansicht oeffnet die Datei; der Instanz-Lader fragt den Resolver\n\nEin Klick auf ein Mapping waehlt per nsURI die Ansicht ''SensiNact-Mapping'' -\nderen open() schaltete nur die Perspektive um und liess die Datei liegen: der\nAssistent stand mit ''Neues Mapping'' und ohne Sensormodell da. Jetzt reicht\ndie Ansicht Datei und Inhalt durch, und der Oeffner des Assistenten laedt das\nMapping wie ''Im Mapping-Assistenten oeffnen''.\n\nDer Instanz-Lader fragt vor dem Laden den Metamodell-Resolver nach allen\nNamensraeumen, die eine Datei deklariert: eventatlas.xmi neben seiner\ndeployment.ecore scheiterte bisher, weil die .ecore nicht in den\nmodelSources stand.","tree":{"sha":"8674376eaeb8de8cc7577171054e2e5b52e8c51d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/8674376eaeb8de8cc7577171054e2e5b52e8c51d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/5a6ce673f1ac7e1d200e387781c7c9e1495c9198","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/5a6ce673f1ac7e1d200e387781c7c9e1495c9198","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDVhNmNlNjczZjFhYzdlMWQyMDBlMzg3NzgxYzdjOWUxNDk1YzkxOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394","sha":"6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394"}],"sha":"5a6ce673f1ac7e1d200e387781c7c9e1495c9198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/5a6ce673f1ac7e1d200e387781c7c9e1495c9198"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:31:45Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(app): Metamodelle per nsURI fuer alle - der Wizard fragt den Host, bevor er warnt\n\nOeffnete man ein Mapping zuerst im SensiNact-Assistenten, fehlte das\nSensormodell, bis man dasselbe Mapping einmal im Instanz-Editor geoeffnet\nhatte: der Assistent kannte nur Registry und seine eigene Atlas-Verbindung,\nder Instanz-Lader dagegen auch die .ecore-Dateien des Workspace und dessen\nAtlas-Kette.\n\ngene-app veroeffentlicht diese Kette jetzt als ''gene.metamodel.resolver'':\nRegistry, dann die .ecore-Dateien des Workspace, dann die Atlas-Provider\n(Herkunft der Datei plus Resolver-Kette der Workspace-Einstellungen). Was\ngefunden wird, laeuft ueber loadEcoreFile des Model Browsers - eine Instanz,\nin Registry und Modell-Liste. Die Provider-Sammlung teilen sich der\nInstanz-Lader (prepareAtlasResolution) und der Resolver.\n\nDer Assistent uebernimmt den Dienst wie Dateisystem und Atlas-Browser und\nfragt ihn beim Oeffnen nach allen unbekannten nsURIs, bevor er zur eigenen\nAtlas-Quelle greift oder warnt.\n\nTests: Resolver findet im Workspace, laesst Registriertes in Ruhe, meldet\nFehlendes. Gesamte Suite gruen.","tree":{"sha":"203d92bb63712edc7c09a807aeed99a78333c55d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/203d92bb63712edc7c09a807aeed99a78333c55d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDY2NTBjMWNmMmY5M2NmMDEwMzRlYmU5ZTc4OWI2MDZlZmNkMzczOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9","sha":"01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9"}],"sha":"6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/6650c1cf2f93cf01034ebe9e789b606efcd37394"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:18:30Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"refactor(sensinact): das Mapping schreibt der EMFTs-Serializer, nicht mehr ein Text-Template\n\nDer Assistent baute die ProviderMapping-XMI als Text zusammen, aus zwei\nGruenden, die es nicht mehr gibt: nsURI-basierte hrefs und xsi:type an den\nFeature-Referenzen konnte der Serializer frueher nicht.\n\nJetzt liegen die Sensormodelle unter ihrer nsURI als Resource-URI; die\nDateinamen, mit denen Modelle einander nennen (lorawan-uplink.ecore#//X),\nsind Aliase, die der URI-Converter des ResourceSets aufloest - so, wie EMF\neine nsURI ohnehin als Resource-URI versteht. Damit schreibt @emfts/core die\nhrefs selbst nsURI-basiert, setzt die Typpraefixe, und entscheidet\nReferenzen im Dokument nach seinen Regeln (ID-Attribut, sonst Pfad).\n\nDas Mapping, die Regeln-Datei und das Profil entstehen als EObjects des\ndynamisch geladenen Mapping-Metamodells und gehen durch saveToString().\nNebenwirkung: die Querverweise zwischen Atlas-Modellen loesen jetzt\nunabhaengig vom Resource-Namen auf (crossReferences.test).\n\nGolden-/Round-Trip-Tests angepasst, wo der Kern korrektes EMF anders\nschreibt als das Template: xsi:type am changeRule (ChangeRule ist abstrakt),\nZahlen ohne Nachkommastelle. Gesamte Suite 500 Tests gruen.","tree":{"sha":"df5f0e71f157abde9bcfc149ea942e91bc667b38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/df5f0e71f157abde9bcfc149ea942e91bc667b38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDAxYWIzYzhiNzJkZmNhNGE4MjgxZTdlMzkzNjdjN2FmNjMzM2U4Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f","sha":"cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f"}],"sha":"01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/01ab3c8b72dfca4a8281e7e39367c7af6333e8c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:48:44Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(instanzen): keine xmi:id fuer Klassen mit ID-Attribut - Referenzen nennen den Schluessel\n\nSeit @emfts/core 0.3.0-next.4 adressiert eine Resource ein Objekt ueber sein\nID-Attribut, bevor sie einen Pfad baut (wie EcoreUtil.getID in Java). Eine\nxmi:id hat aber Vorrang - und gene gab jedem Objekt beim Anlegen sofort eine\nUUID, lange bevor der Schluessel getippt war. Beim Speichern und beim Upload\nin den Atlas stand deshalb in jeder Referenz die UUID statt des Schluessels,\ngenau wie unter next.2.\n\nassignXmiId vergibt fuer eine Klasse mit ID-Attribut jetzt keine xmi:id mehr;\neine aus der Datei gelesene bleibt. generateMissingXmiIds laesst solche\nObjekte ebenfalls aus; updateXmiIdFromAttribute hat nichts mehr zu tun.\n\nTest mit dynamischem Modell: mit ID-Attribut other=\"B\" ohne xmi:id, ohne\nID-Attribut weiter UUIDs, vorhandene xmi:id bleibt.","tree":{"sha":"c714876fe4af902f7394ef1aa5e858d3aa179f84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/c714876fe4af902f7394ef1aa5e858d3aa179f84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGNkYzIxMzk1YmMxY2IzZTZiNDQ0YjdhNzk4M2VjZDk0MGIyNzMzMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/742e4555dfc379e2228ab24ef5d1cbdc70d09928","sha":"742e4555dfc379e2228ab24ef5d1cbdc70d09928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/742e4555dfc379e2228ab24ef5d1cbdc70d09928"}],"sha":"cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/cdc21395bc1cb3e6b444b7a7983ecd940b27331f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/742e4555dfc379e2228ab24ef5d1cbdc70d09928/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:20:51Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(sensinact): fehlende Sensorklasse auch als Proxy erkennen; Lock ohne alte Kernkopien\n\nSeit @emfts/core 0.3.0-next.4 ist eine Klasse aus einem fehlenden Modell ein\nsauberer Proxy mit vollem EClass-Interface - die Pruefung auf getEPackage\ngriff nicht mehr, der Assistent lief mit Warnungen weiter statt verstaendlich\nabzubrechen. Jetzt zaehlt eIsProxy() mit.\n\nDer Querverweis-Test dokumentiert die Grenze weiter (url-kodierte nsURIs als\nResource-Namen loesen nicht auf), prueft aber den unaufgeloesten Proxy statt\neines Wurfs, den der Kern nicht mehr macht.\n\npackage-lock: die verwaisten Eintraege der 0.2.0-next.2-Kopien in den beiden\nAssistenten entfernt, npm legte sie sonst bei jedem Install wieder an.\n\nGesamte Suite: 497 Tests gruen.","tree":{"sha":"6b07b3f94fee4a0e74bf1e45f54795a10a39cd5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/6b07b3f94fee4a0e74bf1e45f54795a10a39cd5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/742e4555dfc379e2228ab24ef5d1cbdc70d09928","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/742e4555dfc379e2228ab24ef5d1cbdc70d09