wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/8f60072423e77e3b927b8b116793e47abaf69428/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:54:22Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(instanzen): EditorBinding laesst sich anlegen; ''New Resource'' nur noch im Plus-Menue\n\nDas fennecui-Paket liegt zur Laufzeit zweimal vor (Modell-Registry und\nPaket-Registry), jede Kopie mit ihrer eigenen ergaenzten EditorBinding-Klasse.\nDer Fabrik-Wrapper des Fixups verglich die Klasse per Identitaet und kannte\nnur die jeweils andere Kopie - ''Unknown class: EditorBinding'' beim Anlegen\naus dem Instanzbaum, dessen Klassenliste aus der anderen Kopie kommt. Er\nentscheidet jetzt nach dem Namen.\n\n''New Resource'' gehoert zum Dokument, nicht zur einzelnen Resource: es steht\nim Plus-Menue der Leiste, die Resource-Zeile bietet ''New Instance''.","tree":{"sha":"9a9835e65e690a9482494dd542d0a2c1548b6db3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/9a9835e65e690a9482494dd542d0a2c1548b6db3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/8f60072423e77e3b927b8b116793e47abaf69428","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/8f60072423e77e3b927b8b116793e47abaf69428","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDhmNjAwNzI0MjNlNzdlM2I5MjdiOGIxMTY3OTNlNDdhYmFmNjk0Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e","sha":"3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e"}],"sha":"8f60072423e77e3b927b8b116793e47abaf69428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/8f60072423e77e3b927b8b116793e47abaf69428"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:34:54Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(instanzen): eine Resource-Zeile bietet ''New Instance'' an\n\nAuf einer Resource gab es im Menue nur ''New Resource'' - wer dort eine\nInstanz anlegen wollte, fand nichts. Jetzt steht ''New Instance'' vorn: bei\nwenigen Klassen (eine Ansicht grenzt ein, ein kleines Modell) stehen sie\ndirekt im Untermenue, bei vielen oeffnet der Dialog mit Suche. Die Zeile hat\ndie Resource schon ausgewaehlt, die Wurzel landet also in ihr.","tree":{"sha":"bd19970bb13b164243959da6e5ac2c8389d17117","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/bd19970bb13b164243959da6e5ac2c8389d17117"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDNhMmI0MjVmYjAyZWZiNzMxMWJhNWZjN2VmNDFiYjY4YTYxNGU5NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601","sha":"648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601"}],"sha":"3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3a2b425fb02efb7311ba5fc7ef41bb68a614e95e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:30:17Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(instanzen): Menue und Save-Dialog meinen den vorderen Tab; Neu-Knopf und Mehr-Menue im Baum\n\nDas Instanz-Menue in der Leiste (Speichern, Validieren, Supertypen) und der\nSave-Dialog schauten noch auf den alten gemeinsamen Baum - der ist leer, seit\njede Datei ihr eigenes Dokument hat. Speichern blieb deshalb deaktiviert, der\nDialog haette nichts gezeigt. ''gene.instance.tree.state'' liefert jetzt das\nDokument des vorderen Tabs, das Menue fragt dasselbe.\n\nDer Plus-Knopf (Neue Instanz / Neue Resource) hing am Kopf des alten Panels,\ndas es nicht mehr gibt - er steht jetzt vorn im Menue und oeffnet das Menue\ndes Baums am Knopf; die Menueleiste reicht dafuer das Klick-Ereignis durch.\n\nIm Instanzbaum zeigt jede Zeile beim Hover einen Mehr-Knopf mit dem\nbisherigen Kontextmenue; der Rechtsklick ist weg, wie im Explorer.\n\nGeprueft mit UDP_MIT_ORM: leere Neu.xmi oeffnen, Wurzel anlegen, Speichern\naktiv, Dialog zeigt Neu.xmi, Datei enthaelt danach das Package.","tree":{"sha":"7540fbb2bf4d5d31560698f9caef2fdc04ee9883","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/7540fbb2bf4d5d31560698f9caef2fdc04ee9883"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDY0OGMwZmZlZTdlM2Y1YzUyMDg2YWZlODkwOTFhYzQ4ZjFjZDc2MDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/0b38c2ab358abbcaa2423c58a9ccfd58a3fd7249","sha":"0b38c2ab358abbcaa2423c58a9ccfd58a3fd7249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/0b38c2ab358abbcaa2423c58a9ccfd58a3fd7249"}],"sha":"648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/648c0ffee7e3f5c52086afe89091ac48f1cd7601"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/0b38c2ab358abbcaa2423c58a9ccfd58a3fd7249/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:22:41Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(instanzen): eine leere XMI oeffnet als leeres Dokument\n\nEine im Explorer neu angelegte Datei hat keinen Inhalt. Der Explorer brach\nbeim Oeffnen ab (kein Inhalt, nichts zu tun), und waere es bis zum Lader\ngekommen, haette der am leeren Text nichts parsen koennen - die Datei liess\nsich nicht bearbeiten.\n\nJetzt oeffnet sie als leeres Dokument in ihrem Tab: eine Resource genau an\nihrem Pfad (createEmptyResourceAt, ohne den Namen umzuschreiben), damit das\nSpeichern in diese Datei zurueckschreibt. Wurzeln kommen aus dem Model\nBrowser.","tree":{"sha":"64215499cd6ef7abab5c65bd036c0fa9dd8d51ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/64215499cd6ef7abab5c65bd036c0fa9dd8d51ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/0b38c2ab358abbcaa2423c58a9ccfd58a3fd7249","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u