rs/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/08ec0d292052bfead8bf1cd285b31526917f82b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T11:34:25Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(tabs): die Assistenten lassen sich schliessen\n\nDer Mapping-Assistent kam ueber den Perspektivwechsel in die Mitte, und der\noeffnete seine Tabs mit `closable: false` als Vorgabe — aus der Zeit, als\ndie Mitte einer Perspektive der ganze Editorbereich war. Jetzt ist sie ein\nTab unter Dateien, und ein Assistent, der nicht zugeht, steht nur im Weg.\n\nDie Vorgabe ist `true`; was nicht zugehen soll — die Eigenschaften, die\nWorkspace-Vorschau als Mitte des Explorers — sagt das weiter ausdruecklich.\nDatengenerator, C-OCL, Transformation und DMN hatten die alte Vorgabe\nebenfalls festgeschrieben; auch sie schliessen jetzt.\n\nGeprueft: SensiNact- und eorm-Assistent als Tabs, beide schliessbar, beide\nueber das x geschlossen.","tree":{"sha":"3acdf6937fc6ba1355fe6438ac9b217a983107cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/3acdf6937fc6ba1355fe6438ac9b217a983107cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/08ec0d292052bfead8bf1cd285b31526917f82b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/08ec0d292052bfead8bf1cd285b31526917f82b3","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDA4ZWMwZDI5MjA1MmJmZWFkOGJmMWNkMjg1YjMxNTI2OTE3ZjgyYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48","sha":"e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48"}],"sha":"08ec0d292052bfead8bf1cd285b31526917f82b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/08ec0d292052bfead8bf1cd285b31526917f82b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:31:15Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(atlas): ein Model-Atlas-Tab; der Navigator folgt dem Tab und behaelt seinen Zustand\n\nDer Model Atlas ist jetzt ein Tab mit drei Abschnitten hinter einer\nAbschnittswahl: Transitions, Schemas, Schema-Explorer. Vorher waren es drei\nMitte-Panels, jedes ein eigener Tab — dabei schauen alle drei auf dasselbe,\ndie Auswahl im Atlas-Baum. Welcher Abschnitt offen ist, liegt in\n`useAtlasSection`: der Baum schaltet bei einer Schema-Auswahl auf „Schemas\",\nund die Wahl ueberlebt den Tab-Wechsel.\n\nDer Navigator oben links folgt dem vorderen Tab: der Atlas-Tab bringt den\nAtlas-Baum, eine Datei oder die Workspace-Vorschau den Explorer. Ein Klick\nin der Leiste holt zusaetzlich den Tab der Perspektive nach vorn; ein\nTab-Wechsel aendert nur den Navigator.\n\nBeim Wechsel Explorer <-> Atlas vergassen die Baeume, was aufgeklappt und\ngewaehlt war — der zurcktretende wurde abgebaut. Die Sidebar haelt ihn jetzt\nmit `KeepAlive` am Leben.\n\nGeprueft: Atlas-Klick oeffnet den Tab mit den drei Abschnitten und den\nAtlas-Baum; eine Datei bringt den Explorer zurueck, derselbe Explorer wie\nzuvor; Abschnitte wechseln und bleiben nach einem Tab-Wechsel gewaehlt.","tree":{"sha":"2cc10c9a8eee8a66d0cac42aed135e2027866d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/2cc10c9a8eee8a66d0cac42aed135e2027866d1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGUwNGVhN2UxMzExNmU1ZmY4YzNjOTRkOWJiOGQ0NjRhN2UwNzVmNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe","sha":"4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe"}],"sha":"e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/e04ea7e13116e5ff8c3c94d9bb8d464a7e075f48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T10:18:49Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(leiste): die Einstellungen stehen immer unten\n\nDas Zahnrad sass direkt unter den Ansichten. Solange die Ansichten da waren,\nfuellten sie die Leiste und drueckten es nach unten; seit sie mit dem Tab\nkommen und gehen, sprang es mit. Jetzt bindet es sich selbst ans untere Ende\n(`margin-top: auto`), was auch immer darueber steht.\n\nGeprueft: Zahnrad buendig am unteren Rand — mit Ansichten, ohne, und auf der\nVorschau.","tree":{"sha":"3d63dbd91387320fcd5c8a936174ed0a21b9f589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/3d63dbd91387320fcd5c8a936174ed0a21b9f589"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDRkNmY5YzM2N2NmNjU0ZGMxMTY4ZjJmMWQ5NzQyMzgxYTE2MjI2ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223","sha":"ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223"}],"sha":"4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4d6f9c367cf654dc1168f2f1d9742381a16226fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:16:32Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(leiste): die Ansichten des Instanz-Editors nur bei einem Instanz-Tab\n\nDie Ansichten aus dem Workspace — Alles, Dokumentation, Nomenklatur, ROLAP\nund so fort — sind Filter auf den Instanzbaum. In der Leiste standen sie\nimmer, auch waehrend ein Metamodell oder eine Transformation vorn lag, wo\nsie nichts bewirken.\n\nEine Perspektive kann jetzt mit `editorId` sagen, zu welchem Editor sie\ngehoert; die Ansichten des Instanzbaums tragen `instance`. Die Leiste zeigt\neine solche Perspektive nur, solange ein Tab dieses Editors vorn liegt —\nsie fragt dafuer den vorderen Tab, nicht den Modus. Ohne `editorId` ist eine\nPerspektive die der Anwendung und steht immer da.\n\nGeprueft: Vorschau und Metamodell-Tab ohne, Instanz-Tab mit der Ansicht,\nhin und her.","tree":{"sha":"971c8b7ae68e2ad38458cb31cc68e730fa37712a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/971c8b7ae68e2ad38458cb31cc68e730fa37712a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGFkZTU2OGM0ZmUyOTk3OTAwYzE2Y2Q2NmIzNWVmNjE3MTUwOGMyMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2","sha":"b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2"}],"sha":"ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/ade568c4fe2997900c16cd66b35ef6171508c223"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:01:46Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(layout): Tab-Leiste scrollt seitwaerts, Problemflaeche gibt nach, Datei folgt dem Tab\n\nDrei Dinge, die mit den Tab-Flaechen sichtbar wurden:\n\nDie Tab-Leiste: `overflow-x: auto` allein liess den Browser den Ueberlauf\nauch senkrecht scrollen, als Flex-Kind ohne `min-width: 0` wuchs sie mit\nihren Tabs statt zu scrollen, und der 10 px hohe Scrollbalken liess 29 px\nfuer 32 px hohe Tabs — sie wurden unten beschnitten. Jetzt `overflow-y:\nhidden`, `min-width: 0`, Tabs ohne Schrumpfen, kein Balken; das Mausrad\nscrollt seitwaerts.\n\nDie Problemflaeche hatte eine feste Hoehe aus dem gespeicherten Zustand, die\naus einem hoeheren Fenster stammen kann. Bei 650 px Fensterhoehe blieben dem\nEditor 41 px. Als Flex-Basis mit Obergrenze gibt sie nach, der Editor behaelt\nmindestens 160 px.\n\nDer Bezug zur geoeffneten Datei: Der vordere Tab nennt seine Datei, der\nRahmen setzt daraus die Titelzeile und waehlt sie im Explorer — der klappt\nQuelle und Ordner dazu auf. Beim Instanz-Tab fehlte der Titel bisher ganz,\nund ein Tab-Wechsel liess die Explorer-Auswahl stehen. Die Editoren loeschen\nden Titel beim Abbau nicht mehr: Das lief nach dem Wechsel und loeschte den\nTitel des naechsten Tabs.\n\nGeprueft: elf Tabs, Leiste bleibt im Fenster und scrollt per Rad; Titel\nfolgt ecore/xmi/qvtr/Vorschau; bei 650 px bleibt der Editor 160 px hoch.","tree":{"sha":"7bc494027a07bb3cfb3d80bd2fc844ac10f10877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/7bc494027a07bb3cfb3d80bd2fc844ac10f10877"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGIxOWMzZGFlNDU5MTYwMGVmZGVkOTAyZjJjYzZmNGMxM2JlNTJhZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638","sha":"0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638"}],"sha":"b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/b19c3dae4591600efded902f2cc6f4c13be52ae2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:17:21Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(layout): Dock-Zonen — der Rahmen stellt die Flaeche, der Tab den Inhalt\n\nDer geteilte Baum links unten war praktisch. Er kommt zurueck, ohne dass\nwieder etwas geteilt wird: Die Zone gehoert dem Rahmen, was darin steht,\ngehoert dem Tab.\n\n`ui-layout` hat zwei Dock-Zonen, links unten und rechts. `dock(zone, info)`\nlaesst die Zone mit Kopfzeile und „Zurueck in den Tab\" erscheinen,\n`undock(zone)` laesst sie verschwinden; die Sidebars melden ihr Host-Element.\n`EditorTabLayout` rendert einen angedockten Bereich per Teleport in diesen\nHost — der Inhalt bleibt Kind der Tab-Komponente, behaelt deren Kontext und\ngeht mit dem Tab. Wechselt der Tab, dockt der naechste seinen an; die\nWorkspace-Vorschau dockt nichts, und die Zonen sind leer. Angedockt oder im\nTab ist je Ansicht gemerkt, Vorgabe: angedockt — das vertraute Bild.\n\nWeg sind `activePrimaryBottomPanelId`, `primaryBottomPanels`,\n`activePrimaryBottomPanel` und `''primary-bottom''` als Panel-Ort: Die Zone\nkennt nur noch das Andocken.\n\nDie Dock-Hosts liegen auf Modulebene. Innerhalb von `useLayoutState()`, das\njede Komponente neu aufruft, waeren sie je Aufrufer ein anderes Exemplar —\nso zeigte die Zone zuerst nur ihre Ueberschrift.\n\nGeprueft: Baum und Browser des vorderen Tabs in den Zonen, Auswahl im\nangedockten Baum zeigt die Eigenschaften in der Tab-Mitte, Ab- und Andocken,\nTab-Wechsel tauscht den Inhalt, die Vorschau leert die Zonen.","tree":{"sha":"6687d66d40163828019c6a2448bb312116f158b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/6687d66d40163828019c6a2448bb312116f158b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDBiNzM2MWY3ZjIxOTIzYjBhNzI3MTg4MDJmODAxNjdkMWY2MjA2Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84","sha":"537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84"}],"sha":"0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/0b7361f7f21923b0a72718802f80167d1f620638"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:48:14Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(tabs): C-OCL, Transformation und DMN mit eigenem Dokument je Tab (Etappe 4)\n\nDie drei Dateieditoren lasen ihre Datei aus einem Dienst je Dateiart, den\nApp.vue vor dem Oeffnen fuellte: `gene.cocl.data`, `gene.transformation.data`,\n`gene.dmn.data`. Die zweite Datei einer Art ueberschrieb damit die erste, ein\nTab, der zurueckkam, las, was gerade dort lag — und der Transformations-\nEditor fragte den Dienst alle 500 ms ab, falls eine zweite Datei kaeme.\n\nJetzt hat jedes der drei Plugins einen Dokument-Speicher je Tab und eine\nTab-Komponente, die ihrem Editor das Dokument als Prop gibt. Der Editor\nliest keinen Dienst mehr; die Abfrageschleife ist weg. App.vue uebergibt\ndas Dokument und benennt den Tab (`oeffneAnsichtTab`); beim Schliessen\nvergisst das Plugin es wieder. `oeffnePerspektivTab` entfaellt.\n\nBewusst nicht umgebaut: DMN laedt sein Dokument je Tab, das Modell dahinter\nist weiter das geteilte, das Baum, Tabelle und Executor gemeinsam nutzen.\neorm- und SensiNact-Wizard sind Assistenten, keine Dateieditoren, und\nbleiben wie sie sind.\n\nGeprueft: zwei .qvtr nebeneinander mit je eigenem Dokument, die Titelzeile\nfolgt dem vorderen Tab, kein Panel einer Datei im Rahmen.","tree":{"sha":"616f10a639284e240b0cc7ab1ee3a7e3b201d758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/616f10a639284e240b0cc7ab1ee3a7e3b201d758"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDUzN2M1Mzg5NmJiYzYzNDExODNhZGJjNjRhY2IyYTQxY2ExMjFlODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188","sha":"305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188"}],"sha":"537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/537c53896bbc6341183adbc64acb2a41ca121e84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:39:47Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"refactor(tabs): die Lader bekommen das Dokument, nichts liegt mehr „vorn\" (Etappe 3)\n\nDas letzte Umgeschaltete: Die Modulfunktionen des Instanzbaums arbeiteten auf\n„dem vorderen Dokument\", das ein Tab beim Aufbau meldete — und der\nMetamodeler hielt eine `aktiveInstanz`, die genauso gesetzt wurde. Kam die\nMeldung zu spaet oder gar nicht, lud eine Datei in den falschen Baum.\n\nJetzt nehmen `loadInstancesFromXMI`, `loadResourceStandalone`,\n`setSharedResource`, `getSharedResource(s)`, `getObjectByXmiId`,\n`generateMissingXmiIds` und `getInstanceLoadingState` das Dokument als\nParameter; ohne eines meinen sie das gemeinsame, nicht das vordere.\n`instanzTabNachVorn`, `setActiveInstanceDocument` und die Fassade des\nInstanzbaums entfallen.\n\nBeim Metamodeler ersetzt ein Resolver die umgeschaltete Instanz: Die Fassade\n`useSharedMetamodeler()` fragt bei jedem Zugriff `gene.editor.front`, welcher\nTab vorn liegt, und dient nur noch Befehlen — Speichern, Pruefen, Menue. Die\nTabs zeigen ihre Instanz direkt.\n\nIn App.vue fragen Suche, Validierung, „Instanz anlegen\", „Problem -> Objekt\"\nund die Atlas-Veroeffentlichung ausdruecklich nach der vorderen Datei; die\nLader bekommen das Dokument des Tabs mit, in das sie laden sollen.\n\nNebenbei: Der Import-Dialog hing an einem `v-if` mit `tsm.getService(...)`,\ndas nur beim Rendern ausgewertet wurde. Mit weniger Anlaessen zum\nNeu-Rendern erschien er nicht mehr — jetzt kommt die Komponente per\n`whenService` in einen Ref.\n\nGeprueft: „Instanz anlegen\" landet in der Resource des XMI-Tabs, das\ngemeinsame Dokument bleibt leer; die Fassade antwortet mit dem Metamodell des\nvorderen Tabs, sonst mit nichts.","tree":{"sha":"fe7f8012fb4dcdff7705fa748b8f4905d08204bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/fe7f8012fb4dcdff7705fa748b8f4905d08204bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDMwNTkwOWI4YmVkZTBkMDM3YjNiMWE2YjZlYmVjNmIwN2U5ZDQxODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb","sha":"33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb"}],"sha":"305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/305909b8bede0d037b3b1a6b6ebec6b07e9d4188"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:27:21Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"refactor(tabs): kein globaler Modus, kein „aktueller Kontext\" mehr (Etappe 2)\n\nSeit jeder Tab seinen Kontext selbst baut und per `provide` weiterreicht,\nlas kein Panel mehr den globalen Modus — er stand durchgehend auf `instance`\nund bewirkte nichts. Was nichts mehr bewirkt, verwirrt nur noch: weg damit.\n\nEntfernt sind `currentMode`, `setEditorMode`, `getEditorMode`,\n`getCurrentContext`, `getInstanceContext`, `getMetamodelContext`, die beiden\nKontext-Factories und `registerTabContext`/`activateTabContext`/\n`releaseTabContext` — mit allen Aufrufern: der Perspektivwechsel in App.vue\nsetzte den Modus, die Perspektiven von Instanz-Editor und Metamodeler taten\nes in `onActivate`, der Metamodeler meldete eine Factory an, App.vue baute\nbeim Start einen Instanz-Kontext fuer `getCurrentContext()`.\n\n`gene.editor.context` ist damit nur noch die Registry der Ansichten plus\n`createMetamodelContext`. Der Test des Umschaltmechanismus geht mit ihm.","tree":{"sha":"efecce3e2e74471fc7eda682d47efe770ed5f2e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/efecce3e2e74471fc7eda682d47efe770ed5f2e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDMzYmI4MjEzNmNiMTVkZWZkM2Q3NzNjNTg2ZjBkYzM4MDFjNzU0ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb","sha":"a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb"}],"sha":"33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/33bb82136cb15defd3d773c586f0dc3801c754fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:23:27Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(tabs): der Tab ist eine Flaeche mit eigenem Kontext (Etappe 1)\n\nNach dem Umschalten von einer .ecore zurueck auf eine .xmi stand unten links\ndie Ueberschrift INSTANCES mit dem Inhalt des Metamodell-Baums. Kein Fehler an\neiner Stelle, sondern der Entwurf: ein Instanzbaum, ein Metamodell-Baum, ein\nModel Browser, und ein globaler Modus, den die Panels beim Rendern abfragten.\nBlieb die Umschaltung aus oder kam sie zu spaet, zeigte das Panel des einen\nTabs den Inhalt des anderen.\n\nJetzt ist ein Tab eine Flaeche mit eigener Aufteilung. `EditorTabLayout`\n(ui-layout) stellt drei Bereiche mit Splittern, Groessen je Ansicht gemerkt.\n`InstanceEditorTab` und `MetamodelEditorTab` bauen ihren Kontext einmal aus\ndem Dokument des Tabs und reichen ihn mit `provide` an Baum, Eigenschaften\nund Browser; die nehmen ihn mit `inject`, nie aus einem globalen Zustand.\nEs gibt nichts Gemeinsames mehr, das man umschalten koennte.\n\nDie Oeffner in App.vue legen nur noch den Tab an. `instance-tree`,\n`metamodeler-tree` und `model-browser` werden nicht mehr als Panels des\nRahmens registriert; `tabLayout` und `EditorArt.panels` entfallen. Was auf\n„die vordere Datei\" wirkt — Menueleiste, Befehle — fragt `gene.editor.front`;\nkein Panel tut das.\n\nGeprueft: Ecore- und XMI-Tab viermal hin und her, links jedes Mal der Baum\ndes Tabs, rechts sein Browser, die Auswahl zeigt seine Eigenschaften. Der\nglobale Modus stand dabei durchgehend auf `instance` und bewirkte nichts mehr.","tree":{"sha":"b2fd82d830e5375079a30805d2d0160716b1669b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/b2fd82d830e5375079a30805d2d0160716b1669b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGE2MTJiYzI3YjFkODM5NTJkY2YyODJkOTA3NTA3Y2UwOGI5NDgzZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d","sha":"7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d"}],"sha":"a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/a612bc27b1d83952dcf282d907507ce08b9483eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:33:54Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"docs: Weg B — der Tab ist eine Flaeche mit eigenem Kontext\n\nDer Befund aus dem UDP_MIT_ORM-Workspace, warum er aus dem Entwurf folgt und\nnicht aus einer Stelle, das Ziel, der Schnitt in vier Teile und vier Etappen.\nWas dabei an Verhalten wegfaellt, steht dabei.","tree":{"sha":"4ad05ea38819f0e7bb1baf6c882d243e0ca27627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/4ad05ea38819f0e7bb1baf6c882d243e0ca27627"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDdjZTczMzAzOGE4OGRhY2QzZDkyNzg5ZDY3ZmUxMjVkNGEzNjVjN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4","sha":"217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4"}],"sha":"7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/7ce733038a88dacd3d92789d67fe125d4a365c7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:19:21Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(leiste): keine Icons mehr, die erscheinen und gleich wieder gehen\n\nBeim Start blitzten links Perspektiven auf und verschwanden wieder. Zwei\nWarteschleifen waren schuld:\n\nDie Leiste begann mit einer vorlaeufigen Liste — Explorer und Model Editor —,\nbis die Registry antwortete. Und welche Perspektive von einer Ansicht\nabgeloest ist, sah sie einmal in der Sekunde nach; bis zu einer Sekunde lang\nstanden also Icons da, die gleich wieder gingen.\n\nJetzt beginnt sie leer und hoert zu, statt nachzusehen: Der Kontext-Dienst\nwird gemeldet, sobald es ihn gibt, und was abgeloest ist, ergibt sich daraus\nvon selbst. Gezeigt wird erst, wenn feststeht, was zu zeigen ist — eine\nPerspektive, die gleich wieder verschwaende, erscheint gar nicht erst.\n\nGemessen: 0 Icons, dann Explorer, dann Model Atlas. Nichts geht mehr weg.","tree":{"sha":"d58b4ad452910ee9640ef9e576c67447b2333d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/d58b4ad452910ee9640ef9e576c67447b2333d07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDIxN2NmOTgwYWUxNWU4YTVkOWYxMDU0Njg2YmI5YTU3YTgxMjJiYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb","sha":"dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb"}],"sha":"217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/217cf980ae15e8a5d9f1054686bb9a57a8122ba4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:17:42Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(perspektiven): die Leiste markiert, was sie zeigt — und zeigt von Anfang an eine\n\nLinks war nichts blau. Zwei Gruende, beide aus der Zeit, als es die\nPerspektiven noch gab:\n\nDie Leiste uebernahm jede Perspektive als aktuelle, auch eine, die sie gar\nnicht mehr zeigt — model-editor etwa ist von einer Ansicht abgeloest. Dann\npasste die markierte Id zu keinem Knopf und es war nichts hervorgehoben.\nJetzt wird nur uebernommen, was dort auch steht; sonst bleibt der letzte\nsichtbare markiert.\n\nUnd die Registry hatte ueberhaupt keine aktuelle Perspektive, bis jemand\nwechselte: Wer die Anwendung nur oeffnete, hatte keine, und alles was daran\nhaengt hing an nichts. Die erste Perspektive, die ohne Workspace laufen kann,\nwird jetzt beim Registrieren die aktuelle — das Gegenstueck zu `unregister`,\ndas genauso nachrueckt.","tree":{"sha":"de50ea1a3c09f658c9f5bde78d2fccddcb525405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/de50ea1a3c09f658c9f5bde78d2fccddcb525405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGRjZTUwOGQ4ZWE1Y2Q3MzlkZTBlOTIwZTc2NDQyOWZkOTJlY2EzZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556","sha":"755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556"}],"sha":"dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/dce508d8ea5cd739de0e920e764429fd92eca3eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:07:59Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(workspace): die Instanzdatei des Workspace bekommt ihren Tab\n\nEin Workspace bringt seine Instanzdatei selbst mit (`instanceSources` in der\n.wsp) und laedt sie beim Oeffnen in den gemeinsamen Baum — ohne Tab und ohne\nTab-Kontext. Solange die Perspektive den Baum zeigte, fiel das nicht auf.\nSeit die untere Haelfte links dem vorderen Tab gehoert, zeigte ihn niemand\nmehr: kein Baum, kein Model Browser, kein Modus.\n\nJetzt dieselbe Reihenfolge wie beim Oeffnen aus dem Explorer — Dokument\nanlegen, nach vorn holen, laden, Tab oeffnen. Eine Datei, die der Workspace\nmitbringt, ist eine offene Datei wie jede andere.","tree":{"sha":"0f355203035ac584df7f5cf0c29435128751a405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/0f355203035ac584df7f5cf0c29435128751a405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDc1NWFhYzU4YzQ3NDc2Zjc4YjQ0OWJjYTU0NWE1ZjU2NmU5Njc1NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944","sha":"90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944"}],"sha":"755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/755aac58c47476f78b449bca545a5f566e967556"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:51:19Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(layout): eine abgeloeste Perspektive baut nichts mehr auf\n\nDie Perspektive `model-editor` fuehrt in ihrem Layout den Instanzbaum links\nund die Eigenschaften in der Mitte. Wird sie noch irgendwo aktiviert — ein\nWorkspace, der sich oeffnet, ein Plugin, das umschaltet —, dann wanderte der\nInstanzbaum aus der unteren Haelfte links nach oben, unten blieb nichts, ein\nProperties-Tab trat neben die Datei, und in der Leiste war nichts mehr\nmarkiert, weil die Perspektive dort gar nicht steht.\n\nZwei Stellen, damit das nicht wieder passiert: Eine Ansicht sagt, welche\nPerspektive sie abloest — eine solche wird nicht mehr aufgebaut. Und\n`setupPerspectiveLayout` verschiebt kein Panel mehr, das schon steht:\nergaenzen heisst nicht umhaengen.\n\nDie Problemflaeche gehoert der Anwendung, nicht der offenen Datei. Sie zeigt\nsich, wenn es Fehler gibt, und geht wieder, wenn keine mehr da sind — zu, nicht\nweg, Strg+J holt sie zurueck. Dafuer faellt `EditorArt.panels.bottom` weg: Es\nversprach etwas, das `selectPanel` fuer den unteren Bereich gar nicht kann.\n\nUnd: Das CSS des PrimeVue-Buttons wird beim Start angestossen. Alle anderen\nKomponenten laden ihres beim ersten Mount, der Button nicht — ohne sein CSS\nist er ein nacktes `<button>`, bei dem Icon und Beschriftung aneinanderkleben\nund die Farben des Themes fehlen.","tree":{"sha":"cbc8a8eebad6b7127f6090e69a9f4fd0fcc62658","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/cbc8a8eebad6b7127f6090e69a9f4fd0fcc62658"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDkwZjc4NDNlOGQ2Y2EwOTg2YmU1ZTBlNDljNjBhNmY5YjAwMmY5NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765","sha":"95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765"}],"sha":"90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/90f7843e8d6ca0986be5e0e49c60a6f9b002f944"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:41:25Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(layout): Tab-Leiste nach oben, das Menue unter den Tab\n\nDas Menue stand ueber der ganzen Anwendung, obwohl es der offenen Datei\ngehoert — im Metamodell-Editor stehen dort dessen Werkzeuge, im Explorer\nkeine. Jetzt steht es unter der Tab-Leiste, also unter der Datei, zu der es\ngehoert.\n\nDafuer ruecken die Tabs eine Zeile nach oben, auf gleiche Hoehe mit dem Kopf\ndes Baumes und rechts von ihm. Beide leben jetzt in der Mitte statt darueber:\nDie Leiste beginnt dort, wo der Inhalt beginnt, und der Baum links reicht\nueber die volle Hoehe.","tree":{"sha":"ec519193453802e4fbbe705a3cdbea4104a83839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/ec519193453802e4fbbe705a3cdbea4104a83839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDk1ODkwYjQ5YmFjMThkZGNjN2U5Y2ExOWYxODY4YTEzZTZmYWE3NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd","sha":"4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd"}],"sha":"95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/95890b49bac18ddcc7e9ca19f1868a13e6faa765"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:37:45Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(editor): der vordere Tab bestimmt Modus und Menue, nicht die Perspektive\n\nZwei Dinge hingen noch am Perspektivwechsel und blieben stehen, seit eine\nDatei keine Perspektive mehr wechselt:\n\nDer Editor-Modus wurde in `handlePerspectiveChange` gesetzt. Ohne das\nantwortete `getCurrentContext()` auch im Metamodell-Tab mit dem\nInstanz-Kontext — die Eigenschaften baten um eine Auswahl in einem\nInstanzbaum, der gar nicht vorn lag. `activateTabContext` setzt den Modus\njetzt selbst; dort gehoerte die Entscheidung ohnehin hin.\n\nDas Menue wurde unter der Id der Perspektive geladen, also stand im\nMetamodell-Editor das des Explorers. Die Ansicht des vorderen Tabs nennt die\nPerspektive, die sie abloest, und unter dem Namen ist ihr Menue angemeldet —\ndanach fragt die Leiste jetzt, mit dem Navigator als Rueckfall.\n\nDabei kam heraus, dass `createMetamodelContext` nie in der Dienst-Oberflaeche\nstand: `oeffneMetamodellTab` bekam `undefined` und meldete gar keinen\nTab-Kontext an. Aufgefallen ist es nicht, weil der Modus von aussen gesetzt\nwurde und der gemeinsame Kontext zufaellig passte.","tree":{"sha":"b6a366fe875dafa422baf7991fe7a084cf3a8d65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/b6a366fe875dafa422baf7991fe7a084cf3a8d65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDRjMWJlN2ZhMzI3MzAzOTlhOWE0ZDdiNTZlYmRhY2FkNzBkMGNlYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250","sha":"54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250"}],"sha":"4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4c1be7fa32730399a9a4d7b56ebdacad70d0cebd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:27:27Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"fix(layout): ein Panel anzumelden heisst nicht, es anzuzeigen\n\nIn der Explorer-Perspektive standen ein Instanzbaum und ein Model Browser,\nobwohl keine Datei offen war. Zwei Ursachen, beide aus der Zeit, als die\nPanels erst beim Perspektivwechsel entstanden: `activePrimaryBottomPanel`\nfiel auf das erste angemeldete Panel zurueck, und `registerPanel` waehlte\nrechts automatisch das erste aus.\n\nBeide Zonen gehoeren der offenen Datei. Sie bleiben jetzt leer, bis ein Tab\nsie beansprucht, und werden wieder leer, wenn er geht — dafuer waehlt\n`selectPanel` jetzt auch ab, und der Tab-Layout-Dienst raeumt, was die\nAnsicht des vorderen Tabs nicht nennt. Der eingeklappte Balken rechts zeigt\nsich erst, wenn dort etwas gewaehlt ist.\n\nWelcher Tab vorn liegt, wird an einer Stelle beobachtet statt in jedem\nTab-Setup einzeln. Sonst liess ein Tab ohne eigene Panels — die\nWorkspace-Vorschau — die des vorigen stehen.\n\nUnd: Einen Workspace zu oeffnen wechselt keine Ansicht mehr. Der Explorer\nbleibt stehen, was daraus geoeffnet wird, erscheint als Tab.","tree":{"sha":"b5fe5650dc93a9fa6f6bc146542918b08970ee38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/b5fe5650dc93a9fa6f6bc146542918b08970ee38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDU0ZTE1NjllNmEzZDczNjU3YTg1ZDEzM2ZiYjE3MWNhMmQ0ZDgyNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb","sha":"4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb"}],"sha":"54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/54e1569e6a3d73657a85d133fbb171ca2d4d8250"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:14:34Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(layout): eine Perspektive ergaenzt die Flaeche, statt sie zu ersetzen\n\n`setupPerspectiveLayout` begann mit `clearAll()`. Damit riss jeder\nPerspektivwechsel alles weg, was eine andere Stelle aufgebaut hatte — der\nExplorer verschwand, offene Tabs ebenso, und was die Perspektive nicht selbst\nkannte, kam nicht wieder. Das traf auch die Oeffner der Wizards, die ihren\nWechsel ueber den Manager nehmen.\n\nJetzt wird nur ergaenzt. Panels und Tabs werden bei gleicher Id ersetzt, also\nkostet ein zweiter Aufruf nichts, und was sonst offen ist, bleibt offen. Der\neorm-Wizard erscheint damit als Tab neben dem Workspace, statt an seiner\nStelle.\n\ncocl, Transformation und DMN oeffnen jetzt selbst einen Tab: Den Inhalt\nstellt das Panel, das ihre Perspektive in die Mitte stellen wollte. Fehlt das\nPlugin — dmn-editor ist in den Startmodulen auskommentiert —, bleibt es bei\neiner Meldung statt bei einem Wechsel ins Leere.","tree":{"sha":"401c677b5930e9468aa35c9f1681e0ef5fba0d0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/401c677b5930e9468aa35c9f1681e0ef5fba0d0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDRmNjZiMDc2YmM0MmQzMWYxNTBiNGVlNzEwYzI1MjU4ZWM3NTMzYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d","sha":"4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d"}],"sha":"4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4f66b076bc42d31f150b4ee710c25258ec7533bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:11:42Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(layout): die Flaeche steht, der Tab bestimmt, was darin zu sehen ist\n\nEs gab zwei Perspektiv-Aufbauten von zusammen rund 520 Zeilen, die beide mit\n`clearAll()` begannen und danach dasselbe noch einmal registrierten:\nExplorer oben, Baeume unten, Model Browser rechts, Probleme unten. Jedes\nOeffnen einer Datei riss damit das Layout ab — der Explorer verschwand, und\naktiv war eine Perspektive, die in der Leiste gar nicht mehr stand.\n\nJetzt gibt es eine Arbeitsflaeche, einmal gebaut. Die Panels gehoeren der\nAnwendung; welches zu sehen ist, entscheidet der vordere Tab. Dafuer der\nneue Tab-Layout-Dienst: Er haelt fest, welche Ansicht einen Tab traegt, und\nwaehlt beim Wechsel die Panels, die diese Ansicht angemeldet hat. Er baut\nnichts auf und raeumt nichts ab — genau das war der Fehler.\n\nWelche Panels zu einer Ansicht gehoeren, sagt sie selbst: `EditorArt.panels`\nnennt Baum, Seitenbereich und unteren Bereich. Nur Namen, keine Panels: Die\nAnsicht sucht sich aus, was die Flaeche ohnehin traegt.\n\nEine Perspektive waehlt nur noch den Navigator oben links; was sie in die\nMitte stellen wollte, wird ein Tab. Deshalb oeffnet der Model Atlas seine\nTransitions jetzt neben dem, was offen ist, statt an deren Stelle.\n\nEin Model Browser statt zwei: Welches Modell darin steht, sagt der Kontext\ndes vorderen Tabs — ein fest eingefangener bliebe beim ersten stehen.\n\nDie Baeume werden nachgetragen, sobald ihr Modul aktiv ist, statt dass\nspaeter alles noch einmal aufgebaut wird.\n\nOffen bleibt: cocl, Transformation und DMN wechseln noch die Perspektive,\nweil sie keinen Tab haben. Das ist Schritt 6 des Plans.","tree":{"sha":"341d890d62dd97e296d6e9b76151d1f17e9b41e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/341d890d62dd97e296d6e9b76151d1f17e9b41e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDRkZTJkZjRhMjc4MmJmNzUxNmRiZDExM2ZkOGMxMWQ2ZjdjNTc3OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437","sha":"3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437"}],"sha":"4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/4de2df4a2782bf7516dbd113fd8c11d6f7c5778d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:56:35Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(tsm): Ansichten melden sich selbst an, statt aufgezaehlt zu werden\n\nDie acht Dateiansichten standen in App.vue in einer Liste, die jemand\npflegen musste, und wurden ueber einen Dienst angemeldet, auf den gewartet\nwurde. Blieb der Dienst in dieser Zeit aus, fiel die Anmeldung still aus —\ngenau das hat beim Vorfuehren das falsche Bild gezeigt.\n\nJetzt traegt jede Ansicht ihre Erklaerung selbst: `@component({ service:\n[EDITOR_ART] })`, und der Loader meldet sie an. Die Sammelstelle in\nui-instance-tree nimmt mit `@injectAll` alles, was sich unter\n`gene.editor.art` findet — eine Ansicht kommt und geht zur Laufzeit, ohne\ndass irgendwo eine Liste nachgezogen wird.\n\nDer Vertrag liegt in packages/gene-contracts, ausserhalb jedes Moduls: Er\nhat kein Verhalten (ein serviceId ist der String, den er bekommt), und nur\nso kann ihn jedes Modul importieren, ohne eines der anderen zu kennen.\n\nDie Oeffner der beiden Wizards sind dynamische Referenzen (@bind/@unbind).\nIhr Plugin darf spaeter laden und wieder verschwinden; die Ansicht bleibt\nstehen und bekommt die Aenderung gereicht, statt neu gebaut zu werden.\n\nDabei umbenannt: EditorArt.oeffnen -> open, ersetztPerspektive ->\nreplacesPerspective. Der Vertrag ist neu und soll nicht mit deutschen\nFeldnamen festgeschrieben werden.","tree":{"sha":"be9d4e70449c4a813e25c77006e9437042551916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/be9d4e70449c4a813e25c77006e9437042551916"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKDNiM2VkZjJjYTUzN2ZmZTEwZWFiZTlhMjZjOTk5NTEzNDE0NmQ0Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c","sha":"be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c"}],"sha":"3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/3b3edf2ca537ffe10eabe9a26c9995134146d437"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:38:20Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"refactor(tsm): auf Dienste warten, statt in Abstaenden nachzusehen\n\nModule werden in Abhaengigkeitsreihenfolge geladen, optionale Dienste koennen\naber spaeter kommen. Dafuer gab es Warteschleifen: einmal nach 500 ms, dann\nnach 2 s, und wenn der Dienst sich mehr Zeit liess, fiel die Anmeldung still\naus. Genau daran lag es, dass die Aktivitaetsleiste zeitweise alle\nPerspektiven zeigte — die Ansichten hatten sich nie angemeldet.\n\nDie Registry meldet Zugaenge selbst (ObservableServiceRegistry). Die\nTSM-Fassade bietet das jetzt als `whenService(id, fn)` an: ist der Dienst da,\nwird sofort gerufen, sonst beim Eintreffen. In den Plugins, die ihren\nModuleContext haben, steht derselbe Weg als kleiner lokaler Helfer.\n\nErsetzt: Anmeldung der Editor-Arten, Explorer oben links, Icon-Registry in\nModel Browser und Metamodeler.\n\n487 Tests gruen, type-check 969, die Anwendung laedt ohne Fehler.","tree":{"sha":"1c31dda96d8313e8fbbd78632eacd52247dfd356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/1c31dda96d8313e8fbbd78632eacd52247dfd356"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGJlNDE1Y2MzYTI4NDJmZjVjMDMzNzg4ZDc2N2JlOGQ0MDRiMmQyMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/77fe271ce322383e2de2374391f096a7f0b5be3a","sha":"77fe271ce322383e2de2374391f096a7f0b5be3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/77fe271ce322383e2de2374391f096a7f0b5be3a"}],"sha":"be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/be415cc3a2842ff5c033788d767be8d404b2d22c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/77fe271ce322383e2de2374391f096a7f0b5be3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:32:27Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"chore(deps): @eclipse-daanse/tsm auf 0.1.0-next.1\n\nBringt das Komponentenmodell: @component mit Lebenszyklus, @injectAll zum\nEinsammeln aller Anbieter eines Dienstes, @bind/@unbind fuer Dienste, die\nkommen und gehen, serviceId<T>() fuer Vertraege statt loser Strings, dazu\nKonfiguration je Komponente und eine Aufloesung ueber Requirements und\nCapabilities.\n\nDas Upgrade selbst ist additiv: Die bisherigen Exporte gibt es unveraendert,\nTests 487 gruen, type-check 969 wie zuvor, die Anwendung laedt ohne Fehler.\n\nGrundlage fuer den naechsten Schritt — die Warteschleifen beim Anmelden der\nDienste entfallen, sobald die Ansichten Komponenten sind (siehe\ndocs/concepts/tab-architektur-plan.md).","tree":{"sha":"afe0b1bc75bb1402c7d05c89a40bbe89293bf0ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/afe0b1bc75bb1402c7d05c89a40bbe89293bf0ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/77fe271ce322383e2de2374391f096a7f0b5be3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata