_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/e7095523d6e03beed28d03c1665e658e353de756/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:32:04Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(tabs): linke Seite zweigeteilt, Registry der Ansichten je Datei\n\n**Links zwei Zonen.** Oben der Navigator — Explorer, Model Atlas —, unten die\nAnsicht zur offenen Datei. Beide gleichzeitig sichtbar, mit verschiebbarem\nTrenner; bisher gab es links genau ein Panel, zwischen denen die\nAktivitaetsleiste umschaltete. Panels melden sich dafuer mit dem Ort\n''primary-bottom''.\n\n**Welche Ansicht eine Datei oeffnet.** Eine Datei hat nicht einen Editor: ein\neorm-Mapping laesst sich als eorm-Ansicht oeffnen oder als gewoehnlicher\nInstanzbaum. Die Registry fuehrt die Kandidaten und entscheidet in dieser\nReihenfolge: eine Regel aus dem Workspace, sonst das Metamodell der Wurzel\n(nsURI), sonst die Endung und unter gleichen die Rangzahl. Der nsURI wird aus\ndem Dateianfang gelesen, ohne zu parsen.\n\nIm Workspace-Modell traegt die EditorConfig dafuer jetzt `editorBindings`\n(Muster oder nsURI -> Ansicht).\n\n481 Tests gruen (17 neue), type-check unveraendert.\n\nNoch offen: Das Generat zum Modell fehlt — `npm run generate` leert derzeit\ndie erzeugten Dateien, auch ohne diese Aenderung (siehe Bericht).","tree":{"sha":"253cdd2922575f64681b475cbb9ee5f2100e313b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/253cdd2922575f64681b475cbb9ee5f2100e313b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/e7095523d6e03beed28d03c1665e658e353de756","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/e7095523d6e03beed28d03c1665e658e353de756","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGU3MDk1NTIzZDZlMDNiZWVkMjhkMDNjMTY2NWU2NThlMzUzZGU3NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea","sha":"bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea"}],"sha":"e7095523d6e03beed28d03c1665e658e353de756","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/e7095523d6e03beed28d03c1665e658e353de756"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:30:09Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(tabs): geoeffnete Instanzen als Tabs, wie die Metamodelle\n\nEine Instanzdatei oeffnet jetzt ihren eigenen Tab mit eigenem Baum. Der vordere\nTab meldet beim Aufbau Dokument und Kontext an — Baum, Eigenschaften und\nModell-Browser folgen ihm.\n\nDamit das Laden im richtigen Tab landet, arbeiten die Funktionen des\nInstanz-Moduls jetzt auf dem vorderen Dokument statt fest auf dem gemeinsamen.\nEin Tab haelt denselben Verbund wie dieses: Resourcen, aktive Resource, Baum\nund Ladeanzeige — deshalb blieben die Funktionen selbst unveraendert.\n\nBeim Zusammenfuehren (MERGE) bleibt der Tab, der gerade offen ist; nur\nSTANDALONE und REPLACE legen einen eigenen an.\n\nDie Resourcen liegen weiter im gemeinsamen ResourceSet, Querverweise zwischen\nzwei offenen Dateien bleiben also aufloesbar.\n\n464 Tests gruen (5 neue), type-check 968 — der eine Zuwachs ist die bekannte\nfehlende Typdeklaration fuer ''tsm:vue'' in der neuen Datei.","tree":{"sha":"c6cbd179ca432132a1352702a236a41c0c282bdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/c6cbd179ca432132a1352702a236a41c0c282bdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGJiNzA2ZDcwYTMwMzM5ZTk3MjhlYTI5YzEwOTEzZDBhZjMyMDZlZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c","sha":"f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c"}],"sha":"bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/bb706d70a30339e9728ea29c10913d0af3206eea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T08:24:42Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(tabs): geoeffnete Metamodelle als Tabs, der vordere traegt die Ansicht\n\nEine .ecore oeffnet jetzt ihren eigenen Tab mit eigener Instanz. Gerendert wird\nimmer nur der vordere Tab — er meldet beim Aufbau seine Instanz und seinen\nKontext an, und damit folgen ihm Baum (ueber die Fassade), Eigenschaften und\nModell-Browser. Ein Tab traegt also die ganze Ansicht, nicht nur seinen Inhalt.\n\nDafuer loesen Modell-Browser und Eigenschaften-Panel ihren Kontext zur\nRenderzeit ueber getCurrentContext() auf; vorher hing beides an einem fest\neingefangenen Kontext und waere beim ersten Modell stehengeblieben.\n\nEin Perspektivwechsel raeumt die Tab-Leiste (clearAll), die Dateien bleiben\naber offen — sie werden beim Aufbau der Metamodeler-Perspektive wieder\neingehaengt. Ist keine offen, steht dort wie bisher ein fester\nEigenschaften-Tab.\n\nDas Aufraeumen haengt deshalb am neuen Ereignis `onEditorClosed` des Layouts\nstatt an der Tab-Liste: Nur beim wirklichen Schliessen werden Instanz und\nKontext freigegeben.\n\n459 Tests gruen, type-check 967 wie auf main.","tree":{"sha":"dc5d1d721e22822371c2cfb4daf1182c5f622aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/dc5d1d721e22822371c2cfb4daf1182c5f622aef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c","node_id":"C_kwDORopMNdoAKGYzODM4N2E4YjlmMjJlNzg4NDc5ZDMzZmQ5MjliNWJlOTVhNDVmNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commit/977ffec4865228f216757c489ab810044c5afe21","sha":"977ffec4865228f216757c489ab810044c5afe21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/977ffec4865228f216757c489ab810044c5afe21"}],"sha":"f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/f38387a8b9f22e788479d33fd929b5be95a45f5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDI4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/commits/977ffec4865228f216757c489ab810044c5afe21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T08:13:49Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"vwfox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:20:39Z","email":"markus.hochstein@software-hochstein.de","name":"Markus Hochstein"},"message":"feat(tabs): Grundlage fuer mehrere offene Dateien je Ansicht\n\nDie Tab-Leisten sollen je Ansicht die geoeffneten Dateien zeigen: im\nMetamodeler die .ecore, im Modell-Editor die Instanzen. Drei Bausteine dafuer,\nalle noch ohne sichtbare Wirkung — die Verdrahtung folgt.\n\n**Ein Kontext je Tab** (editorContext): Bisher gab es genau einen Kontext je\nModus. Jetzt kann sich ein Tab mit seinem Kontext anmelden; welcher vorn liegt,\nwird je Modus gefuehrt, damit die Ansichten sich nicht ins Gehege kommen. Die\nPanels fragen weiterhin getCurrentContext() und folgen dadurch von selbst.\nOhne angemeldeten Tab bleibt alles wie bisher.\n\n**Fassade auf die vordere Instanz** (useMetamodeler): Baum und Eigenschaften\nliegen im Seitenbereich und werden beim Tab-Wechsel nicht neu aufgebaut. Sie\nhalten deshalb eine Fassade, die bei jedem Zugriff zur aktiven Instanz\ndurchreicht — und weil sie dafuer ein Ref liest, rechnen computeds mit.\n\n**Ein Metamodell je Tab** (tabDokumente): Der Editor-Bereich zeigt nur den\nvorderen Tab und baut ihn beim Wechsel neu auf. Die Instanzen liegen deshalb an\nder Tab-Id, nicht in der Komponente — sonst waere beim Zurueckwechseln das\ngeladene Modell weg.\n\n459 Tests gruen (11 neue), type-check 967 wie auf main.","tree":{"sha":"e8e6ce84027808bcfcfc04965d65600411204674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/trees/e8e6ce84027808bcfcfc04965d65600411204674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-daanse/org.eclipse.daanse.gene/git/commits/977ffec4865228f216757c489ab810044c5afe21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1442861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vwfox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vwfox","id":1442861,"login":"vwfox","node_id":"MD