n  standard collapsed/expanded bar pattern\n- SidebarToggle: shared Chat/Close icon button in DashboardLayout.Header\n\nRemoves:\n- CanvasSidePanel.tsx + CanvasSidePanel.css (dead code)\n- PanelTab type, activePanelTab state, setPanelTab action from threadsSlice\n\nThis brings lean-canvas in line with the other 7 apps, enabling shared\niteration on the sidebar/chat UX from frame-ui-components.\n\nPart of the SidebarToggle migration — see ojfbot/frame-ui-components#4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffda0a60ed6863194df37c7d1df21ed5b3a684e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/trees/ffda0a60ed6863194df37c7d1df21ed5b3a684e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/commits/809fa4734251198cf94a927ff8caea2ced197b64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commit/809fa4734251198cf94a927ff8caea2ced197b64","node_id":"C_kwDORo-fFtoAKDgwOWZhNDczNDI1MTE5OGNmOTRhOTI3ZmY4Y2FlYTJjZWQx