thub.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/commits/dc357ccd26ba31736072ff4dc5cbeaf36dd01df1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commit/dc357ccd26ba31736072ff4dc5cbeaf36dd01df1","node_id":"C_kwDORo-fFtoAKGRjMzU3Y2NkMjZiYTMxNzM2MDcyZmY0ZGM1Y2JlYWYzNmRkMDFkZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commit/5d4ebe14591f8aca9cbb81b353f5788b4b9e523b","sha":"5d4ebe14591f8aca9cbb81b353f5788b4b9e523b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/5d4ebe14591f8aca9cbb81b353f5788b4b9e523b"}],"sha":"dc357ccd26ba31736072ff4dc5cbeaf36dd01df1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/dc357ccd26ba31736072ff4dc5cbeaf36dd01df1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/5d4ebe14591f8aca9cbb81b353f5788b4b9e523b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:23:52Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:23:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(skills): rename .claude/commands/ → .claude/skills/\n\n* feat(lean-canvas): align browser-app with Frame shell pattern\n\n- Add CanvasDashboard — top-level MF exposed component with header,\n  thread sidebar toggle, and CondensedChat bar (matches cv-builder layout)\n- Add CanvasCondensedChat — collapsed/expanded floating chat bar using\n  Redux state; routes to /api/canvas/{section}/chat per active section\n- Add CanvasThreadSidebar — session switcher (add / rename / remove)\n- Add chatSlice (messages, draftInput, isLoading, streamingContent, displayState)\n- Add threadsSlice (threads, activeThreadId, sidebarExpanded)\n- Update store with all three slices\n- Update vite.config: MF expose → CanvasDashboard; add @reduxjs/toolkit\n  and react-redux to federation shared list\n- Strip Provider from LeanCanvasGrid — Provider now lives at Dashboard boundary\n- Add onFocus prop to LeanCanvasSectionPanel (ADR-0020 compliant) so active\n  section updates Redux for CondensedChat context routing\n- Add @carbon/icons-react dependency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): fit CanvasDashboard inside shell flex chain\n\nframe-fade-in is display:flex flex-direction:column — the remote must\nparticipate as a flex child. Replace height:100% with flex:1 + min-height:0\non canvas-dashboard and canvas-dashboard-main. Fix canvas-dashboard-grid-wrapper\nto use min-height:0 so it doesn''t overflow. Remove 80vh minHeight in shellMode\n(grid fills parent height via flex). Change CondensedChat from position:sticky\nto a normal flex child (sticky has no scroll context in this layout).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): match exact cv-builder shell embed pattern\n\nCondensedChat: position:fixed bottom-right (right:calc(72px-1rem), width:400px)\n— with-sidebar shifts it left past the 320px panel.\n\nThreadSidebar: Carbon SideNav position:fixed right:1rem, top:calc(48px+0.5rem),\nwidth:320px, slides in/out via transform. Inline styles match cv-builder exactly.\n\nCanvasDashboard: React fragment (not flex container) — wrapper gets\nmargin:36px 72px, margin-top:4.5rem in shell-mode. Heading + sidebar toggle in\nheader row. Grid scroller fills remainder. Same breathing-room layout as\ncv-builder .dashboard-wrapper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(lean-canvas): replace floating CondensedChat with CanvasSidePanel\n\nFloating position:fixed CondensedChat was overlapping the canvas grid and\nmaking it unusable. Replaced with a single right-rail CanvasSidePanel (320px,\nposition:fixed right:0) that contains two tabs:\n\n- Sessions tab: session list (add / rename / switch / remove)\n- Chat tab: full-height conversation with context indicator showing\n  the active canvas section being asked about\n\nClicking a canvas section tile now auto-opens the panel on the Chat tab.\nDashboard wrapper shifts left (margin-right: 320px) when panel is open\nso the grid never hides under the panel.\n\nRemoved: CanvasCondensedChat.tsx/css, CanvasThreadSidebar.tsx\nAdded: CanvasSidePanel.tsx/css\nUpdated: threadsSlice (activePanelTab + setPanelTab), LeanCanvasGrid\n(onSectionFocus prop), CanvasDashboard (drives panel tab via Redux)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): grid fits viewport, symmetric bottom row, icon send buttons\n\nGrid: switch from 5-column (1fr 1fr 1.5fr 1fr 1.5fr) to 6-column\n(repeat(6,1fr)) so Cost Structure and Revenue Streams each span\nexactly 3 columns = 50% width each, meeting at the center line.\n\nLayout: gridTemplateRows ''1fr 1fr auto'' → ''1fr 1fr 1fr'', height:100%\non the grid, overflow:hidden on the scroller. Removes the 80vh minHeight\nthat was forcing the grid past the dashboard panel boundary.\n\nSend buttons: replace Carbon <Button size=\"sm\">Send</Button> on every\ntile with a 2rem×2rem icon-only button (<SendAlt size={16}>) — visually\ncompact and does not crowd the narrow input rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): sidebar positioning, brand send buttons, card focus UX\n\nSidebar: match cv-builder ThreadSidebar exactly — right:1rem gap from\nviewport edge, transform hides via calc(100%+1rem), visibility transition\nprevents focus bleed while hidden. Dashboard wrapper uses\nmargin-right:calc(320px+2rem) — same formula as cv-builder.\n\nSend buttons: replace custom <button> with Carbon IconButton kind=\"primary\"\nso the brand primary color is applied correctly via Carbon''s token system.\nCSS override (.canvas-section-send-btn) keeps it 2rem×2rem square.\n\nCard click UX: clicking any section tile now focuses its TextInput directly\n(inputRef.current?.focus()). Auto-open-sidebar on card click removed —\nsidebar toggle remains on the header Menu button only. Input row uses\nstopPropagation so interactions inside don''t re-fire tile click.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(skills): rename .claude/commands/ → .claude/skills/\n\nMigrate to normative Claude Code project structure. Real skill symlinks\nmoved from .claude/commands/ to .claude/skills/; .claude/commands is\nnow a backward-compat symlink → skills/ so existing tooling continues\nto resolve without changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23791e63d75e5b15e91aff9b6b87097ae996ff9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/trees/23791e63d75e5b15e91aff9b6b87097ae996ff9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/commits/5d4ebe14591f8aca9cbb81b353f5788b4b9e523b","verification":{"payload":"tree 23791e63d75e5b15e91aff9b6b87097ae996ff9f\nparent 82fd95c29b5fe1dfde46a49b2a1ddb63d31e7553\nauthor ojfbot <151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com> 1773865432 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773865432 -0500\n\nchore(skills): rename .claude/commands/ → .claude/skills/\n\n* feat(lean-canvas): align browser-app with Frame shell pattern\n\n- Add CanvasDashboard — top-level MF exposed component with header,\n  thread sidebar toggle, and CondensedChat bar (matches cv-builder layout)\n- Add CanvasCondensedChat — collapsed/expanded floating chat bar using\n  Redux state; routes to /api/canvas/{section}/chat per active section\n- Add CanvasThreadSidebar — session switcher (add / rename / remove)\n- Add chatSlice (messages, draftInput, isLoading, streamingContent, displayState)\n- Add threadsSlice (threads, activeThreadId, sidebarExpanded)\n- Update store with all three slices\n- Update vite.config: MF expose → CanvasDashboard; add @reduxjs/toolkit\n  and react-redux to federation shared list\n- Strip Provider from LeanCanvasGrid — Provider now lives at Dashboard boundary\n- Add onFocus prop to LeanCanvasSectionPanel (ADR-0020 compliant) so active\n  section updates Redux for CondensedChat context routing\n- Add @carbon/icons-react dependency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): fit CanvasDashboard inside shell flex chain\n\nframe-fade-in is display:flex flex-direction:column — the remote must\nparticipate as a flex child. Replace height:100% with flex:1 + min-height:0\non canvas-dashboard and canvas-dashboard-main. Fix canvas-dashboard-grid-wrapper\nto use min-height:0 so it doesn''t overflow. Remove 80vh minHeight in shellMode\n(grid fills parent height via flex). Change CondensedChat from position:sticky\nto a normal flex child (sticky has no scroll context in this layout).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): match exact cv-builder shell embed pattern\n\nCondensedChat: position:fixed bottom-right (right:calc(72px-1rem), width:400px)\n— with-sidebar shifts it left past the 320px panel.\n\nThreadSidebar: Carbon SideNav position:fixed right:1rem, top:calc(48px+0.5rem),\nwidth:320px, slides in/out via transform. Inline styles match cv-builder exactly.\n\nCanvasDashboard: React fragment (not flex container) — wrapper gets\nmargin:36px 72px, margin-top:4.5rem in shell-mode. Heading + sidebar toggle in\nheader row. Grid scroller fills remainder. Same breathing-room layout as\ncv-builder .dashboard-wrapper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(lean-canvas): replace floating CondensedChat with CanvasSidePanel\n\nFloating position:fixed CondensedChat was overlapping the canvas grid and\nmaking it unusable. Replaced with a single right-rail CanvasSidePanel (320px,\nposition:fixed right:0) that contains two tabs:\n\n- Sessions tab: session list (add / rename / switch / remove)\n- Chat tab: full-height conversation with context indicator showing\n  the active canvas section being asked about\n\nClicking a canvas section tile now auto-opens the panel on the Chat tab.\nDashboard wrapper shifts left (margin-right: 320px) when panel is open\nso the grid never hides under the panel.\n\nRemoved: CanvasCondensedChat.tsx/css, CanvasThreadSidebar.tsx\nAdded: CanvasSidePanel.tsx/css\nUpdated: threadsSlice (activePanelTab + setPanelTab), LeanCanvasGrid\n(onSectionFocus prop), CanvasDashboard (drives panel tab via Redux)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): grid fits viewport, symmetric bottom row, icon send buttons\n\nGrid: switch from 5-column (1fr 1fr 1.5fr 1fr 1.5fr) to 6-column\n(repeat(6,1fr)) so Cost Structure and Revenue Streams each span\nexactly 3 columns = 50% width each, meeting at the center line.\n\nLayout: gridTemplateRows ''1fr 1fr auto'' → ''1fr 1fr 1fr'', height:100%\non the grid, overflow:hidden on the scroller. Removes the 80vh minHeight\nthat was forcing the grid past the dashboard panel boundary.\n\nSend buttons: replace Carbon <Button size=\"sm\">Send</Button> on every\ntile with a 2rem×2rem icon-only button (<SendAlt size={16}>) — visually\ncompact and does not crowd the narrow input rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(lean-canvas): sidebar positioning, brand send buttons, card focus UX\n\nSidebar: match cv-builder ThreadSidebar exactly — right:1rem gap from\nviewport edge, transform hides via calc(100%+1rem), visibility transition\nprevents focus bleed while hidden. Dashboard wrapper uses\nmargin-right:calc(320px+2rem) — same formula as cv-builder.\n\nSend buttons: replace custom <button> with Carbon IconButton kind=\"primary\"\nso the brand primary color is applied correctly via Carbon''s token system.\nCSS override (.canvas-section-send-btn) keeps it 2rem×2rem square.\n\nCard click UX: clicking any section tile now focuses its TextInput directly\n(inputRef.current?.focus()). Auto-open-sidebar on card click removed —\nsidebar toggle remains on the header Menu button only. Input row uses\nstopPropagation so interactions inside don''t re-fire tile click.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(skills): rename .claude/commands/ → .claude/skills/\n\nMigrate to normative Claude Code project structure. Real skill symlinks\nmoved from .claude/commands/ to .claude/skills/; .claude/commands is\nnow a backward-compat symlink → skills/ so existing tooling continues\nto resolve without changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuwnYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHZ0QAEMquxqKp1RRcKmPXIbUYf1L\nOG4PyywKTkCNfrtB0pGRGEKR5cV8dcp77724Ylw7iHgC47XFnHSbQ8SgjReb/reR\ngpTbeNPd3pCjWgvkMx5eaIlhgtdTD5GTmPRI8efR/AwrX3KSBBthyA9SBUxxXTUT\nuadSy3w1TKFdd0a1BVTwM1MzgBMg2kDK1iBJbqZOQTtk0Nhv2VWL0kn97YHXQ+8S\nANlPi3rIgdAYxDiNPfXOB6cp39i1pn2p8zE+UQ2iI4FZdY6uz9xPLUBNmp0wRDLh\nsawMxYURvLqpiuLCIMzWbTgC6dX6LJFjMQU0b6Sdxr7Aljw9+Jc4vDGHaQM6akPL\nTGA1B5lZUTSdMlDujuyIOm/cwKIC5EbGXg2EwzLJ0m//l8nLMzXNeOtUD+D3tcY3\n8BLy/lChP2U1LExmypVAEmwCB63/yiuGX3dG5aFwcAzuIAu2J15fhrODjfuJLfPL\nbZyTkuOMCXG6cFAAqZitQIR5wVAwsnEAHftaBpZ6IxI3uPMjrn/mKvPGAgRcZjK3\nfM6WCmZ/prRVPueeBLv+OtARXKNo09cEYCKxPKA5TTfNFiy30MlfF2xMxZAfatYZ\ncVzr0P9PNilZMNYrGlrI2qYiwx4iapN1z920nwk9s4rnrReHXLDVIg1aK1ilVhDh\nbWzSvnktzn93GOHO9jRx\n=vyif\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T20:23:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-f