"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/cab6c88125a99ef92884a7ea5c18d777fb4e6472/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:24:13Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:03:27Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(lean-canvas): match exact cv-builder shell embed pattern\n\nCondensedChat: position:fixed bottom-right (right:calc(72px-1rem), width:400px)\n— with-sidebar shifts it left past the 320px panel.\n\nThreadSidebar: Carbon SideNav position:fixed right:1rem, top:calc(48px+0.5rem),\nwidth:320px, slides in/out via transform. Inline styles match cv-builder exactly.\n\nCanvasDashboard: React fragment (not flex container) — wrapper gets\nmargin:36px 72px, margin-top:4.5rem in shell-mode. Heading + sidebar toggle in\nheader row. Grid scroller fills remainder. Same breathing-room layout as\ncv-builder .dashboard-wrapper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50f06b65d14344291e6b2c6d99c682a932973ba6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/trees/50f06b65d14344291e6b2c6d99c682a932973ba6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/commits/cab6c88125a99ef92884a7ea5c18d777fb4e6472","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commit/cab6c88125a99ef92884a7ea5c18d777fb4e6472","node_id":"C_kwDORo-fFtoAKGNhYjZjODgxMjVhOTllZjkyODg0YTdlYTVjMThkNzc3ZmI0ZTY0NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commit/e5d589b8f8ddfc9dcd484d8a45ddecdc11712fb0","sha":"e5d589b8f8ddfc9dcd484d8a45ddecdc11712fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/e5d589b8f8ddfc9dcd484d8a45ddecdc11712fb0"}],"sha":"cab6c88125a99ef92884a7ea5c18d777fb4e6472","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/cab6c88125a99ef92884a7ea5c18d777fb4e6472"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/e5d589b8f8ddfc9dcd484d8a45ddecdc11712fb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:19:43Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:03:27Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(lean-canvas): fit CanvasDashboard inside shell flex chain\n\nframe-fade-in is display:flex flex-direction:column — the remote must\nparticipate as a flex child. Replace height:100% with flex:1 + min-height:0\non canvas-dashboard and canvas-dashboard-main. Fix canvas-dashboard-grid-wrapper\nto use min-height:0 so it doesn''t overflow. Remove 80vh minHeight in shellMode\n(grid fills parent height via flex). Change CondensedChat from position:sticky\nto a normal flex child (sticky has no scroll context in this layout).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f3bb9bba3aa7d5f397daf9236cdd18ab026cccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/trees/4f3bb9bba3aa7d5f397daf9236cdd18ab026cccd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/commits/e5d589b8f8ddfc9dcd484d8a45ddecdc11712fb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: