","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(lean-canvas): align browser-app with Frame shell pattern\n\n- Add CanvasDashboard — top-level MF exposed component with header,\n  thread sidebar toggle, and CondensedChat bar (matches cv-builder layout)\n- Add CanvasCondensedChat — collapsed/expanded floating chat bar using\n  Redux state; routes to /api/canvas/{section}/chat per active section\n- Add CanvasThreadSidebar — session switcher (add / rename / remove)\n- Add chatSlice (messages, draftInput, isLoading, streamingContent, displayState)\n- Add threadsSlice (threads, activeThreadId, sidebarExpanded)\n- Update store with all three slices\n- Update vite.config: MF expose → CanvasDashboard; add @reduxjs/toolkit\n  and react-redux to federation shared list\n- Strip Provider from LeanCanvasGrid — Provider now lives at Dashboard boundary\n- Add onFocus prop to LeanCanvasSectionPanel (ADR-0020 compliant) so active\n  section updates Redux for CondensedChat context routing\n- Add @carbon/icons-react dependency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd967378bb582ba355979f2e1bf69ec70c076b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/trees/cd967378bb582ba355979f2e1bf69ec70c076b1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/commits/07d6b1b26bb155a06c4d7818b0b12b213b5b2f23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commit/07d6b1b26bb155a06c4d7818b0b12b213b5b2f23","node_id":"C_kwDORo-fFtoAKDA3ZDZiMWIyNmJiMTU1YTA2YzRkNzgxOGIwYjEyYjIxM2I1YjJmMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commit/080e605b1e58ba1687a34f4f4434596625576e69","sha":"080e605b1e58ba1687a34f4f4434596625576e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/080e605b1e58ba1687a34f4f4434596625576e69"}],"sha":"07d6b1b26bb155a06c4d7818b0b12b213b5b2f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/07d6b1b26bb155a06c4d7818b0b12b213b5b2f23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/commits/080e605b1e58ba1687a34f4f4434596625576e69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T01:50:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T01:50:53Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(lean-canvas): Blue Ocean template as initial canvas state + fix API base port\n\nEach section opens with a Blue Ocean Strategy-framed starter prompt as the\nfirst assistant message, guiding users toward value innovation thinking:\n- PROBLEM: top 1-3 problems + nonconsumer lens\n- SOLUTION: eliminate/reduce factors making market unattractive\n- VALUE_PROPOSITION: new value curve, not incremental improvement\n- KEY_METRICS: AARRR per lifecycle stage\n- CUSTOMER_SEGMENTS: early adopters + noncustomers for blue ocean signal\n- CHANNELS: lowest-cost, highest-trust paths\n- COST_STRUCTURE: eliminate/reduce/raise/create (Blue Ocean ERRC grid)\n- REVENUE_STREAMS: pricing models that unlock new demand\n- UNFAIR_ADVANTAGE: what cannot be copied or bought\n\nAlso fixes API_BASE from :3021 → :3026 (corrects the port conflict fix).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6fdb29806ddab5e8820a5a376a41115de43b432","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/trees/b6fdb29806ddab5e8820a5a376a41115de43b432"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/lean-canvas/git/commits/080e605b1e58ba1687a34f4f4434596625576e69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id"