ACCESS_SECRET added to all function env vars\n- Optimization service uses dist/lambda/ path (no src/)\n\nRDS Production Data:\n- 5 databases created: auth_db, products_db, orders_db, delivery_db, reports_db\n- 5 service users with schema grants\n- Seeds: 2 users, 15 products, 12 orders, 6 delivery persons\n- Migrations via bastion host in VPC\n\nScripts:\n- scripts/deploy-lambdas.sh: automated build + package + S3 + deploy\n- Handles Prisma generate, production deps, engine cleanup\n\nVerified endpoints:\n- POST /api/auth/login ✅ (JWT returned)\n- GET /api/products ✅ (15 products)\n- POST /api/orders/optimize-assignment ✅ (Hungarian 438ms)","tree":{"sha":"fb30504a71c1544a959764739d412e2e71741bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/trees/fb30504a71c1544a959764739d412e2e71741bf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/git/commits/e5d9e51c2d0ce4b1e01f4c333055320b6274a800","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/e5d9e51c2d0ce4b1e01f4c333055320b6274a800","node_id":"C_kwDORpF6kdoAKGU1ZDllNTFjMmQwY2U0YjFlMDFmNGMzMzMwNTUzMjBiNjI3NGE4MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vynnydev/fastmeals/commit/187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88","sha":"187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88"}],"sha":"e5d9e51c2d0ce4b1e01f4c333055320b6274a800","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/e5d9e51c2d0ce4b1e01f4c333055320b6274a800"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vynnydev/fastmeals/commits/187ee9598ecba88c318beeb3c9d257215233fb88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T18:51:59Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T18:51:59Z","email":"vmb24house@gmail.com","name":"vmb24"},"message":"docs(readme): add architecture diagrams and update README with AWS/CI sections\n\nREADME v3:\n- Added 7 draw.io diagrams in their respective sections\n- Architecture overview with flow index and inter-service connections\n- Clean Architecture + SOLID as dedicated section with layer diagram\n- Order state machine and creation flow (BPMN with swim lanes)\n- Optimization flow with Hungarian + Haversine visualization\n- AWS infrastructure diagram (VPC, Lambda, ECS, RDS, Redis, MQ)\n- CI/CD pipeline diagram (GitHub Actions workflows)\n- New sections: Infrastructure AWS, CI/CD Pipeline, Swagger URLs\n- Updated project structure with terraform/ and .github/workflows/\n- Terraform and AWS badges added\n- GIF demo placeholder below index\n- Index expanded from 12 to 15 items INSERT INTO collection_pages VALUES('4c900ed9cca8b1c3272ebf6bd231461e4046c656e2a55342b39724f6f3eb99f3','187bbd20d1b6c79b63d64c28b46ceaa29d8a58e97dce5ca6be8653cee1f5f127','{"hasNext":false,"items":[{"author":{"account":{"login":"basabot","providerType":"User"},"email":"g.abrego@proton.me","name":"G.A."},"authoredDate":"2026-10-02T07:34:59Z","committedDate":"2026-10-02T07:34:59Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:14:09.665Z","repositoryId":1183985227,"sha":"9bd5b4671ac517d019476fa7c70e47b45f6958a8"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"basabot","providerType":"User"},"email":"g.abrego@proton.me","name":"G.A."},"authoredDate":"2026-10-01T16:19:18Z","committedDate":"2026-10-01T16:19:18Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:14:09.665Z","repositoryId":1183985227,"sha":"de1d051807dfbb95c58c93add470ee4058ffca40"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"k8-benetis","providerType":"User"},"email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-30T04:46:36Z","committedDate":"2026-09-30T05:16:25Z","committer":{"