starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/commit/04f499c58bcb0a2403fbf02244a70e91125de185","node_id":"C_kwDORpIuS9oAKDA0ZjQ5OWM1OGJjYjBhMjQwM2ZiZjAyMjQ0YTcwZTkxMTI1ZGUxODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/commit/10a4b9da32cf5f4c58773a4acce4dfedf230e023","sha":"10a4b9da32cf5f4c58773a4acce4dfedf230e023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/commits/10a4b9da32cf5f4c58773a4acce4dfedf230e023"}],"sha":"04f499c58bcb0a2403fbf02244a70e91125de185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/commits/04f499c58bcb0a2403fbf02244a70e91125de185"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/commits/10a4b9da32cf5f4c58773a4acce4dfedf230e023/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T12:25:09Z","email":"125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"k8"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T12:25:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test+fix: real backend suite (140) + SDK OrionClient conformance (#7)\n\n* test: shared fixtures (fake Orion world, auth override, client fakes) + SDK floor 0.4.2\n\n* test: query_subscriptions fake returns snapshot (review)\n\n* test: ShadowEngine ground truths (projection, array union, local terrain, self-shading)\n\n17 tests covering calculate_shadow_polygon, calculate_array_shadow, _local_terrain,\nand compute_self_shading. 3 tests currently fail, pinning known engine bugs:\n- degenerate LineString crash on vertical panel at zenith (tilt=90)\n- shadow direction inverted: sun at az=180 casts shadow southward, should be north\n- self-shading height model fails to detect shading at realistic row spacing (5m, el=10)\n\n* fix(shadow): solar ray N/S mirror, degenerate-projection crash, inter-row self-shading model\n\n* fix(shadow): sliver-polygon epsilon guard, E/W direction test, document azimuth-independent inter-row model\n\n* test: AlgorithmEngine — JSON Logic semantics, rotation axis, 7-preset trigger matrix\n\n* docs: document json-logic single-key dict limitation in AlgorithmEngine contract\n\n* test: null-azimuth idiom + zero-tilt falsy hazard (review)\n\n* test: PVEngine sanity (solar position, power bounds, thermal derating)\n\n* test: ElevationService cascade (LiDAR->eu-elevation->fail-safe), dedup, tenant header\n\n* feat: SDK OrionClient adapter — tenant as-is (fixes hyphen tenant bug), URL strip, fragment helpers\n\n* refactor: REST endpoints to SDK OrionClient adapter + REST contract suite (auth matrix, parks, 502 on broker errors)\n\n- Import get_orion, get_entity_or_none, prop, rel from app.services.orion into app.api namespace\n- Migrate 8 endpoints off ContextBrokerClient: GET /status, /signal-sources, /parcels,\n  /parks, /parks/{id}/trackers, POST /parks, PATCH /trackers/{id}/algorithm,\n  PATCH /trackers/{id}/signal-mapping\n- query_entities(type, limit=500) replaces get_entities_by_type; raises -> HTTPException 502\n- get_entity_or_none raises on non-404 -> HTTPException 502; None -> 404 as before\n- append_entity_attrs({name: prop(value)}) replaces update_entity_attribute bool-return\n- create_entity raises on failure instead of returning bool\n- _resolve_signal_mapping(orion, mapping) is the new SDK-based helper\n- _resolve_signal_mapping_legacy(ngsi, tenant_id, mapping) preserves /notify behaviour\n  untouched; marked for removal with next task\n- Add backend/app/services/subscriptions.py stub so conftest monkeypatch does not\n  ImportError before Task 10 implements the module\n- 23 new tests in test_api_contract.py: auth matrix, tenant priority, parks CRUD,\n  tracker status, algorithm + signal-mapping PATCH, 502 on broker down\n- Full suite: 108 passed\n\n* fix: per-request Orion client lifecycle (yield dep + close), narrow broker error handling, read-path 502 + signal-mapping tests\n\n* feat: /notify closed loop — header tenant (Orion sends no JWT), per-tracker fail-safe, idempotence guard, batched POST /attrs via SDK\n\nTenant now from NGSILD-Tenant/Fiware-Service (telemetry-worker pattern) via\nget_notification_tenant — Orion-LD notifications carry no JWT. Migrated the\nloop to the SDK adapter (get_orion + append_entity_attrs), killing the\nhyphen->underscore tenant bug. Per-tracker try/except isolates corrupt\ntrackers from the batch. Idempotence guard (TILT_TOLERANCE_DEG) skips all\nwrites+MQTT when orientation is unchanged so the self-notification loop\nconverges. Single batched POST /attrs replaces 5 sequential updates. Deleted\ndead ContextBrokerClient (app/services/ngsi_client.py) and the legacy signal\nresolver. Added tests/__init__.py so the conftest fakes resolve to one module\nidentity (dual import was leaking class-attribute state).\n\n* fix(notify): intent/state write split — MQTT failure is counted, twin stays truthful, command retries; circular azimuth guard\n\n* feat: SubscriptionRegistrar ensure-on-use — closed loop self-connects per tenant (first SDK registrar consumer)\n\n* test: drop obsolete patch target, make app.api.get_orion patch strict\n\n* docs: correct context_broker_url contract (SDK fallback, subscriptions guard)\n\n* chore: remove dead tenant_utils (carried the underscore normalization this branch kills)","tree":{"sha":"ebfc092ca839c69a8736defc7c249bca15056583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/git/trees/ebfc092ca839c69a8736defc7c249bca15056583"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/git/commits/10a4b9da32cf5f4c58773a4acce4dfedf230e023","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-agrienergy/commit/10a4b9da32cf5f4c58773a4acce4dfedf230e023","node_id":"C_kwDORpIuS9oAKDEwYTRiOWRhMzJjZjVmNGM1ODc3M2E0YWNjZTRkZmVkZjIzMGUwMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-mod